t level. After you sign in your website will automatically connect to 10Web dashboard and you can efficiently use all 10Web products and services from 10Web dashboard.","text_createProfileTitleFromManager":"10 Components to Make Your<br> WordPress Website Better","text_createProfileTitleFromGallery":"10Web Special Offer for Photo Gallery Users","text_welcomeDescFromManager":"After creating your 10Web account, your site will automatically connect to 10Web dashboard from which you can efficiently use all our products and services.","text_welcomeDescFromGallery":"You\u2019re a step away from connecting your website and taking your Photo Gallery experience to the next level. After you create a 10Web account, your website will automatically connect to 10Web dashboard and you can efficiently use all 10Web products and services from 10Web dashboard for free.","text_createAccountFromManager":"Create a 10Web Account and Connect Your Website","text_createAccountButtonFromManager":"Create an Account & Connect","text_createAccountButton":"Get Started for Free","text_welcomeFromManager":"10Web takes website management to a whole new level. Just connect your site and all the essential components of your site \u2013 security to SEO, backups to image optimization \u2013 will appear right at your fingertips.","text_welcomeFromGallery":"We offer a special forever free plan for Photo Gallery users.<br class=\'show\' /> Just register and connect your website to get","text_fromGalleryIoTitle":"Image Optimization Service","text_fromGalleryIoDesc":"With its best-in-class algorithms 10Web gives you an incredible level of image compression and optimization.","text_fromGalleryPerformanceTitle":"Website Performance Check Service","text_fromGalleryPerformanceDesc":"10Web performance tool will scan your site, detect loading issues & provide recommendations to improve website speed.","text_fromGalleryBackupTitle":"100% Secure Cloud Backup Service","text_fromGalleryBackupDesc":"You can automatically backup all the changes on your website and restore with one click when needed. <br class=\'show\'>All backups will be stored in Amazon S3 cloud servers.","text_welcomeDesc":"10Web is made up of<br/> ten essential components<br/> here to help you work & create.!","text_createAccount":"Create an account","text_createProfileFirstName":"First name","text_createProfileLastName":"Last name","text_createProfileCode":"Promo Code","text_emptyCouponCode":"Please enter a valid AppSumo coupon code","text_emptyFirstName":"Please enter a first name.","text_requiredFirstName":"First Name is required.","text_invalidFirstName":"First Name should not contain URL","text_invalidLastName":"Last Name should not contain URL","text_emptyLastName":"Please enter a last name.","text_requiredLastName":"Last Name is required.","text_emptyFullName":"Please enter a full name.","text_emptyMessage":"Please enter a message.","text_createProfileEmail":"Email","text_createProfileWhatWebsiteDoYouBuild":"What are you looking to do?","text_createCardNumber":"Card number","text_createCardNumberDesc":"The (typically) 16 digits on the front of your credit card.","text_createCardExpDate":"Expiration Date (MM/YY)","text_createCardExpDateDesc":"The date your credit card expires, typically on the front of the card.","text_createCardSecurityCode":"CVC","text_createCardSecurityCodeDesc":"The 3 digit (back) or 4 digit (front) value on your card.","text_createCardZipCode":"ZIP CODE","text_createCardZipCodeDesc":"Your postal code","text_createProfileEmailLogin":"Email address","text_createProfileEmailCheckout":"Email address","text_createProfilePromoCode":"Promo code","text_requiredSignUpFor":"This field is required","text_invalidEmail":"Please enter a valid email address.","text_requiredEmailInvite":"Type your email to get an invitation.","text_requiredEmail":"Email Address is required.","text_existEmail":"Email already exists.","text_createProfileBonus_1":"Wow! You get additional","text_createProfileBonus_2":"days of free trial","text_createProfilePassword":"Choose password","text_confirmProfilePassword":"Confirm password","text_invalidPassword":"Password is required.","text_invalidConfirmPassword":"Those passwords didn\'t match. Try again.","text_paymentInfoTitle":"Choose a payment method","text_paymentInfoTitleActivateAccount":"Activate Account","text_paymentInfoInfo":"Choose a payment method below.","text_createProfileCardNumber":"Card number","text_createProfileCardSecurityCode":"CVV/CVC","text_purchaseSummaryTitle":"Purchase summary","text_purchaseTodayCharge":"Today\'s Charge","text_annual":"Annual","text_morePlans":"More plans","text_purchasebillingPeriod":"Billed","text_purchaseNextPayment_1":"First payment will be","text_purchaseNextPayment_2":"on","text_purchaseAgreement_1":"By clicking the button above you agree to","text_purchaseAgreement_2":"10Web Terms of Services.","text_purchaseAgreement_3":"and understand that this is a recurring subscription.","text_purchaseStartButton":"SECURE CHECKOUT","text_loginTitle":"Login","text_loginTitleFromManager":"Connect","text_loginTitleLong":"Login to 10Web","text_verifyPassword":"Verify Password","text_googlePreventDesc":"This account was previously accessed using email <br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' />address and password. Please verify your password to <br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' />enable log in via Google account.","text_loginPassword":"Password","text_loginForgotPassword":"Forgot password","text_loginForgotTitle":"Password reset","text_loginDontHaveAccount":"Don\'t have an account?","text_loginWithAnotherAccount":"Log in with another account","text_loginCreateAccount":"Create your account now","text_forgotPasswordEmailDesc":"Please submit your email address below.<br/> We will email you directions on how to reset<br/> your password.","text_forgotPasswordSubmit":"Submit","text_forgotPasswordGoTo":"Go to Log In","text_resetPasswordTitle":"Write your new<br class=\'db-show-mobile\'/> password","text_resetPasswordNewPassword":"New Password","text_resetPasswordConfirmPassword":"Confirm New Password","text_resetPasswordPasswordNotMatch":"Password and confirm password fields do not match.","text_freeProductsInstalled":"Your plan includes premium versions of free plugins you installed","text_upgradeAll":"Upgrade and Manage","text_upgradePremium":"Upgrade to premium","text_premiumBadge":"Premium","text_installPremium":"Install premium","text_preview":"Preview","text_previewDemo":"Preview Demo","text_edit":"Edit","text_choose":"Choose","text_import":"Import","text_editWebsite":"EDIT WEBSITE","text_importTemplateTitle1":"Importing a Recreated Website<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> or a Template","text_importTemplateDesc11":"You have already imported a recreated website or a website template. A new import of one or the other, will move current posts and the template to trash and you can recover them later on.","text_importTemplateDesc21":"Importing a recreated website or a website template will change your theme to 10Web default. Though there will be no data loss, we recommend you avoid new imports into a live website.","text_importTemplateTitle":"Importing a Website Template","text_importTemplateDesc1":"You have already imported another website template. Importing a new one will move the posts of your current template to trashes without data loss.","text_importTemplateDesc2":"Importing a website template will change your theme to 10Web Default. Even though there will be no data loss, we recommend you avoid importing a website template into a live website.","text_sideBarHi":"Hi","text_sideBarLogOut":"Sign out","text_sideBarWebsites":"Websites","text_sideBarAutomatedMigration":"Automated Migration","text_sideBarMore":"More","text_sideBarAddWebsite":"Add Website","text_tags":"Tags","text_saveTags":"Save","text_assignTags":"Assign Tags","text_managerPlugins":"Plugins","text_managerAddOn":"Add-Ons","text_managerThemes":"WordPress Themes","text_managerThemesShort":"Themes","text_builderTemplates":"10Web Builder","text_support":"24/7 Customer care","text_maintenanceSupport":"Maintenance & technical support","text_customerCare":"Customer care","text_helpCenter":"Help Center","text_ticketStatus":"Ticket status","text_noActivePaymentMethod":"Your have no active payment method.","text_addPaymentMethod":"Add Payment Method","text_noActiveSubscription":"Your have no active subscriptions.","text_chooseSubscription":"Choose subscription plan.","text_subscriptionExpired":"Your subscription has expired. Your activity will be limited.","text_subscriptionRenew":"Renew subscription or choose another plan.","text_alreadySubscribed":"Already subscribed","text_paymentFailed":"Your last payment failed.","text_paymentPaymentInfo":"Review your payment information.","text_webDoradoUser":"You\u2019re a Web-Dorado user, which makes you eligible for additional benefits!","text_ok":"OK","text_extend10webTrial":"Since you\u2019re already using one or more of our plugins, we will extend your 10Web trial period for {{bonusDays}} additional days. Simply check your inbox for an email from us and accept the additional trial days.","text_inactiveWebsites":"Inactive websites","text_managerNotActive":"Manager plugin is deleted/deactivated or your\'re logged out from the plugin","text_emptyPageTitle":"Hi there!","text_emptySearchTitle":"No results","text_noWebsitesDesc":"Seems like you don\u2019t have any websites yet!<br> Please press button below to add and start managing<br> your websites.","text_noWebsitesTrialsDesc":"You don\u2019t have any websites yet. <br>Please add a new website to start managing it.","text_emptySearchDescription":"We did not find any results that match your search criteria.","text_noResultSearch":"There are no results that match your search.","text_manageButton":"Manage","text_siteAdmin":"Site Admin","text_selectAll":"Select All","text_apply":"Apply","text_notThemes":"Please click the button below<br/>to install and start using new themes.","text_addTheme":"Add WP Themes","text_version":"Version","text_newVersion":"New version","text_currentVersion":"Current Version","text_pluginAddOns":"Add-ons","text_getNow":"Get Now","text_featuredPluginAuthor":"WebARX","text_featuredPluginTitle":"WebARX - SECURITY PLATFORM","text_featuredPluginDesc":"WebARX is an all-in-on security platform to protect, monitor and harden all WordPress sites from a single dashboard.","text_install":"Install","text_installFree":"Install free version","text_getPremium":"Get Premium","text_installing":"Installing...","text_extensions":"{{pluginTitle}} extensions","text_plugin-extensions":"extensions","text_upgrade":"Upgrade","text_installed":"Installed","text_freeInstalled":"Free version installed","text_premiumInstalled":"Premium installed","text_availableInPremium":"Available in<br><span>premium bundle</span>","text_update":"Update","text_updateLater":"Later","text_versions":"Versions","text_activate":"Activate","text_networkActivate":"Network Activate","text_deactivate":"Deactivate","text_networkDeactivate":"Network Deactivate","text_deactivateDelete":"Deactivate & Delete","text_updateVersion":"Update to {{version}}","text_updateProcess":"Please wait while the plugin is updating...","text_updateSuccess":"Thank you your plugin is up to date!","text_activateProcess":"Please wait while the plugin is activating...","text_activateSuccess":"Thank you, your plugin is activated!","text_deactivateProcess":"Please wait while the plugin is deactivating...","text_deactivateSuccess":"Your plugin is deactivated!","text_deleteProcess":"Please wait while the plugin is deleting...","text_deleteProcessTheme":"Please wait while the theme is deleting...","text_deleteSuccess":"Your plugin is deleted!","text_deleteSuccessTheme":"Your theme is deleted!","text_cancel":"Cancel","text_saveContent":"Save","text_submitDeactivate":"Submit & Cancel","text_reset":"Reset","text_activated":"Activated","text_moreInfo":"More Info","text_delete":"Delete","text_addPlugins":"Add Plugins","text_addNewPlugins":"Add New Plugins","text_addThemes":"Add WP Themes","text_noProPlugins":"You already have 10Web free plugins installed. <br/>Click the upgrade button to start using the<br/> premium versions included in your plan.","text_statistics":"Statistics","text_cloudStorage":"Cloud Storage","text_lastOptimization":"Last optimization","text_mediaTotalReduced":"Media library\u2019s overall reduction","text_otherDirReduced":"Other directories\u2019 overall reduction","text_total":"Total reduction","text_optimizeNow":"Optimize now","text_imageOptimizer":"Image Optimizer","text_startOptimizingHeader":"Hi 10Webber!","text_startOptimizingDesc":"Optimize your website images to minimize load time and save storage space.","text_startOptimizingDescWidget":"Optimize your website images to minimize load time<br/>and save storage space.","text_enableNow":"Enable Now","text_filesystemPermissions":"filesystem permissions","text_noPermissionDesc":"10web manager plugin does not have filesystem permissions to intall, update and delete products. Please configure your file system connection from <b class=\'color-info\'>config.php</b> file.","text_moreInformation":"More information","text_changeLogHasUpdate":"There is a new <span>{{paidVersion}}</span> version","text_backupTime":"Backup Time","text_scheduledBackup":"Scheduled Backup","text_backup":"Backup","text_scheduling":"Scheduling","text_settings":"Settings","text_backupedOfAvailable":"<span>{{backuped}}</span> of {{available}} used","text_backupedExceededTitle":"You have exceeded your backup storage limit","text_backupedExceededDesc":"Learn how the extra storage is charged.","text_youCanBackup":"Your plan includes <span>{{canBackup}}</span> cloud storage for all your websites.","text_startBackupingHeader":"Welcome to Backup Service!","text_startBackupingHeaderHostedWebsites":"We Automatically Back up Your Site Every Day.","text_startBackuping":"Backup database and files, including plugins,<br> themes and uploaded content with a few simple clicks.","text_startBackupingHostedWebsites":"Each backup will be stored for 10 days.","text_addBackupPlugin":"Enable Backup Service","text_hostingBackup":"Restore Points","text_paymentAmount":"Payment amount","text_invoiceReceipt":"Invoice receipt","text_date":"Date","text_job":"Job","text_jobs":"Jobs","text_logs":"Logs","text_restores":"Restore Points","text_backups":"Backups","text_jobType":"Job Type","text_status":"Status","text_latestBackup":"<span>Latest Backup</span><br/>{{date}}","text_latestBackupWidget":"<span>Latest Backup:</span> {{date}}","text_nextBackup":"Next backup","text_backupSize":"Backup Size","text_backupNow":"Backup now","text_runtime":"Runtime","text_noLogs":"You currently have no logs.","text_manageLogs":"Manage Logs","text_activateBackup":"Activate Backup Plugin","text_type":"Type","text_destination":"Destination","text_next":"Next","text_last":"Last","text_noJobs":"You currently have no jobs.","text_runJob":"Run job","text_manageJobs":"Manage Jobs","text_file":"File","text_folder":"Folder","text_size":"Size","text_restore":"Restore","text_restore_connectionLostTitle":"Website Connection Was Lost","text_restore_connectionLostDesc1":"Please use Restore points to restore your website. If you need further help, please contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'>Customer care team.</a>","text_restore_connectionLostDesc2":"Please restore your website with a zip file. If you need further help, please contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'>Customer care team.</a>","text_restore_download":"Restore / Download","text_restore_notification":"Restoring Website","text_restore_fullWebsites":"Full Website","text_restore_onlyFiles":"Only Files","text_restore_onlyDatabase":"Only Database","text_restorePoint":"You are about to restore <span>{{website}}</span> with the <br><span>{{restorePoint}}</span> restore point.","text_noBackups":"You currently have no backups.","text_manageBackups":"Manage Backups","text_builder":"Builder","text_builderTitle":"10Web Builder based on Elementor","text_builderDesc":"We enhanced Elementor with 30+ advanced widgets and created 40+ awesome website templates for any scenario.<br/> Our pre-built website templates are using super light 10Web blank theme.<br/> Choose your template & start building your website.","text_builderEnableMinorDesc":"10Web Builder & Elementor plugins will be installed on your website","text_builderEnabled":"Builder is enabled.","text_builderCreatePage":"Create page","text_seo":"SEO","text_resourceUsage":"Usage Summary","text_seo-overview":"Overview","text_main":"Main","text_search-analytics":"Search analytics","text_search-console":"Search console","text_addOnsFor":"Add-ons for","text_noPluginWithAddOn":"You have no plugins with add-ons.","text_noAddOnForPlugin":"You currently have no add-ons for this plugin.","text_addAddOns":"Add Add-ons","text_dashboard":"Dashboard","text_done":"Done!","text_installSuccess":"Plugin is installed and activated.","text_installDanger":"An error occurred, please try again later","text_sorryNoAccessToPage":"Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.","text_redirecting":"Redirecting","text_title":"Title","text_maintenanceMode":"This site is maintenance mode.","text_somethingWentWrongDot":"Something went wrong...","text_somethingWentWrong":"Something went wrong","text_successfullyResetPassword":"Your password has been successfully reset. You can now login with your new password.","text_successfullySubscribed":"You have successfully subscribed to 10WEB.","text_successfullyCompleted":"Completed Successfully.","text_successfullyGotBonus":"Got bonuses successfully!","text_successfullyPaymentMethodAdd":"Payment method added successfully.","changeAvatar":"Phone Number","text_changeAvatarGravatar":"<a class=\'db-link\' href=\'https://en.gravatar.com/\' target=\'_blank\'>Add a picture</a>","text_doneAlready":"Done Already?","text_yourPlanRemained":"Available Optimizations","text_yourPlan":"Your Plan","text_youCanOptimize":"Your plan includes <span>{{canOptimize}} image</span> optimizations per month for all websites.","text_alreadyOptimized":"Already optimized","text_images":"images","text_activateNow":"activate now","text_subscriptionSummary":"Subscription summary","text_plan":"plan","text_price":"price","text_billingPeriod":"Billing Cycle","text_nextBillingDate":"Next billing date","text_pauseDate":"Pause date","text_cancelDate":"Cancellation Date","text_manage":"manage","text_cancelSubscription":"Cancel Subscription","text_cancelSubscriptionLTDAdditional":"Cancel Managed WP Hosting Subscription","text_notSubscribed":"Your 10Web subscription has expired.","text_choosePlan":"Choose a plan below to continue using 10Web","text_paymentMethod":"Payment method","text_creditCard":"Credit Card","text_paypal":"PayPal","text_redirectToPaypal":"You will be redirected to the PayPal site after reviewing your order.","text_expirationDate":"Expiration Date","text_pauseExpirationDate":"Pause expiration","text_viewAllBilling":"All payment methods","text_viewLog":"View log","text_info":"[INFO]","text_infoShort":"Info","text_manageEnvironmentShort":"MANAGE ENVIRONMENT","text_stagingEnvironment":"Staging environment","text_stagingEnvironmentDesc":"Test all changes before pushing your website to live\u2024","text_backupwd":"Backup WD","text_phpVersion":"PHP version","text_jobName":"Job Name","text_logFile":"Log file is","text_actionInProgress":"In Progress...","text_completedSuccessfully":"Completed Successfully.","text_periodYearly":"Annually","text_periodMonthly":"Monthly","text_periodSixMonths":"6 Months","text_noManager":"There is no manager installed or not active.","text_planRenewFailed":"Please, check that your billing information is correct and try again","text_localhostWarning":"This website is not reachable, probably it is localhost. Some services may not be available.","text_restoreBackup":"Restore available only for backups stored in 10Web cloud.","text_downloadBackup":"Download available only for Archive backup file type.","text_downloadBoosterPlugin":"DOWNLOAD 10WEB BOOSTER","text_downloadBoosterPluginDesc":"Also available on WordPress.org","text_wontCharge":"You won\'t be charged until your free trial ends.","text_cancelAnytime":"No commitments. Cancel at anytime.","text_addSeoPlugin":"Enable Now","text_startSeo":"Optimize your website content and structure to rank higher.","text_activateSeo":"Activate seo plugin","text_seoUrls":"URLs with {{notFoundUrls}} error","text_seo.queries":"Queries","text_seo.clicks":"Clicks","text_seo.impressions":"Impressions","text_seo.ctr":"CTR","text_seo.position":"Position","text_seo.authorzieAnalytics":"CONNECT TO SEARCH CONSOLE","text_seo.overviewDataDelay":"After authentication It will take some time to show the data. Please check again a few minutes after authentication.","text_seo.analyticsViewAll":"View All Data","text_seo.authorzieConsole":"Authorize","text_seo.consoleViewAll":"View All Data","text_seo.url":"Url","text_seo.redirectUrl":"Redirect url","text_seo.lastCrawled":"Last crawled","text_seo.firstDetected":"First detected","text_noSearchAnalyticsItems":"Connect to Google Search Console to import and monitor search results.","text_noSearchConsoleItems":"There is no search console data available now.","text_worldwide":"Worldwide","text_desktop":"Desktop","text_mobile":"Mobile","text_tablet":"Tablet","text_download":"Download Plugin","text_runSeo":"Run SEO analysis of your site","text_searchAnalytics":"Search analytics","text_authenticateButton":"Authenticate","text_noErrors":"No errors detected","text_authenticate":"To allow to fetch your Google Search Console information, please press the button and Authenticate.","text_authenticateComplete":"Authentication is complete. It may take a while for all your data to show. Please be patient.","text_fixIssues":"Fix issues","text_seoMoz":"SEO Moz Account","text_performance":"Performance","text_performanceMain":"Main","text_performanceScheduling":"Scheduling","text_speed":"Page Speed","text_latestCheck":"Latest Check","text_createdAt":"Created at","text_testedUrl":"Tested URL","text_activatePerformance":"Activate Performance","text_checkPerformance":"CHECK NOW","text_checkPerformanceUrl":"Please check url you typed.","text_performanceNextAutomated":"Next \u0430utomated check: <span>{{date}}</span>","text_runPerformance":"Start testing and analyzing your website performance.","text_performance.performanceGrade":"Performance <br>Grade","text_performance.loadTime":"load time","text_performance.region":"region","text_performance.pageSize":"page size","text_performance.requests":"number of requests","text_performance.page":"page","text_performance.total":"total","text_performance.previousReport":"previous report","text_performance.generatedOn":"generated on","text_performance.pageSpeed":"Page Speed","text_performance.pageSpeedJoined":"PageSpeed","text_performance.pageSpeedRecommendations":"Recommendations","text_performance.pageSpeedType":"Type","text_performance.pageSpeedGrade":"Grade","text_performance.pageSpeedFileSize":"File Size","text_performance.pageSpeedLoadingTime":"Loading Time","text_performance.timeline":"Timeline","text_performance.timelineHeaders":"Headers","text_performance.timelineResponse":"Response","text_performance.timelineDetails":"Details","text_performance.adviceCategoryPerformance":"Performance","text_performance.adviceCategoryBestPractice":"Best Practice","text_performance.adviceCategoryAccessibility":"Accessibility","text_performance.method":"Method","text_performance.fileType":"File Type","text_performance.size":"Size","text_performance.responseHeaders":"Response Headers","text_back":"Back","text_tenweb":"10Web","text_add_website_faq1":"Why do we need your credentials?","text_add_website_answer1":"We need your credentials to install 10Web Manager plugin on your WordPress to connect your site to our unified dashboard from which you can manage literally everything with more ease and convenience. ","text_add_website_faq2":"Why is it secure to share them?","text_add_website_answer2":"10Web is powered by HTTPS protocol which means all your data is encrypted to ensure your privacy and security.","text_add_website_answer21":"10Web Manager plugin is  hosted in the WordPress plugin directory, which means it complies with all the WP standards of security.","text_add_website_answer211":"We do not store your Username and Password.","text_add_website_answer22":"Thousands of users have already trusted us with their info and we have definitely not let them down. ","text_add_website_faq3":"Still not convinced? ","text_add_website_answer3":"It\u2019s fine not to trust us right off the bat. You don\u2019t have to give your credentials. Just change tabs to <a class=\'db-link manually\'>\u201cManually\u201d</a> and follow the instructions. ","text_checkout_coupon_server_error":"This coupon code is invalid or has expired.","text_checkout_coupon_invalid_error":"This coupon code is invalid.","text_checkout_faq_title":"Frequently Asked Questions","text_checkout_faq1":"Why do I need 10WEB?","text_checkout_answer1":"10Web is designed for individuals and businesses that own WordPress websites. We enable you to design and develop your website with no technical skills required. You can subscribe to 10Web Premium bundle to get access to all our premium dashboard, services, plugins and themes, get new released products, updates and premium support for any issue you might have. Or you can choose to use the free account that comes with a unified dashboard and services with certain limitations.","text_checkout_faq2":"Can I try before I buy?","text_checkout_answer2":"Currently, we don\u2019t have a trial, but you can get started with the Starter plan for free, get used to our services and use the free products before upgrading to a premium plan.","text_checkout_faq3":"When will I be billed?","text_checkout_answer3":"If you\u2019re using our Premium Bundle Plan, we automatically bill you at the beginning of each subscription period depending on the plan you\u2019ve chosen during sign-up.","text_checkout_faq4":"Can I buy a single plugin or theme?","text_checkout_answer4":"Yes.We\u2019re aiming to provide a complete set of solutions that our members need for their WordPress websites, but we understand that you might need just one product. If you\u2019re interested in just one plugin or theme, please navigate to the page of that plugin/theme and you\u2019ll be able to purchase just that product. Please note that when purchasing a single product you also get access to our dashboard and services like backup, performance, image optimizer and others at no cost.","text_checkout_faq5":"How can I upgrade?","text_checkout_answer5":"You can upgrade your current plan anytime from your 10Web.io dashboard or by contacting our Customer care team at support@10web.io.","text_checkout_faq6":"What happens when I cancel my acoount?","text_checkout_answer6":"You are free to cancel your membership at any time. Your subscription will be valid until the last day of your billing period, so you can use our services until that time. After that, you will no longer be able to use 10Web services and your access to the dashboard will be blocked. All our plugins and themes are GPL so you can continue using premium plugins and themes even after cancellation.","text_websiteMigrateOnItsWay":"Website cloning<br/> in progress\u2026","text_websiteMigrateZipOnItsWay":"Uploading<br> the zip file\u2026","text_websiteMigrateZipOnItsWayLine":"Uploading the zip file\u2026","text_websiteInactive":"<span>Website disconnected</span>","text_accountSecurity":"Login info & security","text_all-plugins":"All plugins","text_all-themes":"All themes","text_active-plugins":"Active plugins","text_inactive-plugins":"Inactive plugins","text_update-available":"Available updates","text_plugins-scheduling":"Scheduling","text_plugins-scheduling-history":"History","text_