gins? All selected plugins will deactivate and delete for all the websites in this multisite.","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.messageNetwork1":"Are you sure you want to deactivate and delete this plugin? All selected plugins will deactivate and delete for all the websites in this multisite","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.cancelButtonText":"Cancel","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.confirmButtonText":"Deactivate & Delete","text_optimizedOfAvailable":"<span>{{optimized}} images</span> of {{available}} images used","text_reductionInfo":"Reduction up to <span>{{reduction }}%</span>","text_optimizeTypeDescriptionReduction":"{{reductionType}} reduction","text_optimizeTypeDescriptionExif":"Keeps EXIF data","text_optimizeTypeDescriptionFullSize":"Keeps full-sized images","text_optimizeTypeHowItWorks":"<a>How it Works</a>","text_optimizerAutoOptimize":"auto-optimize","text_optimizerAutoOptimizeDesc":"Automatically optimize images upon upload.","text_optimizerAutoOptimizeGall":"Optimize photo gallery","text_optimizerAutoOptimizeGallDesc":"Include Photo Gallery images in optimization list.","text_optimizerNoImagesForOptimize":"No images to optimize","text_optimizerAllImagesOptimized":"All images are optimized and up to date.","text_optimizerReadyToBeOptimized":"Ready for Optimization","text_optimizerTotalReadyToBeOptimized":"<span>{{totalImages}}</span> {{images}}","text_availableOptimizations":"<span>{{availableOptimizations}}</span> in media library ({{notOptimized}} full-sized)","text_availableOptimizationsOther":"<div><span>{{notOptimizedOther}}</span> in other directories","text_optimizerHistoryOriginalSize":"Original size","text_optimizerHistoryFinalSize":"Final size","text_optimizerHistoryReducedBySize":"Reduced by","text_optimizerHistorySeeAll":"see all history","text_optimizerOptimizingTitle":"Optimizing...","text_optimizerOptimizingDescription":"Optimizing","text_optimizerOptimizeSuccess":"Success!","text_optimizerConservative":"Conservative","text_optimizerConservativeDesc":"Up to 20% light reduction","text_optimizerBalanced":"Balanced","text_optimizerBalancedDesc":"Up to 40% lossy reduction","text_optimizerExtreme":"Extreme","text_optimizerExtremeDesc":"Up to 90% significant reduction","text_optimizerBackToMain":"<span class=\'db-go-to-main\'>image optimization</span> / ","text_optimizerHistory":"history","text_optimizerReductionUpTo":"<div><span>Reduction</span> up to<div>{{reductionPercent}}</div></div>","text_optimizerReductionType":"<span>{{type}}</span> reduction","text_optimizerKeepsExif":"Keeps <span>EXIF</span> images","text_optimizerKeepsFullSized":"Keeps <span>Full-sized</span> images","text_optimizerOriginalSize":"<span>Original</span><span>{{size}}</span>","text_optimizerReducedSize":"<span>Optimized</span><span>{{size}}</span>","text_optimizerOptimizedImages":"optimized images","text_selectedPluginsCount":"{{selectedPluginsCount}} plugin(s) selected","text_selectedPluginsCountShort":"{{selectedPluginsCount}} selected","text_selectedIssuesCount":"{{selectedIssuesCount}} selected","text_selectedThemesCount":"{{selectedThemesCount}} theme(s) selected","text_selectedAddOnsCount":"{{selectedAddOnsCount}} selected","text_search":"Search","text_searchPlugins":"Search Plugins","text_searchThemes":"Search Themes","text_uploadFile":"Upload File","text_uploadPluginMessage":"Upload and install .zip format plugin here","text_uploadThemeMessage":"Upload and install .zip format theme here","text_uploadInstalling":"Installing...","text_uploadInstallingMessage":"Your plugin is installing, please wait a few seconds.","text_uploadThemeInstallingMessage":"Your theme is installing, please wait a few seconds.","text_uploadSuccess":"Success!","text_uploadSuccessMessage":"Plugin is installed and activated.","text_uploadFailMessage":"Failed to upload plugin.","text_uploadThemeSuccessMessage":"Theme is installed.","text_uploadThemeFailMessage":"Failed to upload theme.","text_uploadFail":"Error!","text_uploadChooseFile":"Choose File","text_uploadTryAgain":"Try Again","text_activeThemeVersion":"Current version {{version}}","text_themeUpdateProcess":"Updating...","text_themeUpdateSuccess":"Your theme is up to date!","text_themeActivateProcess":"Activating...","text_themeActivateSuccess":"Your theme is activated!","text_started":"Started","text_duration":"Duration","text_checkingPerformance":"Checking a \u201c<span class=\'performance-website-title\'>{{websiteTitle}}</span>\u201d website\'s performance","text_checkingSecurity":"Checking a {{websiteTitle}} website\'s security","text_autoBackup":"Choose the backup schedule that suits your website best.","text_scheduleTitle":"Perfect for","text_scheduleDesc0":"Recommended for static websites","text_scheduleDesc1":"Recommended for websites with low traffic","text_scheduleDesc2":"Recommended for small websites with dynamic content","text_scheduleDesc3":"Recommended for websites  with daily content changes","text_scheduleDesc4":"Recommended for websites which have multiple content changes during a day","text_scheduleDesc5":"Recommended for websites which have hourly content updates","text_settingsStartTime":"Start Time*","text_settingsWeekDay":"Day","text_settingsDesc":"Scheduling uses the main account timezone.","text_settingsDate":"Date","text_settingsBackupScheduled":"Backups scheduled:","text_settingsBackupStartingAt":"Backups starting at:","text_settingsBackupExclude":"Choosing to exclude an option will also delete them from all the previously made backups","text_cancelSubscriptionTitle":"We are sorry to see you go!","text_cancelSubscriptionDesc":"Your feedback is important to us. Please take a minute to let us know<br/>why you are canceling your subscription.","text_amount":"Amount","text_datePaid":"Date paid","text_paidWith":"Paid with","text_invoice":"invoice","text_noPaymentMethodDesc":"Add a payment method to use<br/>10Web paid services","text_deletePaymentMethod":"remove","text_checkingBackup":"Running backup","text_paginationDisplay":"<span>{{firstItemPerPage}}-{{lastItemPerPage}}</span> of {{allItems}}","text_addWebsite":"Add Website","text_addWebsiteHostingTenWeb":"Hosted on 10Web","text_addWebsiteTitle":"Create a New WordPress Website","text_addWebsiteDesc":"Build your website using any theme & plugin,10Web builder and AI assistance.","text_addAnotherWebsite":"ADD ANOTHER WEBSITE","text_addWebsiteTabManually":"Manually","text_addWebsiteTabAutomatically":"Automatically","text_addWebsiteManuallyTitle":"Let\u2019s add a website manually","text_addWebsiteManuallyDescription1":"Please follow the steps below to add a website using 10Web Manager<br/>or","text_addWebsiteManuallyDescription":"The connection between your site and 10Web dashboard is established through 10Web manager plugin,<br>which you need to install either manually or","text_addWebsiteManuallyDescriptionSecond":"Please follow the steps below to add a website manually.","text_addWebsiteManuallySwitchToAutomatic":"add a website automatically.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep1Title":"Download","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep1DescriptionXL":"Download the 10Web<br/>Manager plugin below.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep1DescriptionXXL":"Download the 10Web<br/>Manager plugin below.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep2Title":"Install","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep2DescriptionXL1":"Install the 10Web Manager<br/>plugin in your WordPress<br/>website.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep2DescriptionXXL1":"Install the 10Web Manager<br/>plugin in your WordPress website.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep2DescriptionXL":"Go to your WP dashboard <i>Plugins</i>, click <i>Add New</i>, <br/>search for <a class=\'db-link\' href=\'https://wordpress.org/plugins/10web-manager/\'>10Web Manager</a>, and click <i>Install Now</i>.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep2DescriptionXXL":"Go to your WP dashboard <i>Plugins</i>, click <i>Add New</i>, <br/>search for <a class=\'db-link\' href=\'https://wordpress.org/plugins/10web-manager/\'>10Web Manager</a>, and click <i>Install Now</i>.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep3Title":"Activate","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep3DescriptionXL":"Activate the 10Web Manager<br/>plugin with usual WordPress<br/>activation steps.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep3DescriptionXXL":"Activate the 10Web Manager plugin<br/>with usual WordPress activation steps.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep4Title":"Log in","text_addWebsiteManuallyConnectTitle":"Connect","text_addWebsiteManuallyConnectDescription":"Go to 10Web Manager in your WP dashboard and click <b>Connect</b>.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep4DescriptionXL1":"Log into manager<br/>plugin with your 10Web<br/>user credentials.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep4DescriptionXXL1":"Log into manager plugin with<br/>your 10Web user credentials.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep4DescriptionXL":"Use your 10Web credentials to log into the plugin. ","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep4DescriptionXXL":"Use your 10Web credentials to log into the plugin. ","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep5Title1":"Go to dashboard","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep5Title":"Return to dashboard","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep5DescriptionXL":"Come back to 10Web dashboard to start using our services!","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep5DescriptionXXL":"Come back to 10Web dashboard to start using our services!","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep5DescriptionXL1":"Navigate to 10Web<br/>dashboard to start using<br/>our services.","text_addWebsiteManuallyStep5DescriptionXXL1":"Navigate to 10Web dashboard<br/>to start using our services.","text_addWebsiteDownloadManager":"Download 10web Manager","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallyTitle":"Let\u2019s automate the process.","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallyDescription":"Please enter your WordPress credentials below to<br/> add your website to 10Web dashboard.","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallySecurityInfo":"Please note that we need your admin credentials only for the purpose to install 10Web<br/>Manager plugin on your website. We care about your security and will not store your<br/>admin credentials. Check out more about 10Web Security ","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallySecurityInfoNoWrap":"Please note that we need your admin credentials only for the purpose to install 10Web Manager plugin on your website. We care about your security and will not store your admin credentials. Check out more about 10Web Security ","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallySecurityInfoLink":"here.","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallySwitchToManually":"If you don\'t want to provide your WordPress admin data, you can also choose to install<br/>10Web Manager Plugin ","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallySwitchToManuallyLink":"manually.","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallySecure":"Your details are secure","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallyButton":"Add Website","text_addWebsiteFieldPlaceholderUrl":"http://example.com","text_addWebsiteFieldPlaceholderUsername":"WordPress admin username","text_addWebsiteFieldPlaceholderPassword":"WordPress admin Password","text_confirmEmail":"Please check your email and confirm your email address to activate your account. If you don\'t see the email in your inbox shortly, check your spam folder.","text_emailConfirmed":"Great! Your account is now active. Please login.","text_confirmEmailLogin":"Login attempt limit exceeded, please try again later","text_alreadyHaveAnAccount":"Already have an account?","text_accountRecovery":"Account Recovery","text_signIn":"Sign in","text_checkYourEmail":"Check your email","text_checkYourEmailDesc":"Please check your email to reset your password.","text_resetEmailSent":"We just sent you an email with instructions on how to reset your password and log into your account. If you don\'t see the email in your inbox shortly, check your spam folder.","text_upgradePlanLabel":"your current plan","text_noActivePlugins":"No active plugins","text_noInActivePlugins":"No inactive plugins","text_noUpgradablePlugins":"Your plugins and themes are up to date.","text_noPlugins":"You have not installed any plugins yet!<br/>Please click the button below to install and<br/>start using plugins.","text_managementDashboard":"Unified website management dashboard","text_billingCycle":"Billing cycle","text_oneTimePayment":"One time payment","text_singleDomainCount":"Single product: {{domainCount}}","text_singleProductDomain":"{{domainCount}}","text_bundleDomainCount":"Premium bundle: {{domainCount}}","text_singleProduct":"Single product","text_bundleProduct":"Premium bundle","text_everyMonth":"{{periodNumber}} Months","text_somethingWentWrongLogOut":"Log out","text_somethingWentWrongDesc":"Please contact our <a class=\'db-link\' target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'>customer care team</a>.","text_oops":"Ooops!","text_sorry":"Sorry!","text_pageNotFound":"It seems we couldn\'t find the page you\'re looking for.","text_accountUpgradedHeader":"Congratulations!","text_accountUpgradedDesc":"Your plan has been successfully upgraded.","text_accountExtendedDesc":"Your plan has been successfully extended.","text_accountUpgradedPlatformDesc":"Your plan has been successfully upgraded to {{subscriptionTitle}}<br> <b>You can host {{hostedSites}} at 10Web with:</b>","text_accountUpgradedAppsumoDesc":"You have successfully upgraded to the {{subscriptionTitle}} Plan<br/><b>Your plan includes:</b>","text_accountUpgradedPersonalAdditionalDesc":"Upgrade to the Premium plan and get 2 more hosted websites<br/>and Multisite Support for ${{additionalPrice}}/{{subscriptionPeriod}}.","text_accountUpgradedPremiumAdditionalDesc":"Upgrade to the Agency plan and get 7 more<br/>hosted websites & the White Label feature for ${{additionalPrice}}/{{subscriptionPeriod}}.","text_accountUpgradedAdditionalDesc":"Upgrade to the {{plan}} plan and get {{websites}} more<br/> hosted websites for ${{price}}/{{period}}.","text_accountExtendedNotEnoughDesc":"Your referral credit is not enough for extending the plan.","text_continue":"Continue","text_close":"Close","text_generateCertificate":"ADD CERTIFICATE","text_removeCertificate":"REMOVE CERTIFICATE","text_changePaymentMethodTitle":"Change Credit Card","text_changePaymentMethodFromPaypalTitle":"Change default payment method","text_changePaymentMethodDesc":"Are you sure you want to make this card the default for<br/> collecting additional payments?","text_changeMainPaymentMethodDesc":"Are you sure you want to make this card<br/>the main payment method?","text_changeMainPaymentMethodCardDesc":"Are you sure you want to change your<br/>default payment method?","text_goHome":"Go Home","text_removePaymentMethodTitle":"Remove payment method","text_removePaymentMethodDesc":"Are you sure you want to remove this payment method?","text_reconnect":"Reconnect","text_inactiveWebsiteTitle":"Reconnect Your Website","text_inactiveWebsiteDesc":"To use 10Web plugins and services, please reconnect your website.","text_inactiveWebsiteFirstStep":"Please make sure that 10Web Manager plugin is installed and activated in your WordPress site dashboard.","text_inactiveWebsiteSecondStep":"Please make sure you\u2019re logged-in in Manager plugin with your 10Web credentials.","text_inactiveWebsiteStillDisconnected":"If your website fails to reconnect, contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'>customer care team.</a>","text_updatePaidversion":"Update to {{paidVersion}}","text_getPremiumPlugin":"Get more features and higher service limits by upgrading to a plan that better suits your needs.","text_contactUsTitle":"Contact Us","text_contactUsDesc":"Contact our team anytime to receive support for 10Web products. Our customer care representatives will contact you within 24 hours (except on Sundays and holidays).","text_sendMessage":"send message","text_domainsExceededTitleDialog":"You exceeded the limit<br/> of websites.","text_domainsExceededUpgradeToPaid":"Upgrade to a paid plan to create or migrate more websites.","text_domainsExceededUpgradeToHigher":"Upgrade to a higher plan to create or migrate more websites.","text_domainsExceededContactOwner":"To host more websites, please contact the workspace owner.","text_domainsExceededBuyAdditional":"Buy additional sites to create, migrate or optimize<br/> more websites.","text_domainsExceededDescDialog":"You can upgrade to a higher plan to host more websites at 10Web.","text_domainsExceededDescDialogGoogleScore":"Please upgrade to be able to host more websites at 10Web.","text_domainsExceededDescDialogGoogleScoreAdditional":"Please add a website to to be able to host more websites at 10Web.","text_domainsExceededDescDialogStarter":"Create a super optimized website hosted at 10Web","text_domainsExceededTitle":"Website limit exceeded","text_domainsExceededDescription":"You have exceeded the limit of websites you can add with your current plan.<br/>Seems like it\'s time to upgrade! Click on the button below to check out 10Web plans and upgrade.","text_welcomeDialogTitle":"Welcome to 10Web !","text_welcomeDialogSingleProductDesc":"Single Product plan - {{pluginName}} Premium is all yours.<br>Having you on board is picture-perfect.","text_welcomeDialogDesc":"You\u2019re right in the middle of our vision for how websites should be<br> created and run. We\u2019re psyched to have you on board and can\u2019t wait to<br> show you around.","text_welcomeDialogSingleProductTitle":"To start using the plugin you purchased:","text_welcomeDialogFirstStep":"add a new website (no fuss, we\u2019ll tell you how, if anything)","text_welcomeDialogSecondStep":"install the plugin from 10Web dashboard\u2019s plugin page","text_letsStart":"LET\'S EXPLORE","text_letsGetStarted":"LET\'S GET STARTED","text_steps":"Step {{stepNumber}}","text_createWebsite":"How do you want to proceed?","text_installNewWebsite":"Create a Brand New WordPress Website","text_installWebsiteActivationFlow1":"Build your website using any theme & plugin,<br/> 10Web builder and AI assistance.","text_installNewWebsite2":"Migrate Your Website","text_installWebsiteActivationFlow2":"Automatically create an optimized copy of<br/> your website on 10Web Hosting.","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithoutAdditional":"Create a New Website on 10Web Hosting","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithAdditional":"Build a Website on 10Web Hosting","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithoutAdditionalDesc":"Build a website with AI assistance on Automated WP Hosting<br/>powered by Google Cloud at the fixed price of $72/year","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithoutAdditionalDescMonth":"Build a website with AI assistance on Managed WP Hosting <br>powered by Google Cloud at the fixed price of $6/month","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithAdditionalDesc":"Host on 10Web Manged WordPress Hosting<br/>powered by Google Cloud","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithAdditionalExceededDesc":"Hosted website limit reached. To host more sites, please upgrade.<br/>Get an additional hosted website for ${{price}}/year.","text_installNewWebsiteLTDWithAdditionalExpiredDesc":"Your hosting has expired. To continue using 10Web hosting<br/>you need to renew the payment.","text_installNewSubWebsite":"Add new site to multisite network","text_notHaveHosting":"Host on 10Web Automated hosting. Take advantage of our AI Website Builder with AI assistance.","text_notHaveHostingAdditional":"You\u2019ve exceeded the limit of your hosted websites.<br/> Upgrade to a higher plan to be able to host more websites at 10Web.","text_notHaveHostingAdditionalConnected":"You\u2019ve exceeded the limit of your connected websites.<br/> Upgrade to a higher plan to be able to connect and manage<br/>more websites on 10Web.","text_notHaveHostingAdditionalConnectedAI":"You\u2019ve reached the limit of recreated websites.<br/>To recreate more websites, please upgrade.","text_notHaveConnectedAdditional":"You\u2019ve exceeded the limit of your connected websites.<br/>To be able to install your <b>{{pluginTitle}}</b> plugin in a new<br/>website, you need to upgrade to a higher plan.","text_notHaveConnectedAdditionalBundle":"You\u2019ve exceeded the limit of your connected websites.<br/>To be able to install your plugin bundle in a new website,<br/>you need to upgrade to a higher plan.","text_haveHostingAdditionalBuyNow":"You\u2019ve exceeded the limit of your hosted websites.<br/> To be able to create another website you need to buy an additional site.","text_haveHostingAdditionalContactUs":"You\u2019ve exceeded the limit of your connected websites.<br/> To be able to connect another website contact our support team.","text_haveAdditionalTooltip":"The payment amount is calculated based on the remaining period of your current subscription plan.","text_addYourWebsite":"Connect/Migrate your website","text_automaticallyCreateOptimized":"Automatically create an optimized copy of your website <br> on 10Web Hosting.","text_exceededLimitConnected":"You\'ve exceeded the limit of your connected websites.<br/> Upgrade to be able to connect and manage more websites on 10Web.","text_haveHosting":"Connect to 10Web dashboard to use our services. You can also test<br/> your current website\'s speed on our hosting and then migrate.","text_addYourWebsiteLimit":"Connected websites limit exceeded.","text_migrate":"Migrate","text_migrateAgain":"Migrate Again","text_migrateLoadingMessage":"<div>A Copy of Your Website <br/>is Being Automatically Created</div><span>Depending on the size of your website, processing may take a little while. You will be notified via email as soon as your website is ready</span>","text_migrating":"Migrate your site to 10Web cloud hosting with just a few clicks. <a class=\'db-link db-more-info-link\' href=\'https://10web.io/blog/how-do-i-migrate-my-wordpress-website-to-10web/\' target=\'_blank\'>Learn more</a>","text_changeBillingCycle":"Change billing cycle","text_activateSubscription":"Activate subscription","text_unpauseSubscription":"Unpause subscription","text_activateSubscriptionLTDAdditional":"Activate Automated WP Hosting Subscription","text_renewSubscriptionLTDAdditional":"Renew Automated WP Hosting Subscription","text_CancelSubscriptionLTDAdditional":"Cancel Automated WP Hosting Subscription","text_save":"save {{percent}}%","text_addWebsiteLogin":"Please enter a valid username.","text_addWebsitePassword":"Please enter a valid password.","text_addWebsiteDomain":"Please enter a valid domain.","text_addWebsiteWatchVideo":"WATCH VIDEO","text_cycleData":"Pay 6 Months ( ${{price}} / every 6 months )","text_cycleDataInactive":"Pay 6 Months","text_payNow":"Pay now","text_payNowTotal":"Total","text_noMoneyUntilUpgrade":"No money will be charged until you upgrade.","text_emptyOptimizedImages":"No optimized images","text_successfullySaved":"Successfully saved","text_proratedCredit":"Prorated credit","text_proratedCreditDesc":"Prorated credit is generated in case of a plan upgrade. When the customer upgrades his/her plan in the middle of a billing cycle, they are only charged for the time they have used 10Web services, rather than for a complete billing cycle. For ex. if a customer decides to switch to a higher plan before their billing cycle expires, they receive a credit for the unused portion of the old plan and are billed for only the remainder of the new plan.","text_everySingleMonth":"Every month","text_userSummariesStarter":"Upgrade now and keep enjoying your super fast website!","text_userSummariesBackupTitle":"Backup storage","text_userSummariesBackupText":"For all websites.","text_userSummariesIoTitle":"Image Optimization","text_userSummariesIoText":"Per month for all websites.","text_userSummariesHostingBlockTitle":"Hosting Resources","text_userSummariesHostingText":"Hosted websites: {{out}} out of {{of}}","text_userSummariesHostingVisits":"Visitors <span class=\'used_visits\'>{{visits}}</span> out of <span>{{totalVisits}}</span>","text_userSummariesHostingStorage":"Storage <span class=\'used_storage\'>{{storage}}</span> out of <span>{{totalStorage}}</span>","text_userSummariesAiGenerations":"Website generations <span class=\'used_gens\'>{{usedCount}}</span> out of <span>{{totalCount}}</span>","text_HostingDatabaseStorage":"<span class=\'sl-hosting-resource-storage-database\'>{{storage}}</span> Database","text_HostingFilesStorage":"<span class=\'sl-hosting-resource-storage-files\'>{{storage}}</span> Files","text_HostingTotalVisits":"<span class=\'sl-hosting-visit-count\'>{{visits}}</span><br/> Visitors","text_HostingTotalStorage":"Total <span>{{storage}}</span>","text_HostingTotalStorageByWebsite":"<span class=\'sl-hosting-resource-storage-total\'>{{storage}}</span><br/>Total","text_seoWidgetInactiveDesc":"Optimize your website content<br/>and structure to rank higher.","text_backupWidgetInactiveDesc":"Schedule automatic real-time backups<br/>for your content, database, and files.","text_optimization":"Image Optimizer","text_optimizerWidgetInactiveDesc":"Start scanning for vulnerabilities and suspicious <br>file changes to safeguard your website.","text_performanceWidgetInactiveDesc":"Start testing and analyzing your website performance.","text_performanceGrade":"performance grade","text_performancePageLoadTime":"page load time","text_performanceTotalPageSize":"total page size","text_updates":"Plugin & Theme Update","text_updateAll":"Update All","text_pluginsUpdate":"plugins update ({{count}})","text_themesUpdate":"themes update ({{count}})","text_wordpressCoreUpdate":"WordPress Update","text_wordpress":"WordPress {{version}}","text_currentVersionWithVersion":"Current version {{version}}","text_updatePlugin":"Update plugins","text_confirmUpdate":"Are you sure you want to update","text_confirmUpdateAll":"Are you sure you want to update all selected plugins","text_wordpressUpToDate":"Your WordPress is up to date.","text_hosting.title":"Hosting services","text_hosting.info":"Credentials","text_hosting.domains":"Domains","text_hosting.domainNotPointed":"Point Domain","text_hosting.resource-usage":"Resource usage","text_hosting.visit-analytics":"Site Visits","text_hosting.tools":"Tools","text_hosting.redirects":"Redirects","text_hosting.removeRedirects":"Remove Redirects","text_hosting.cdn":"CDN","text_hosting.logs":"Logs","text_hosting.manage_environment":"Manage environment","text_hosting.restore":"Restore points","text_removeDemoWebsite":"Remove website","text_removeDemoWebsiteBtn":"Remove","text_removeDemoWebsiteDesc":"By removing your website you will lose full access to<br/> 10Web dashboard and won\u2019t be able to edit your website.","text_removeWebsite":"Do you want to remove your website?","text_removeMultiWebsite":"Do you want to remove your multisite?","text_typeRemoveWebsiteMakePrimary":"To make your domain primary, please enter your password","text_typeRemoveWebsiteMakePrimaryTrials":"To make your domain primary, please enter \'REMOVE\'","text_typeRemoveWebsite":"To remove your website, please enter your password","text_typeRemoveMultiWebsite":"To remove your multisite, please enter your password","text_hostedWebsiteAfterRemoveWillLost":"Be careful! Removing your website from the dashboard will result in:","text_hostedMultiWebsiteAfterRemoveWillLost":"Be careful! Removing your multisite from the dashboard will result in:","text_areYouSureToRemove1":"Be careful! When you remove your website from the dashboard, you will not be able to:","text_areYouSureToRemove2":"Be careful! When you remove your multisite from the dashboard,<br/> you will not be able to:","text_imageOptimizationLimit":"Image optimization limit","text_imageOptimizationLimitNumber":"You have almost reached your plan\'s optimization limit. <br>You can optimize <span>{{canOptimize}} {{optimizableImages}}</span> of selected <span>{{selectedImages}} {{images}}.</span>","text_yesOptimize":"yes, optimize","text_backupLimit":"Backup cloud limit","text_backupNumber":"You have almost reached your plan\'s backup cloud limit. <br>To make more backups you need do upgrade your plan.","text_yesRemove":"Yes, Remove","text_environmentType":"<span class=\'capitalize\'>{{type}}</span> <span>environment</span>","text_hostingBasicInfoLocation":"Location / Data Center","text_hostingBasicInfoIp":"IPv4<br> Address","text_hostingBasicInfoIp6":"IPv6<br> Address","text_hostingBasicInfoPath":"Path","text_hostingBasicInfoExternalIp":"Current External IP Address","text_hostingSftpHost":"SFTP Host","text_hostingSftpUsername":"SFTP Username","text_hostingSftpPassword":"SFTP Password","text_hostingSftpPort":"SFTP Port","text_hostingDatabaseName":"Database Name","text_hostingDatabaseUsername":"Database Username","text_hostingDatabasePassword":"Database Password","text_hostingDatabaseSftp":"Generate New SFTP Password","text_hostingDatabaseButton":"Open MySQL","text_hostingBasicInfoTitle":"Datacenter & IP","text_hostingSftpTitle":"SFTP","text_hostingDatabaseTitle":"Database Access","text_hostingSSHTitle":"SSH Connections","text_hostingSSHDesc":"Use the following command in the terminal<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'> to connect to your site via SSH","text_hostingSSHPassword":"SSH Password","text_hostingSSHCommandLine":"Command Line","text_environment":"{{environment}}","text_liveChangesDesc":"Changes made here will affect your live website.","text_stagingChangesDesc":"Test all changes before pushing your website to live\u2024","text_hostingPushToLive":"Push to Live","text_hostingPushStagingToLive":"push staging to live","text_hostingPushToLiveDescription":"Pushing to live will overwrite your live site. We\u2019ll create a backup for you just in case.","text_hostingSyncWithLive":"Sync with Live","text_hostingSyncStagingWithLive":"sync staging with live","text_hostingSyncStagingWithLiveDescription":"Syncing with live will overwrite your staging site.","text_hostingSyncWithLiveDialogHeader":"Sync with Live","text_hostingSyncWithLiveDialogMessage":"<span>Attention:</span> Are you sure you want to copy your live website to the staging environment and overwrite your current staging site? Depending on the size of your website, syncing may take a few minutes.","text_hostingDomainsDescription":"Your primary domain is the way we refer to this site and should usually be set to the main domain you would like your visitors to arrive though. The DNS records for the primary domain must be set up correctly for it to work.","text_copied":"Copied","text_copy":"Copy","text_proceed":"Proceed","text_startFromBooster":"Start","test_syncToLive":"Sync With Live","text_confirmGenerateSftpPassword":"Please note that after generating the new password the old password will expire.","text_generateSftpPassword":"Generate New SFTP password","text_generateMySqlPassword":"Generate New MySQL password","text_generate":"generate","text_confirmSubdomain":"Enter \u201c{{siteUrl}}\u201d","text_domainNameWrong":"Site name does not exist","text_domainNameWrongValidation":"Please fill correct site name.","text_pushStagingEnvironmentLive":"Push Staging Environment Live","text_pushStagingConfirmDesc1":"<span class=\'danger\'>Attention:</span> By clicking on proceed, your staging site will be copied to the live environment and will overwrite your current live site. Depending on the size of your website, this process may take a few minutes. <br/>A backup of your live site will be made before pushing the staging<br> site to production.","text_pushStagingConfirmDesc2":"When you push your staging site to live, all the <span class=\'sl-website-link\'>{{websiteLink}}</span> URLs will be changed to your primary domain\u2019s - <span>{{domainName}}</span> - URLs. Click here if you need to change your primary domain.","text_pushStagingConfirmDesc3":"We\u2019ll backup your live site before pushing the staging to production, in case you need to restore the older version of your site.","text_pushStagingConfirmDesc4":"In case you want to proceed, type your site\'s name in the field below, then click on the Push To Live button.","text_pushToLiveInfoTooltipDesc":"When you\'ve made all the changes in your staging environment, it\'s time to push the changes to live. Pushing your staging environment to live means that your staging site will be copied to the live environment and will overwrite your current live site.","text_getMoreInfo":"Get more info","text_credentials.IP.desc":"Your datacenter should be close to most of your website visitors","text_credentials.Database.Desc":"10Web uses the most optimized version of MySQL for your WordPress. You have full access to your website database.","text_credentials.SSH.Desc":"SSH( Secure Socket Shell), is a network protocol that gives you a secure way to access a website over an unsecured network. SSH provides strong password authentication and public key authentication, as well as encrypted data communications between your computer and website connecting over the public internet.","text_howToUseSftpInfoTooltipTitle":"How to use SFTP","text_howToUseSftpInfoTooltipDesc":"SFTP(Secure File Transfer Protocol) is a secure file transfer protocol. SFTP has pretty much-replaced legacy FTP.","text_howToUseSftpInfoTooltipDescShort":"SFTP or Secure File Transfer Protocol is a network protocol used for file transfers. It is a more secure method vs standard FTP.","text_howToUseDbInfoTooltipDescShort":"Database access provides credentials for MySQL database including name, username and password.","text_invalidUsername":"Please enter a valid username.","text_dialogStep":"Step {{step}}","text_installWebsiteDialogDesc":"Install a brand new WordPress website","text_installAdditionalHostedSites":"Additional Hosted Sites","text_installWebsiteDialogTitle":"Subdomain","text_installSubWebsiteDialogTitle":"SITE ADDRESS (URL)","text_installSubWebsiteDialogDesc":"Only lowercase letters (a-z), numbers, and hyphens are allowed.","text_installSubWebsiteDialogInformation":"A new user will be created if the above email address is not in the database.<br/>The username and a link to set the password will be mailed to this email address.","text_autoMigrate":"Automatic Migration","text_autoMigrateDesc":"With 10Web you won\u2019t lose any time migrating your site. We have built a fully <strong>automated migration</strong> service, so you can get your website on <strong>10Web hosting</strong> in minutes. We\u2019ll assign a temporary domain to your migrated site, so you can make <strong>performance comparisons</strong> with your current hosting and ultimately move to 10Web. Read our article on how to migrate your site <a href=\'http://10web.io/cloud-hosting/\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a>.","text_domainWithTitle":"Domain","text_domainWithDescription":"Add your domain if you already have one or add it later on.","text_regionDescription":"Choose location/data center","text_regionDescriptionOther":"Please choose datacenter for your website","text_siteLanguage":"SITE LANGUAGE","text_domainCheckboxDescription":"Automatically add the suitable Zone for this domain.","text_subDomainDescription":"Your site will be accessible at this address by default.","text_regionTooltip":"Choose the location </br>based on your traffic.","text_hostingUrlDescription":"Enter the URL and access details to your hosting panel below.","text_installMultisite":"Should we install multisite?","text_installMultisiteType":"What type of multisite should we install?","text_installMultisiteSubdirectory":"Subdirectory","text_installMultisiteSubdomain":"Subdomain","text_congrats":"Congrats","text_domainAdded":"Domain Added to Your Site","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessDesc":"Now you have a website on 10Web Automated hosting<br/> powered by Google Cloud. From here on, it gets so much better.","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessDescWithNameserverScore":"Your super fast website is installed on 10Web Automated WP Hosting","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessDescWithNameserver":"You just installed your site on 10Web managed hosting powered by Google Cloud.","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessDescWithNameserverBottom":"Now you have to replace the default nameservers at your<br/> domain registrar with 10Web\u2019s nameservers. <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/blog/how-do-i-point-my-domain-to-10web/\' class=\'db-link\'><span>Learn More</span></a>","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessDescWithNameserverTop":"You just installed your site on 10Web hosting.","text_goToWebsite":"go to website","text_nameServers":"nameservers","text_letsAutomate":"Let\u2019s automate the process.","text_addWebsiteDialogDesc":"Please enter your website info below to add it to 10Web dashboard.","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogTitle":"Connecting Your Website","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogTitleNew":"Copying Your Website","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogDesc":"Please follow the steps below. <a href=\'https://10web.io/blog/how-to-connect-your-website-to-10web/?_ga=2.123594702.414440633.1555651362-887026015.1532949577#manual\' target=\'_blank\' class=\'db-link\'><span>Learn more</span></a>","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogStep1Desc":"Download the plugin below.","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogStep2Desc":"","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogStep3Desc":"And activate it.","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogStep4Desc":"Use your 10Web credentials to log into the plugin. ","text_addWebsiteManuallyDialogStep5Desc":"Come back to 10Web dashboard to start using our services!","text_addWebsiteAutomaticallyDesc":"Just tell us your website\u2019s URL, username, and password and you\u2019re set.","text_addWebsiteManuallyDesc":"In case you sure know how to install a plugin on your own.","text_domainsShort":"Domains","text_hostingDomainsManagePrimaryDesc":"The primary domain is the main address for your site.<br/>Set it to the domain you would like your visitors to arrive through.<br/>Please make sure the DNS records for the primary domain are correct.","text_hostingDomainsManageDNS":"manage dns","text_hostingDomainsManageAll":"manage all","text_hostingDomainsManagePrimaryTitle":"primary domain","text_hostingDomainsManageAllDesc":"Your primary domain is the way we refer to this site and should usually be set to the main domain you would like your visitors to arrive though. The DNS records for the primary domain must be set up correctly for it to work.","text_hostingDomainsAdditionalDomainsTitle":"additional domains","text_hostingDomainsAdditionalDomainsDesc":"Point your other domains to 10Web hosting.<br/>Please make sure the DNS records for additional domains are set up correctly.","text_hostingDomainsAddDomain":"add domain","text_manageDnsShort":"Manage DNS","text_makePrimary":"Make Primary","text_confirmDomainNameRemove.header":"Remove domain","text_confirmZoneRemove.header":"Remove zone","text_confirmMakePrimary.header":"Change of primary domain","text_confirmDomainNameRemove.message":"Your site will no longer be accessible through <b>{{domainName}}.</b><br/> It will still be accessible through your other domains.","text_confirmDomainNameRemove.cdnMessage":"Cloudflare integration for this domain will be automatically disabled after removal.","text_confirmZoneRemove.message":"Your site will no longer be accessible through this zone.","text_confirmMakePrimary.message":"<b>{{domainName}}</b> will become your primary domain, the main address for your site.","text_confirmMakePrimaryNotPointed.message":"Changing the primary domain without pointing <b>{{domainName}}</b> to 10Web is not recommended. Please make sure that DNS records for your site are configured correctly.","text_confirmMakePrimaryNotPointed.message1WF":"Changing the primary domain without pointing <b>{{domainName}}</b> to 10Web is not allowed. Please make sure that DNS records for your site are configured correctly.","text_confirmMakePrimary.button":"Confirm","text_addDomainDesc":"Point your domain to set it as a URL people can use to visit your website.","text_addZoneDesc":"Add a domain name to manage via 10Web DNS. Once a domain has been added we\u2019ll generate Amazon Route 53 Nameservers for it and you can start adding zone records.","text_addDomainTitle":"Add a domain","text_tools":"Tools","text_clearSiteCache":"Website cache","text_clearSiteObCache":"Object cache","text_enableClearCacheDesc":"Use caching to improve website load times <br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'>by storing server responses for faster access and reduced server load.","text_enableClearObCacheDesc":"Enhance website performance by caching <br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'>frequent, resource-intensive database queries, reducing access times and server load.","text_enableHttps":"SSL certificates","text_enableHttpsDesc":"Generate a free SSL or add your custom certificate.<br/>Free SSL certificates are generated using the <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://letsencrypt.org/\' class=\'ds-link-blue\'><span>Letsencrypt</span></a> service.","text_enableHttpsDescTrial":"To generate a free SSL or add your custom certificate, please point your domain to 10Web.<br/>Free SSL certificates are generated using the <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://letsencrypt.org/\' class=\'ds-link-blue\'><span>Letsencrypt</span></a> service.","text_phpEngine":"PHP version","text_phpEngineDesc":"You can change the version of the PHP here.The latest versions of PHP have better performance.","text_restartPhp":"Restart PHP","text_restartPhpDesc":"Here you can restart the PHP.<br> This action is useful when you get PHP crashes or 502 Bad Gateway errors.","text_phpConfig":"PHP configuration settings","text_phpConfigDesc":"Adjust the parameters below according to your needs, up to triple the default limits.<br> These settings help you fine-tune performance and resource usage for your application.","text_changeMainDomainExtension":"Change Main Domain Extension","text_changeMainDomain":"Change Main Domain","text_changeMainDomainDesc":"Modify your website\'s subdomain\'s domain extension, provided by 10Web","text_clearCache":"Clear Cache","text_clearObCache":"Clear Cache","text_clearCacheDesc":"Completely clear your website\u2019s server-side cache. <br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'>Pages will be cached again after the first visitor opens them.","text_clearObCacheDesc":"Completely clear your website\u2019s object cache. <br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'>Cached data will refresh with new queries after clearing.","text_changePhpEngine":"Change PHP Version","text_confirmRecordRemove.message":"Are you sure you want to remove record?","text_confirmRecordRemove.header":"Remove Record","text_redirects":"URL Redirects","text_addRedirect":"Add a Redirect","text_updateRedirect":"Update Redirect","text_redirectTo":"redirect to","text_redirectFrom":"redirect from","text_statusCode":"status code","text_confirmRedirectRemove.message":"Are you sure you want to delete this rule?","text_confirmRedirectRemove.header":"Delete Redirect Rule","text_bulkImport":"Bulk Import","text_exportCsv":"Export to CSV","text_uploadCsv.message":"Upload a CSV file. The CSV should have the following fields separated by commas:  status code(301 or  302), domain (all for all domains), redirect from URL, redirect to URL. Each redirect rule should be placed on a new line.","text_uploadCsv.header":"Import URL Redirects","text_emptyRedirectsTable":"There is no redirect rules","text_unavailablePluginDownload.bundleTitle":"Your Site is Unavailable Right Now","text_unavailablePluginDownload.installFailedTitle":"Product Installation Failed","text_unavailablePluginDownload.bundleDescription":"<div>Contact our customer care <a class=\'db-link\' (click)=\'contactUs()\'>here</a> to get it fixed ASAP.</div> <div>In the meantime, you can <a class=\'db-link\' (click)=\'downloadList()\'>download</a> the premium product(s) you purchased here.</div>","text_refresh":"Refresh","text_websiteUnavailable":"<span>Website is unavailable</span>","text_websiteDemoFlowNotFinish":"You didnt finish your website setup","text_websiteDemoCompleteSetup":"Complete Your Site Setup","text_websiteDemoCompleteSetupProgress":"We\u2019re preparing your site ...","text_importRedirects":"import redirects","text_hostingEmptyLogs":"There are no logs","text_cloud_hosting":"10Web Cloud Hosting","text_security":"Security","text_noSecurity":"Protect your website from vulnerabilities<br/>and suspicious file changes.","text_runScan":"Run Scan","text_hostingRestorePoints":"We automatically backup your site every day and before specific important actions. We keep up to 10 restore points with a limit of 20 GB.<br/> To allow for more restore points, please enable the Backup services.","text_hostingEmptyRestores":"There are no restore points.","text_emptyRedirectsTitle":"Add URL Redirect","text_editRedirectsTitle":"Edit Redirect Rule","text_emptyRedirectsHeader":"Hi 10Webber!","text_emptyRedirectsDesc":"URL Redirects (forwarding), is a technique for making a<br/>web page available under more than one URL address.<br/>Add redirect rules to avoid error pages and duplicates.","text_invalidRedirectFrom":"Please fill valid value","text_done_short":"Done","text_resource_usage":"Resource Usage","text_addWebsiteDialogAutoFaq1":"Why do we need your credentials?","text_addWebsiteDialogAutoAnswer1":"We need your credentials to install 10Web Manager plugin on your WordPress to connect your site to our unified dashboard from which you can manage literally everything with more ease and convenience.","text_addWebsiteDialogAutoFaq2":"Why is it secure to share them?","text_addWebsiteDialogAutoAnswer2":"10Web is powered by HTTPS protocol which means all your data is encrypted to ensure your privacy and security.<br/><br/>10Web Manager plugin is  hosted in the WordPress plugin directory, which means it complies with all the WP standards of security.<br/><br/>Thousands of users have already trusted us with their info and we have definitely not let them down. ","text_addWebsiteDialogAutoFaq3":"Why do I need to install 10Web Manager plugin?","text_addWebsiteDialogAutoAnswer3":"Because the connection between your site and 10Web dashboard is established through 10Web manager plugin.","text_wordpressInstallationSiteTitle":"SITE TITLE","text_wordpressInstallationSiteTitlePlaceholder":"Jim\'s blog","text_wordpressInstallationAdminUserName":"ADMIN USERNAME","text_wordpressInstallationAdminPassword":"ADMIN PASSWORD","text_wordpressInstallationAdminEmailTrial":"ADMIN EMAIL","text_wordpressInstallationAdminUserNameTrial":"WP ADMIN USERNAME","text_wordpressInstallationAdminPasswordTrial":"WP ADMIN PASSWORD","text_wordpressPasswordGenerateDescription":"You will need this password to log in. Please store it in a secure location.","text_wordpressInstallation":"WordPress installation","text_wordpressInstallationDesc":"Please provide the following information.","text_hostingRestorePointConfirmDesc":"Are you sure you want to restore this version of the website?","text_redirectInfo":"Redirect is a technique used to redirect your domain\'s visitors from one URL to another.  Redirects are most commonly used when you\u2019re making changes across your website and want to prevent users seeing 404 error pages. <br/>There are 2 main types of redirects: 301 (permanent) and 302 (temporary). You can manage all your redirects below. ","text_deleteDomain":"delete this domain","text_deleteZone":"delete this zone","text_deleteDomainTitle":"DELETE DOMAIN","text_deleteZoneTitle":"Delete zone","text_deleteZoneDesc":"Be aware that deleting this zone will remove its nameservers.<br> Your website won\u2019t be deleted, but it won\u2019t be reachable through this domain anymore.","text_addDomainShort":"add domain","text_addZoneShort":"add zone","text_addDomainDnsTitle":"10Web DNS zones","text_addDomainDnsDesc":"You have reached the domain limit included in your current plan.<br/> With each plan you can have as many domains as WordPress installs. To use more domains upgrade to a larger plan.","text_addZoneDnsDesc":"10Web DNS is a premium Amazon Route 53 DNS service provided to our customers for free.<br> It allows you to manage your own zone records and ensure a faster domain name resolving experience.","text_addZoneDnsExceededDesc":"You have reached the 10Web DNS domain limit included in your current plan. To add more domains contact our  <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'>Customer care team.</a>","text_addZoneDomainHint":"Domain name","text_zoneLimitExceededTitle":"DNS zone limit exceeded","text_zoneLimitExceededDesc":"Your DNS zone limit exceeded. You\'ll need to point domain to 10Web with A record or manage your DNS zones.<a class=\'db-link\' [routerLink]=\\"[\'manage-all-dns\']\\">Here you can manage your zones</a>. ","text_upgradeToUseFeature":"To use this feature, please <a [routerLink]=\\"[\'upgrade-plan\']\\" class=\\"db-link\\"><span>Upgrade</span>","text_contactToOwnerUseFeature":"This feature is available to paid plans.<br/>Please contact the workspace owner.","text_zoneCreateProblemTitle":"Problem with DNS Zone","text_zoneCreateProblemDesc":"Your domain has a problem with this DNS zone. It\'s possible that a DNS zone already exists for this domain. You can <a class=\'db-link\' href=\'https://10web.io/blog/how-do-i-point-my-domain-to-10web/#option_2_arecord\' target=\'_blank\'>point domain to 10Web</a> with a record or<a class=\'db-link\' href=\'\' target=\'_blank\'>contact our support</a>, so we can solve the issue.","text_addDomainDnsMXContent":"Add record: MX content","text_addDomainDnsSPFContent":"Add record: SPF content","text_addDomainDnsTxtContent":"Add record: Text content","text_addDomainDnsNsContent":"Add record: NS content","text_addDomainDnsSrvContent":"Add record: SRV content","text_domainName":"DOMAIN NAME","text_addDomainDnsSrvName":"Add Record: SRV name","text_congratsFromManager":"Congrats!","text_congratsFromManagerDesc":"Your site is successfully connected to 10Web dashboard. <br/>You can now activate and start using 10Web services, like Backup,<br/> SEO as well as plugins and themes.","text_congratsFromManagerChallenge":"Your website is connected","text_congratsFromManagerChallengeDesc":"Your Website Copy with<br> Super Fast Load Time Is on Its Way.","text_congratsFromManagerChallengeButton":"Send \\"Yes\\"","text_congratsFromManagerChallengeDescMagic":"Check Your Email in 24 Hours & Watch the Magic Happen!","text_congratsFromManagerPremiumPlugin":"Your {{premiumPlugin}} premium plugin<br/> is now installed & activated!","text_congratsFromManagerBundle":"Your bundle premium plugin is now installed & activated!","text_upgradeNow":"CHOOSE PLAN","text_billedSpecialDesc":"You\'ll pay ${{price}} each month once your free trial ends until you cancel.","text_billedDesc":"You\'ll pay ${{price}} each month once your free period ends until you cancel.","text_upgradePlatform":"upgrade platform","text_10componentsDesc":"10Web is your all-in one platform for building and managing your WordPress website. All your essential WordPress needs- from cloud hosting to page builder, 50+ premium plugins to tons of beautiful templates-are covered.","text_platform":"10Web Platform","text_bundle":"plugins bundle","text_upgradeBundleHeaderTitle":"50+ Premium Plugin Bundle to create a great website","text_upgradeBundleHeaderDesc":"50+ essential premium plugins for creating a dynamic multi-functional WordPress website packed in one beautiful big bundle.","text_serviceCantActivatePhpVersion":"Service can\'t activate with php version < 5.5","hostingManageEnvironment.disableHeader":"Disable staging environment","hostingMangeEnvironment.disableInfo":"Click the button below to disable staging environment.<br>Note that this will remove all changes made in this environment.","hostingMangeEnvironment.disableDialogHeader":"Disable staging environment","hostingMangeEnvironment.disableDialogMessage":"All changes made in staging will be lost\u2024","common.disable":"Disable","link_text_redirects.howToUse.header":"Redirects rule","link_text_redirects.howToUse.body":"Redirects are most commonly used when you\u2019re making changes across your website and want to prevent users seeing 404 error pages. There are 2 main types of redirects: 301 (permanent) and 302 (temporary). Add redirect rules to avoid error pages and duplicates.","link_text_performance.howToUse.header":"How to Use","link_text_performance.howToUse.body":"Check your performance and get useful optimization tips.","link_text_security.howToUse.header":"How to Use","link_text_security.howToUse.body":"Scan your website to discover vulnerabilities and suspicious file changes.","link_text_seoOverview.howToSetup.header":"How to Setup","link_text_seoOverview.howToSetup.body":"Authenticate and get Google Search Console reports.","link_text_seoSearchAnalytics.howToSetup.header":"How to use in the dashboard","link_text_seoSearchAnalytics.howToSetup.body":"Check your SEO reports and track your Search Analytics.","link_text_seoSearchConsole.howToSetup.header":"How to use in the dashboard","link_text_seoSearchConsole.howToSetup.body":"Check your SEO reports and track your Search Console.","link_text_optimizer.howToOptimize.body":"Choose a compression mode and easily optimize your images. Perform automatic optimization\xa0 once the images are uploaded.","link_text_optimizer.howToOptimize.header":"How to optimize images","link_text_backup.howToBackup.body":"Perform fast backups and easily restore your website. Backup manually or schedule automatic backups.","link_text_backup.howToBackup.header":"How to backup","link_text_plugins.howToInstallPlugin.body":"Manage your plugins and get new premium plugins.","link_text_plugins.howToInstallPlugin.header":"How to install a plugin","tooltip_text_notifications":"Notifications","tooltip_text_userSummary":"Usage summary","tooltip_text_actionManager":"Progress indicator","tooltip_text_activity":"Activities","tooltip_text_refer_friends":"Refer Friends","tooltip_text_overview.backup.widget.header":"Backup","tooltip_text_overview.backup.widget.body":"<ul><li><p>Schedule automatic backups.</p></li><li><p>Use differential backup to save only the latest changes.</p></li><li><p>Save backups in secure Amazon S3 cloud storage.</p></li><li><p>Restore website in a click.</p></li></ul>","tooltip_text_overview.performance.widget.header":"Performance","tooltip_text_overview.performance.widget.body":"<ul><li><p>Test your website\'s load time.</p></li><li><p>Find speed issues.</p></li><li><p>Get useful optimization tips for performance boost.</p></li></ul>","tooltip_text_overview.optimizer.widget.header":"Image Optimization","tooltip_text_overview.optimizer.widget.body":"<ul><li><p>Automatically compress all your images.</li><li><p>View optimization reports.</p></li></ul>","tooltip_text_overview.seo.widget.header":"SEO","tooltip_text_overview.seo.widget.body":"<ul><li><p>Add meta information and SEO configurations for each post or page.</p></li><li><p>Generate and customize an XML sitemap.</p></li><li><p>Receive SEO tips to rank higher on Google.</p></li><li><p>Easily track keywords\' rankings.</p></li></ul>","tooltip_text_overview.wpcore.widget.header":"WordPress Core Update","tooltip_text_overview.wpcore.widget.body":"<ul><li><p>Update WordPress core.</p></li></ul>","tooltip_text_overview.resourceUsage.widget.header":"Resource Usage","tooltip_text_overview.resourceUsage.widget.title":"Usage Summary:","tooltip_text_overview.resourceUsage.widget.body":"Monthly website visits and storage used.","text_addWebsiteHeaderIO":"Connect Your Website to 10Web Dashboard<br/> to Optimize Your Images","text_addWebsiteHeaderSecurity":"Connect Your Website to 10Web Dashboard<br/> to Protect your website","text_addWebsiteHeaderBackup":"Connect Your Website to 10Web Dashboard<br/> to Backup your website","text_addWebsiteHeaderPerformance":"Connect Your Website to 10Web Dashboard<br/> to Check your website speed","text_addWebsiteHeaderPremiumPlugin":"Connect Your Website to 10Web Dashboard to:","text_addWebsiteHeaderSeo":"Connect Your Website to 10Web Dashboard<br/> to SEO your website","text_addWebsiteHeader":"Connect your website to 10Web dashboard<br/> to install Premium Plugins","text_addWebsiteWelcome":"Welcome to 10Web","text_addWebsitePremiumPluginStep1":"Get your {{premiumPlugin}}<br/> Premium Plugin with a single click","text_addWebsitePremiumPluginStep1Speed":"Get your Speed Optimization<br/> plugin & optimize your website","text_addWebsitePremiumPluginStep1Bundle":"Get your Premiu