nclude/Exclude themes for scheduled updates","text_addWebsiteStep3Desc":"Go to your 10Web dashboard Plugins, click \u201cAdd Plugins\u201d and install premium plugin(s).","text_addWebsiteStep3IO":"Optimize Your Images","text_addWebsiteStep3DescIO":"Go to Image Optimizer, click \u201cOptimize now\u201d and optimize your images up to 90%.","text_addWebsiteStep3Security":"Protect your website","text_addWebsiteStep3DescSecurity":"Go to Security, click \u201cRun Scan\u201d detect and fix security issues.","text_addWebsiteStep3Backup":"Backup your website","text_addWebsiteStep3DescBackup":"Go to Backups, click \u201cBackup Now\u201d and schedule a backup.","text_addWebsiteStep3Performance":"Check your website speed","text_addWebsiteStep3DescPerformance":"Go to Performance, click \u201cCheck Performance,\u201d analyze and improve your website speed.","text_addWebsiteStep3Seo":"SEO your website","text_addWebsiteStep3DescSeo":"Analyze and improve your website SEO and get more organic traffic.","text_paymentInfoTitlePlatform":"Credit card information","text_paymentInfoTitlePlatformDesc":"The credit card you submit now will become your default payment method","text_paymentInfoTitlePlatformDescActivateAccount":"You have no active payment method attached to this account.<br/> To activate the account, please add a payment method.","text_paymentInfoTitlePlatformUsers":"Verify your account with a credit card","text_paymentInfoNoMoney":"No money will be charged.","text_paymentExistingCards":"Existing cards","text_noPaymentMethodDescSubscription":"You need to add a payment method to be able<br/> to continue using our services.","text_addPaymentMethodSubscriptionSuccessTitle":"Congratulations !","text_addPaymentMethodSubscriptionSuccessMessage":"Your plan has been updated and You can start using all the features included right away!","text_addPaymentMethodSubscriptionFailTitle":"Error!","text_addPaymentMethodSubscriptionFailMessage":"Something went wrong! Please recheck all the required fields and submit again!","text_addPaymentMethodSubscriptionFailButton":"TRY AGAIN","text_paymentAddCard":"Add a card","text_domainsExceededTitleDialogAppsumo":"You exceeded the limit of your current plan!","text_domainsExceededDescDialogAppsumo":"An Additional Website will<br/>Cost ${{additionalPrice}}/year","text_domainsExceededDescDialogAppsumoAI":"Get an additional hosted website with $72/year.","text_buyNow":"buy now","text_howManyAdditionalWebsitesNeed":"How Many Additional Sites You Need?","text_fillOutAdditionalWebsitesNumber":"Fill out the number below","text_addAdditionalWebsiteSuccessMessage":"An additional website has been successfully added!","text_addAdditionalWebsiteMessage":"You have successfully added {{count}}.","text_hostingAddOnForBoosterMessage":"You have successfully purchased<br/> 10Web Hosting add-on for {{number}}.<br/><br/>Migrate your website to 10Web to get all the benefits.","text_hostingAddOnForBoosterMessageFromCreate":"You have successfully purchased<br/> 10Web Hosting add-on for {{number}}.<br/><br/>Start creating your website now.","text_addAdditionalWebsiteAndCdnMessage":"You have successfully added {{siteCount}} and<br/> {{cdnCount}} to your account.","text_addAdditionalWordsMessage":"You have successfully added {{siteCount}}","text_addAdditionalCdnMessage":"You have successfully purchased<br/> Cloudflare Enterprise CDN for {{cdnCount}}.<br/><br/> Enable Cloudflare Enterprise on your website to<br/> benefit from all its features.","text_copyLink":"COPY LINK","text_myCredit":"my credit","text_inPending":"Pending","text_referAndEarn":"Get a ${{price}} credit for<br/>successful referrals you make.","text_yourFriendGetCredit":"","text_shareReferral":"Share the referral link with your community.<br/>Give them ${{price}} credit and a chance to improve their website score.","text_applyCredit":"Apply credit","text_leaderBoard.position":"Position","text_leaderBoard.name":"Name","text_leaderBoard.referrals":"Referrals","text_checkout_coupon_error":"This coupon code is invalid or has expired.","text_pluginInstallNotiff":"{{pluginName}} plugin will be installed on your website","text_wpAdminInfoTitle":"Access WordPress Dashboard","text_wpAdminInfoTitleMultisite":"Access Network WordPress Dashboard","text_submitYourIdea":"Submit your idea","text_moveTo10WebMenuTitle":"Speed Up Your Website","text_moveTo10WebMenuTitleHosted":"Get 95+ Score","text_moveTo10WebMenuTitleHostedJoined":"95+ Score","text_moveTo10WebMenuDesc":"Move to 10Web","text_enable2faTitle":"Enable Google 2FA","text_enable2faDesc":"Enable two-factor authentication by scanning the barcode below. Alternatively, you can use the code <span>{{code}}<span>","text_enable2faImageDesc":"You must set up your Google Authentication app before continuing. You will be unable to sign in otherwise.","text_enabled2faTitle":"2FA Enabled","text_disable2faTitle":"Disable Google 2FA","text_disable2faDesc":"Are you sure you want to disable two-factor authentication?","text_disable2faLabelAuthenticator":"Enter a code from the Google Authenticator app","text_disable2faLabelRecovery":"Enter one of your recovery codes","text_disable2faTroubleTitle":"\u0422rouble with your authentication app?","text_disable2faTroubleDesc":"Enter one of your recovery codes.","text_disable2faVerifTitle":"Get a verification code from the","text_disable2faVerifDesc":"Google Authenticator app","text_empty2fa":"2FA token is required","text_login2faTitle":"2-Step Verification","text_login2faDesc":"This extra step shows it\u2019s<br/> really you trying to sign in","text_wpAdminInfoDesc":"Login into WP dashboard by clicking this icon.<br/> Alternatively, you can login from site.com/wp-admin url.","text_wpFrontInfoDesc":"Visit Your Website","text_editDesc":"Edit Your Website","text_tooltipFriendCreditPending":"Your pending credit will be activated as soon as the user you referred upgrades to paid plan.","text_tooltipFriendCredit":"<ul><li><p>Your credit gets activated when a friend you referred completes their registration through your link.</p></li><li><p>You can use your credit by clicking \u201cApply credit\u201d button in the Dashboard.</p></li><li><p>Credits can be used to extend current plan correspondingly and for plan upgrade.</p></li><li><p>Payment method is required for applying the credit.</p></li><li><p>We keep the right to deduct credits upon unfair activities.</p></li></ul>","text_tooltipReferralCredit":"<ul><li><p>Your existing credit must be used when extending or upgrading a plan.</p></li><li><p>The total amount of credit will be applied.</p></li></ul>","text_tooltipAppliedCredit":"Prorated from your previous purchase","text_seoCustomMetadataTitle":"Custom Metadata","text_seoCustomMetadataDesc":"Customize the meta title, meta description, and keywords for each post or set default placeholders. Set up \u201cmeta robots\u201d configurations with tags like \u201cfollow\u201d and \u201cindex\u201d.","text_seoCanonicalTitle":"Canonical Urls","text_seoCanonicalDesc":"In case there\u2019s more than one URL to a single page, add canonical tags to show the search engines that it\u2019s the same page and avoid duplicate content errors.","text_seoXMLTitle":"XML Sitemap","text_seoXMLDesc":"Generate and customize an XML sitemap with no technical knowledge required. Make your website structure and hierarchy of pages clearer to the search engine crawlers.","text_seoSearchAnalyticsTitle":"Search Analytics","text_seoSearchAnalyticsDesc":"See what queries lead users to your website and use them to optimize your content. Get detailed reports filtered by device type. View the clicks, CTR, search position, and more.","text_seoRedirectsTitle":"Redirects","text_seoRedirectsDesc":"Move a page on your site to a new url or fix a broken link by redirecting the old URL to a new page.","text_thirdPartyThemeTitle":"Notice","text_thirdPartyThemeDesc":"You\u2019re about to activate a third party theme unsupported<br/> by the 10Web Builder. By activating, you will disable<br/> the 10Web Builder.","text_tooltipEditWebsite":"Edit With 10WEB Builder","text_tooltipBuildWebsiteHeader":"Build with 10Web Builder","text_upgradePlan":"Upgrade to a Higher Plan","text_upgradePlanPercentOffer":"Special pricing, only this Black Friday","text_upgradePlanStarterHeader":"Your Trial Expires in {{trialDeleteDay}}","text_upgradePlanStarterHeaderSpecialOffer":"Upgrade to 10Web Pro Plans with special discount\\n","text_upgradePlanBuilderTrialHeader":"Your Demo Website Expires In {{trialDeleteDay}}","text_upgradePlanStarterSubHeader":"Upgrade to Continue Using 10Web Platform","text_upgradePlanStarterSubHeaderAiBuilderFlow":"Upgrade to Use 10Web Platform","text_upgradePlanRefHeader":"Buy a Plan Using Your ${{refActiveCredit}} Credit and<br/> Build Your WordPress Website In Just Minutes","text_upgradePlanBundleHeader":"10Web Managed WordPress Hosting","text_upgradePlanStarter":"Great for testing<br> out the platform","text_upgradePlanPremium":"A great deal for a growing <br> business and ecommerce","text_upgradePlanPersonal":"Ideal for a starting business <br> or blog","text_upgradePlanEnterprise":"A powerful deal to take your <br> business to the next level","text_upgradePlanCloseDetails":"CLOSE DETAILS","text_upgradePlanViewDetails":"VIEW DETAILS","text_upgradePlanClosePlanDetails":"HIDE ALL FEATURES","text_upgradePlanViewPlanDetails":"See all features","text_exceededStorageTooltipTitle":"You have exceeded your backup storage limit","text_exceededStorageTooltipDesc":"Learn how the extra storage is charged","text_exceededVisitsTooltipTitle":"You have exceeded your visits limit","text_secureCheckout":"Secure Checkout","text_signUp":"Sign up","text_signUpCreateAccount":"Create 10Web Account","text_signUpStartTrial":"Start a {{trialPeriodNumber}}-Day Free Trial","text_tooltipBuildWebsiteDesc":"Edit anything on your website using drag &<br/> drop 10Web builder based on Elementor.","text_exceededVisitsTooltipDesc":"Learn how the extra visits are charged",