r feedback!","text_nps-congrats-desc":"We are constantly improving 10Web Platform<br/> based on your feedbacks.","text_nps-congrats-desc-APPSUMO":"Based on your feedback, we are continuously<br/>improving the 10Web AI Builder.","text_nps-congrats-review-title":"Thank you for your nice feedback!","text_nps-congrats-review-desc":"Leave a review on G2 Crowd and get a $20 Amazon US Gift Card.","text_manualMigrationSentTitle":"Manual migration request<br/> successfully submitted","text_manualMigrationSentDesc":"Please keep an eye on your inbox. A member of our<br> team will contact you once migration is complete.<br> It can take up to 24 hours.","text_manualMigrationSentDesc2":"You can also request a demo with our top specialist. We will show you your<br class=\'hide-mobile\'/> migrated website & present you everything you need to get the most out of 10Web.","text_mySites":"my sites","text_performanceTestFrom":"TEST FROM","text_multisiteActivate.header":"Activate the plugin","text_multisiteActivate.message":"You can activate the chosen plugin for only this website<br/>or for all the websites in this multisite.","text_multisiteDeactivate.header":"Deactivate the plugin","text_multisiteDeactivate.message":"You can deactivate the chosen plugin for only this website<br/>or for all the websites in this multisite.","text_multisiteAddSiteWithoutPointingDomainBtn":"Point a Domain","text_multisiteAddSiteWithoutPointingDomainTitle":"Point a Domain to Add a New Site","text_multisiteAddSiteWithoutPointingDomainDesc":"To add a new site to your multisite network, first you need to connect your domain to 10Web.","text_googleScoreTitle":"Your Website Template Is Installed.<br/>It\'s Super Fast<img src=\'../../../../../assets/images/emojis/rocket.png\'/>& Has a High Google PageSpeed Score.","text_googleScoreTitle_onboarding":"Your Website Template Is Installed<br/>It\'s Super Fast<img src=\'../../../../../assets/images/emojis/rocket.png\'/>& Has a High PageSpeed Score","text_templateSucce