bsites yet!","text_whiteLabelCacheContentPlaceholder":"We use NGINX FastCGI Static Page Caching to cache everything from pages to feeds to 301-redirects on sub-domains. It helps your site to load super fast for your non-logged-in visitors.","text_passwordProtectionDescDisabled":"Test with 3rd party tools","text_passwordProtectionDescEnabled":"Site is password protected","text_passwordProtectionTitle":"Website Is Password Protected","text_passwordProtectionDescFirstTime":"The website is visible from your IP and you can test the speed with GTmetrix, PageSpeed Insights, and Pingdom. To use any other test tools, please enable Public Visibility.","text_passwordProtectionPreviewWebsite":"PREVIEW WEBSITE","text_passwordProtectionTitleSidebar":"Public Visibility","text_passwordProtectionTitleDisabled":"Public Visibility Enabled For 10 Minutes","text_username":"username","text_passwordProtectionDesc":"Your website is visible from your IP. To give access<br/> to others, share your username and password.","text_passwordProtectionUpgrade":" to permanently remove password protection","text_passwordProtectionEnableTomorrow":"Enable again at the end of 1 hr","text_googleSpinnerAdditionalMore":"learn more","text_referrals":"referrals","text_newFeatures":"NEW FEATURES","text_buyAdditionalBtn":"Buy","text_10webExpertsCommunity":"10Web Experts Community","text_10webExpertsCommunityDesc":"Exclusive updates, huge network","text_buyAdditionalWebsite":"Additional website","text_buyAdditionalWebsiteDesc":"For ${{price}}/{{repeat}}","text_buyAdditionalWebsiteOffer":"Buy +1 Website ${{price}}/mo","text_buyAdditionalWebsiteOfferLTD":"Buy {{num}} Hosted Website for ${{price}}/yr","text_referFriendBLockTitle":"Refer a friend","text_referFriendBLockDesc":"Invite & earn credits","text_referFriendBLockButton":"invite","text_websiteScoreTitle":"Test Any Other Website\u2019s <Br> Speed on 10Web Hosting","text_websiteScoreTitlePlugins":"Test Your Website\u2019s <Br> Speed on 10Web Hosting","text_websiteScoreDesc":"Create a copy of your website with automated <br> migration to get a 90+ PageSpeed score.","text_websiteScoreConnectedDesc":"You\u2019ve done a great job<br/> optimizing your website!","text_websiteScoreHostedTitle":"Your current Google PageSpeed score","text_SSHDescShort":"Secure Shell is a network protocol that gives users a secure way to access a computer over an <br/>unsecured network.","text_seoOverviewAddMetadata":"Add metadata to your posts and pages with 10Web SEO.","text_seoOverviewLearnMoreDesc":"You can also manage canonicals, redirects and XML sitemap.","text_domain.empty.title":"Point Your Domain","text_domain.empty.desc":"Point your domain to 10Web Automated WordPress hosting<br/>to enjoy a super-fast website","text_domain.empty.desc.free":"Upgrade now to connect your custom domain to your super<br/>optimized website on 10Web Automated WordPress hosting.","text_addDomain.success.desc":"Now you have to replace the default nameservers at your domain<br/>registrar with 10Web\'s nameservers.","text_addDomain.nameserver.label":"Nameserver {{number}}","text_addDomain.success.footer":"After adding the 10Web nameserver, it can take up to 24 hours to be resolved and activated.","text_get-pageSpeed-score":"Get 90+ PageSpeed score with complete frontend and backend optimization","text_get-booster-score":"Grow your business with 10Web Booster","text_get-booster-score-desc":"Optimizing your websites with 10Web Booster means:","text_score.check.title":"Check Your Score","text_score.error.desc":"Please check if your website works properly and try again in a day or contact us.","text_score.website.copy":"your super optimized website copy is on its way","text_score.current":"Your Current Google Page Speed Score","text_score.low":"It seems like your website is pretty slow","text_score.low.desc":"Automatically Get a 90+ PageSpeed Score on 10Web Hosting","text_copy.my.website":"copy my website","text_copy.optimize":"copy & optimize my website","text_done.automatically":"It\u2019s Done Automatically","text_achieved_95+":"How We Achieved a 90+ PageSpeed Score","text_page.caching":"Server Side Page Caching(Fast-CGI)","text_css.html.minify":"CSS & HTML Minification & Compression","text_gzip.compression":"Cache Preloading & GZIP Compression","text_js.minification":"JS Minification and Compression","text_db.optimization":"Database Optimization","text_js.css.execution":"Defer JS and CSS Execution","text_dns.prefetching":"DNS Prefetching","text_dns.critical":"Critical CSS Generation","text_lazyload":"Image Lazyload","text_img.to.webp":"Conversion Image Format to WebP","text_iframe.video.lazyload":"iFrame and Video Lazyload","text_img.resizing":"Container-specific Image Resizing","text_woo.optimized":"WooCommerce Optimized","text_low.pagespeed":"If your PageSpeed score is below 90, please","text_one.step.left":"Only One Step Left To Use Your Optimized Website","text_super.fast.hosting.services":"Super Fast Hosting and Services Like Backup, Security, SEO and More","text_move.your.website":"Move Your Website to<br class=\\"db-new-line\\" /> 10Web Automated Hosting","text_new.hosting":"Test the New Hosting Before","text_final.decision":"Making a Final Decision","text_point.domain.tooltip":"Point your domain to set it as a URL people can use to visit your website.","text_tooltip.img.to.webp":"Compression of images up to 34% by converting to WebP format, keeping the size small and the quality rich. This results in a much faster website with great  quality. ","text_tooltip.page.caching":"Allows for the fast load time of web pages by storing request responses.","text_tooltip.css.html.minify":"Minifies and compresses CSS & HTML into lightweight files, having a direct effect  on the load time of your website. ","text_tooltip.gzip.compression":"Preloading website pages warm up the cache and make the website faster. Gzip compression makes files smaller thus reducing the amount of time required to transfer a resource from the server to a browser.","text_tooltip.js.minification":"Minifies and compresses JS files into lightweight files for faster load time and data transfer. ","text_tooltip.db.optimization":"Optimization of a database (MySQL) specifically designed for WordPress websites","text_tooltip.js.css.execution":"Defers the execution of JavaScript and CSS in HTML until page load completes. This gives priority to user experience, by loading the site for your visitors faster and then taking care of the rest for your site to function. ","text_tooltip.img.optimization":"Compression of images of up to 40% without loss of original data and up to 90% without loss of quality. Automatically optimize images upon upload to keep your website running fast and smooth.","text_tooltip.dns.prefetching":"Inserts tags to reduce DNS resolution time.","text_tooltip.dns.critical":"A technique that extracts only the necessary CSS to render website content as soon as possible.","text_tooltip.lazyload":"Loading of images as visitors scroll down the page, improving the load time of your website pages.","text_font.swap":"Font Swap","text_tooltip.font.swap":"To return your visitors queries faster, we display data with a generic font while your font is being fetched. ","text_tooltip.iframe.video.lazyload":"Loads iFrames and videos as visitors scroll down the page, improving load time of your website pages. ","text_tooltip.img.resizing":"Resizing of large images to fit smaller containers while maintaining its aspect ratio. Results in faster loading websites.","text_tooltip.woo.optimized":"As safety of information is top priority, we have made WooCommerce fully compatible with the 10Web cache. No extra configuration is needed. All WooCommerce pages are automatically detected and not cached.","text_moveTo10web.loadTime":"Load Time","text_moveTo10web.showMobileScore":"Show Mobile Score","text_overview.upgradeOffer.title":"Upgrade Now And Get:","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer1":"Automated WP hosting powered by Google Cloud","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer1.mobile":"Manged WP hosting powered by GCloud","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer2":"Use any WordPress theme or plugin","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer3":"90+ Google PageSpeed score","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer4":"Website builder based on Elementor","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer5":"40+ website templates","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer6":"Backup, security & SEO services","text_overview.upgradeOffer.offer7":"50+ premium plugins","text_overview.upgradeOffer.upgradeNow":"upgrade now","tooltip_text_overview.score.widget.body":"Previously measured PageSpeed score and load time.","tooltip_text_overview.score.widget.header":"PageSpeed Score","tooltip_text_overview.security.widget.body":"Previously scanned number of issues and vulnerabilities.","tooltip_text_overview.security.widget.header":"Security","text_sidebar.users":"Users","text_SubscriptionPlan.TitleTodayExpired":"EXPIRES","tooltip_text_tourSection":"Explore Dashboard","text_ai-builder.title":"AI Builder","text_ai-builder.recreate":"Recreate Website with AI","text_ai-builder.recreate-menu":"Recreate with AI","text_ai-builder.templates":"Templates","text_ai-builder__point1":"Use the AI Builder to recreate any website <br> on WordPress while keeping them fully customizable.","text_ai-builder__point2":"Choose one of our 40+ ready made templates <br> & customize it with 10Web builder based on Elementor","text_ai-builder.add-page":"Add Page","text_ai-builder.add-website-pages":"Add \'{{url}}\' pages for recreation.","text_home_page":"Home Page","text_added-pages-count":"Added pages {{ count }} of 10","text-ai-builder-info-txt":"AI Builder will recreate & import the copy of your website.<br/> Necessary plugins may be installed to achieve correct recreation.","text-ai-builder-editable-header-footer":"If pages have the same header or footer, editable header/footer templates will be created. <br> If pages have different headers or footers, they will become a part of the page content.","text_ai-builder-no-pages":"Insert the homepage URL of the website<br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' /> you want to recreate.","text_ai-builder-recreate":"RECREATE & IMPORT","text_ai-builder-copy-title":"Copy of Your Website is in Progress","text-ai-builder-copy-desc":"Your visual & functional copy will be ready in minutes","text-ai-builder-loading-title":"<span class=\'db-hide\'> Step 1: </span> Recreating","text-ai-builder-loading-desc":"Please wait while we recreate your website.","text-ai-builder-loading-title2":"<span class=\'db-hide\'> Step 2: </span> Importing","text-ai-builder-loading-desc2":"Please wait while we import your copy.","text-aiBuilder-loading-txt":"Creating layout...","text_aiBuilder__step1":"Enter Your Website Link","text_aiBuilder__step2":"Recreate your website with <br> AI on WordPress in minutes","text_aiBuilder__step2-short":"Recreate your website with AI<br/>on WordPress in minutes","text_aiBuilder__step3":"Edit with 10Web Editor based <br> on Elementor","text_aiBuilder__step3-short":"Edit with 10Web Editor based<br/>on Elementor","text_aiBuilder__stepGetStarted":"GET STARTED","text_aiBuilder__stepTitle1":"You\'re 3 Steps Away From Recreating Your Website","text_aiBuilder__stepTitle2":"How It Works","text_aiBuilder__stepDesc":"Take these 3 steps for recreating your website on WordPress","text_aiBuilder__wrong":"Something Went Wrong :/","text_aiBuilder__contact_us":"We encountered an error while recreating your website. <br> Contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'> customer care </a> team to get it fixed ASAP.","text_aiBuilder__notice-title":"Notice","text_aiBuilder__notice-desc":"You\u2019re about to activate a third party theme unsupported by the 10Web Builder. By activating, you will disable the 10Web Builder.","text_aiBuilder__notice-title2":"Importing a Recreated Website or a Template","text_aiBuilder__notice-desc2":"You have already imported a recreated website or a website template. A new import of one or the other, will move current posts and the template to trash and you can recover them later on.","text_aiBuilder__notice-desc3":"Importing a recreated website or a website template will change your theme to 10Web default. Though there will be no data loss, we recommend you avoid new imports into a live website.","text_aiBuilder__success":"AI Assistant Recreated Your Website & <br> Saved You Hours of Manual Work.","text_aiBuilder__success-desc":"Explore your newly created website and 10Web features.","text_aiBuilder__success-button":"PREVIEW WEBSITE","text_aiBuilder__success-button-text":"Even if you see a difference between the original website and<br/>recreated website, you can always edit it with Elementor.","text_aiBuilder__getting-started":"Getting Started With AI Builder","text_aiBuilder__get-copy":"Get a copy of your website in minutes using AI Assistance","text_aiBuilder__move-to-wp":"Build Your Website With AI Assistance","text_aiBuilder__move-to-wp-desc":"Get a fully customizable copy of your website on <br/>WP in minutes.","text_aiBuilder__automated":"10Web Website Editor","text_aiBuilder__automated-desc":"Use the 10Web Editor and pro widgets to customize <br> the copy of your website.","text_aiBuilder__rapid":"Build The Best With The Best","text_aiBuilder__rapid-desc":"Take advantage of the 10Web AI Builder, WordPress, <br/>Elementor, and the 10Web hosting infrastructure <br/>powered by Google Cloud all housed under one roof.","text_aiBuilder__DIY":"DIY Website Development","text_aiBuilder__DIY-desc":"Develop your business websites independent of high-cost professionals","text_aiBuilder__nextStep":"NEXT","text_emailVerification.wpadmin":"To access your WordPress admin dashboard,<br/> please check your inbox and verify your email address.","text_emailVerification.phpmyadmin":"To access PhP MyAdmin,<br/> please check your inbox and verify your email address.","text_emailVerification.seo":"To use the SEO service by 10Web,<br/> please check your inbox and verify your email address.","text_emailVerification.users":"To access the Users page of your WordPress dashboard,<br/> please check your inbox and verify your email address.","text_emailVerification.uploadPlugin":"To upload Plugins/Themes, please check your inbox and verify<br/> your email address.","text_emailVerification.title1":"Verify Your Email","text_emailVerification.title2":"A Verification Email<br/> Was Sent to Your Mailbox","text_emailVerification.Desc2":"Please check your inbox to verify your email address","text_emailVerification.successTitle":"Success!","text_emailVerification.successDesc":"Your Account Has Been Verified","text_emailVerification.failedDesc":"Please resend the verification email and verify again.","text_emailVerification.cantFind":"Can\u2019t find the verification email?","text_emailVerification.resendEmail":"Resend it.","text_appsumoHeaderSubTitle":"Introducing The 10Web AI Builder","text_appsumoHeaderTitle":"Special Offer For SumoLings","text_appsumo10WebMessage":"You\u2019ve been utilizing 10Web as your website building and hosting<br/>solution for a while now. How about taking it up a notch! <span class=\'db-message-new-line\'>The AI Builder is the 10Web Builder you\u2019ve been using, enhanced<br/>with AI Assistance. Build websites with more ease and efficiency<br/>using the AI Assistant.</span> We are offering a special Lifetime Deal to our SumoLing family.<br/>Scale your business in a matter of days.<br/>With AI Assistance, the possibilities are limitless!<br/>Keep scrolling to learn more <img src=\'../../assets/images/emojis/wink.png\'/>","text_appsumo10WebMessageMoney":"You can get a plan, test it out, and if you are not satisfied with<br/>the product.","text_appsumo10WebMessageSignature":"10Web Team","text_planItemLtd":"Lifetime Deal","text_planItemLtdOriginalPrice":"Original Price","text_planItemLtdForWebsites":"For {{websiteCount}} Websites","text_planItemLtdLifetimeSupport":"Lifetime Support","text_planItemLtdLifetimeUpdates":"Lifetime Updates","text_haveHostingAdditionalActivate":"activate plan","text_haveHostingAdditionalRenew":"renew plan","text_affiliates":"Affiliate System","text_affiliateLink":"Affiliate Program","text_migration_additional_info":"Are there any special requirements like additional folders, htaccess rules, or Nginx rules that we should consider upon website migration?","text_aiBuilder__enable_now":"The AI Builder: Build Without Limitations","text_ai-builder__point1.title":"Build Your Website With AI","text_ai-builder__point1.desc":"Recreate a visual and functional copy of a website<br/>in minutes.","text_ai-builder__point2.title":"Full Customization","text_ai-builder__point2.desc":"Customize and create beautiful websites with the drag and<br/>drop editor based on Elementor.","text_ai-builder__point3.title":"Build The Best With The Best","text_ai-builder__point3.desc":"An unbeatable combination of tools and services: <br> WordPress, Elementor, and AI builder.","text_ai-builder-trial__title":"Welcome To The AI Builder, <br> The Future Of Website Building ","text_ai-builder-trial__desc":"Start your journey","text_ai-builder-trial__step1":"Enter Website Link","text_ai-builder-trial__step2":"Recreate a Functional Copy on WordPress With AI","text_ai-builder-trial__step3":"Edit With the 10Web Website Editor","text_ltd_connect_website_title":"Recreate with AI Builder on Your Existing Website","text_wb_subscription_plan_point1":"Website optimization","text_wb_subscription_plan_point2":"Full frontend optimization","text_wb_subscription_plan_point3":"Backend speed acceleration","text_ltd_connect_website_desc":"Build your websites with AI Assistance and edit them<br/>with the 10Web Editor based on Elementor.","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point1":"AI Website Builder","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point2":"AI assistant","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point3":"Drag & drop editor based on Elementor","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point4":"30+ pro widgets","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point5":"40+ Ready-made Website Templates","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point6":"Responsive editing","text_ltd_subscription_plan_point7":"WooCommerce builder","text_ltd_subscription_plan_upgrade":"Upgrade To Build More Websites","text_ltd_subscription_plan_hosting":"Automated WordPress Hosting","text_ltd_subscription_plan_desc":"Boost the number of your websites by upgrading to a higher plan","text_ltd_subscription_plan_hosting_desc":"Get Managed WP hosting Powered by Google Cloud<br/>at the fixed price of $72/year","text_builder_trial_upgrade_title":"Get An Exclusive Lifetime Deal","text_builder_trial_upgrade_desc":"Upgrade now to get a Lifetime Deal on the AI Builder. Limited time offer.","text_congratsFromManagerDesc_ltd":"You can now recreate a website using AI Assistance<br/>and edit it with the 10Web Editor.","text_appsumo_subscription_plan_templates":"<b> 40+ </b> Designer Made Templates","text_ltd_connect_website_popup_title":"Build With AI Builder","text_ltd_connect_website_popup_desc":"Install the 10Web Manager plugin to be able to recreate<br/>websites with AI assistance of the 10Web builder.","text_ltd_connect_website_popup_step1":"Download 10Web Manager Plugin","text_ltd_connect_website_popup_step2":"Install and activate the plugin from the WP admin","text_learn_more":"Learn more","text_buyHosting":"Buy hosting","text_earlyBirdSpecial":"Special Offer","text_earlyBirdLtdUpgradePlanHeader":"20% Discount Until October 16, 2020","text_earlyBirdLtdUpgradePlanStarterDesc":"Upgrade now and get 20% off on Lifetime Deal","text_earlyBirdLtdUpgradePlanStarterDescNew":"Upgrade now and get the deal with 20% off as the prices will go up on October 16","text_earlyBirdLtdUpgradePlanLtdDesc":"Boost the number of your websites by upgrading to a higher plan.","text_ltdUpgradePlanHeader":"Grab Our Exclusive Lifetime Deal. Limited Time Offer.","text_aiUpgradePlanHeader":"Your Demo Website Has Expired","text_aiUpgradePlanDesc":"Upgrade to enjoy all the benefits of 10Web AI Builder","text_aiUpgradePlanExpiredDesc":"Buy now & enjoy all the benefits of 10Web AI Builder\\n\\n","text_ltdUpgradePlanStarterDesc":"Pay once, use forever.<br/>Take advantage of this great deal now! Prices are subject to increase.","text_ltdUpgradePlanStarterDescOfferEnd":"Pay once, use forever.<br/>Take advantage of this great deal now, before it ends on <span>December 3rd</span>.","text_ltdUpgradePlanLtdDesc":"Boost the number of your websites by upgrading to a higher plan.","text_currentPlan":"Current Plan","text_faq":"FAQ","text_createNewWebsite":"Create a website","text_useAiTemplatesThemes":"Use AI, templates or themes","text_migrateYourWebsite":"Migrate your website","text_optimizeYourWebsite":"Optimize your website","text_exclusiveDeal":"<span class=\'db-blue\'>Exclusive Deal</span>","text_exclusiveDealDescription":"Special discount on 20+ websites","text_hostAndOptimize":"Host & optimize on 10Web","text_dontReloadPage":"Please don\u2019t reload this page","text_fasterFrontend":"Faster frontend on any hosting","text_appsumoDealDesc":"Activate AI assistance for your<br/>Appsumo {{number}}","text_appsumoVideoTitle":"Get Started With 10Web Website<br/>Builder With AI Assistance","text_appsumoVideoDesc":"AI Builder free trial for AppSumo users","text_appsumoVideoSubDesc":"Purchase your plan and test the AI Builder.","text_appsumoFeatureSectionTitle":"Built for Professionals<br/>From Tech-Savvy Individual to Agency","text_appsumoHowToSectionTitle":"How AI Website Builder Works","text_LTDAdditionalSubscriptionBlockTitle":"Automated WordPress Hosting","text_planPrice":"Price","text_tenwebxHeaderSubTitle":"Premium Automated WordPress Hosting","text_tenwebxMessage":"\u201cIf you\u2019re a freelancer or agency, 10Web hosting will be the best <br> choice for you. <br><br> At 10Web, we offer a automated WordPress hosting on Google Cloud,<br> and we are simply obsessed with providing a high PageSpeed for <br> WordPress to all our users. We guarantee that every website hosted <br> on our platform or migrated from elsewhere, gets an automatic 90+ <br> PageSpeed score.","text_tenwebxMessageMoney":"You can purchase a website for $72/yr billed annually, test it <br> out, and if you are not satisfied with the hosting.\u201d","text_tenwebxDealTitle":"10Web Hosting","text_tenwebxBilledAnnually":"Billed Annually","text_tenwebxDealHostedSite":"<b> 1 </b> <span> Hosted Site </span>","text_tenwebxDealMonthlyVisitors":"<b> 25K </b> <span class=\'db-ai-builder-feature-point\'> Monthly Visitors </span>","text_tenwebxDealSSDStorage":"<b>5GB</b> <span class=\'db-ai-builder-feature-point\'> SSD Storage </span>","text_tenwebxPointsTitle":"What Makes 10Web The Best Fully Managed Wordpress Host?","text_tenwebxPointScoreTitle":"90+ PageSpeed Score","text_tenwebxPointScoreDesc":"Fully automated optimization solution including smart <br> hosting configuration, image optimization & lazyload, <br> JS & CSS minification, and much more that guarantees <br> your website\u2019s 90+ PageSpeed score.","text_tenwebxPointScoreTitleTooltip":"In certain cases a 95+ PageSpeed score is not possible because of external <br> scripts, large images, large JS & CSS files, and a large quantity of plugins. If your <br> PageSpeed score is lower than 90, please contact our Customer care team.","text_tenwebxFeatureSectionTitle":"10Web provides services that are tailored specifically for WordPress","text_tenwebxDialogHostingTitle":"AI Website Builder Works <br> Best on 10Web Hosting","text_tenwebxDialogHostingDesc":"Enjoy the full benefits and features of AI Website Builder<br> with 10Web Automated WordPress Hosting on Google Cloud","text_tenwebxMigrateTitle":"Fully Automated <br> Website Migration","text_tenwebxMigrateDesc":"Simply install our migration plugin, make a copy of <br> your live website, and test your site on 10Web hosting.","text_tenwebxTestimonialsTitle":"Here\u2019s What Our Clients Have to Say About <br> Their Experience With 10Web","text_tenwebxVisitorstooltip":"For every 10K extra visitors you\'ll be charged an extra $2<br> at the end of the billing month","text_tenwebxPointsTooltip":"In certain cases a 90+ PageSpeed score is not possible because of <br> external scripts, large images, large JS & CSS files, and a large quantity of plugins.<br> If your PageSpeed score is lower than 90, please contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'><span> Customer care </span></a> team.","text_pwdValidationtitle":"Your password must have:","text_pwdCharacters":"8 or more characters","text_pwdUpperLowerCase":"Upper and lowercase letters","text_pwdNumber":"At least one number","text_pwdValidationSubTitle":"Strength:","text_pwdValidationDesc":"After going through all these points, <br> your password will be stronger and <br> hard to guess.","text_invalidPassword1":"Please enter a secure password.","text_requiredPassword1":"Password is required","text_pluginsEmptyTitle":"We did not find results<br/>matching your search criteria.","text_chatMessenger":"Messenger","text_referFriend":"Refer a friend","text_connectDomain":"Connect a custom domain","text_chatSlack":"Join Slack community","text_chatOpenTopic":"Open Topic","text_chatSales":"Sales","text_chatWhatsApp":"WhatsApp","text_knowledgeBase":"Knowledge base","text_knowledgeBaseEmpty":"No results found","text_whatsNew":"What\u2019s new","text_tenWebCare":"10Web Care","text_openArticle":"Open this article on new tab","text_filteredArticles":"{{articlesCount}} results","text_availableWebsites":"{{availableWebsites}} Free Website {{slots}} Available","text_availableWebsitesDesc":"Migrate your website or build one using any theme & plugin, 10Web builder and AI assistance.","text_add-website-desc1":"With 10Web, you can automatically create an optimized copy of <br> your website with a 90+ PageSpeed score without impacting your original website.","text_add-website-desc2":"All you need to do is download and install the 10Web Manager plugin. After that <br> an optimized copy of your website will be created automatically in 10-30 minutes.","text_add-website-desc3":"Test your optimized website copy, compare the score, and play with the hosting features.","text_add-website-tooltip":"In certain cases a 90+ PageSpeed score is not possible because of external scripts, large images, large JS & CSS files, and a large quantity of plugins. If your PageSpeed score is lower than 90, please contact our  <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\'> Customer care </a> team.","text_chatLiveChat":"Live chat","text_chatContactSales":"Contact sales","text_mainPaymentMethod":"Main payment method","text_mobileDisclaimerWelcomeTitleTrial":"Welcome To 10Web","text_mobileDisclaimerWelcomeTitleAi":"Welcome To AI Builder","text_mobileDisclaimerMainTitle":"10Web Dashboard Available <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />Only on Desktop.<br/>Check your Email to Login <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />with Magic Link.","text_mobileDisclaimerDescAi":"To experience the full capability of <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />Automated Website Creation Based <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />on AI<br class=\'db-new-line-for-desktop\' /> login on desktop with 1 click <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />from the email we\u2019ve sent you.","text_mobileDisclaimerDescTrial":"To experience the full capability of <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />Automated WordPress Platform login<br />on desktop with 1 click from the email <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />we\u2019ve sent you.","text_mobileDisclaimerDescOptimizer":"To explore Automated 90+<br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' /> PageSpeed Optimization by 10Web <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' /> login<br class=\'db-new-line-for-desktop\' /> on desktop with 1 click from the<br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' /> email we\u2019ve sent you.","text_subscriptionRenewTitle":"Subscription renewal","text_subscriptionRenewDesc":"Please renew your subscription to be able to continue using 10Web Automated Hosting Platform.","text_subscriptionRenewDescBundle":"Please renew your subscription to be able to continue using 10Web.","text_subscriptionRenewDescBoosterProAiPro":"Please renew your subscription to be able to continue<br/>using 10Web Booster.","text_subscriptionRenewDescBoosterFreeOrAiFree":"Please renew your subscription to continue using<br/>10Web services.","text_defaultForAdditional":"Default payment method For Additional Fees","text_upgradePlanStarterNoUpFrontPayment":"No Up-front Payment","text_upgradePlanStarterCancelAnytime":"Cancel Anytime","text_expiredPlanStarterSubHeader":"Get 7 Days of 10Web Pro Plans for Free","text_newAiBuilderFlowHeader":"Get all of the 10Web pro features","text_expiredPlanStarterHeader":"Your trial has expired, but you can still explore 10Web for free for another month.","text_freeOfferDesc":"Explore all 10Web premium features, create, migrate & optimize up to 10 websites.","text_freeOfferDescForDemo":"Edit your website, host it on a Google Cloud Partner hosting and get a 90+ PageSpeed score","text_freeOfferDescForDemoWithDomain":"Edit, launch and host your superfast website on 10Web with <span class=\'doted\'>a free domain for up to $30.</span>","text_freeOfferDescPercent":"Access all of 10Web\u2019s optimization, hosting, and website building benefits with a 30% lifetime discount.","text_geoFirstYearDesc":"Special prices for the first year for new customers","text_trialCouponDesc":"Special offer with the {{coupon}} promo code","text_boosterProSubheader":"Optimize more websites with 10Web Booster","text_platformOfferDesc":"Migrate, optimize or create more websites with a 90+ PageSpeed score","text_alreadyHaveAccountTitle":"Existing Account","text_alreadyHaveAccountMessage":"You already have an account with this email.<br/>We\u2019ve signed you in.","text_performance.pageSpeedJoined90+":"<b>Automated Optimization</b> 90+ PageSpeed Score","text_performance.pageSpeedOptimizeWebsite90+":"<b>Automated Optimization</b> 90+ PageSpeed Score","text_performance.pageSpeedCopyWebsite90+":"<b>Copy your website</b><br/>90+ PageSpeed score","text_copyWebsiteTitle":"Test Any Other Website\u2019s Speed <br> on 10Web Hosting","text_copyWebsiteDesc":"Create a copy of your website with automated migration to get a 90+ PageSpeed score.","text_copyWebsiteTooltip":"<b>Test Any Other Website\u2019s Speed <br> on 10Web Hosting</b><br><span>Create a copy of your website with automated migration to get a 90+ PageSpeed score.</span>","text_domainsExceededTitleDialogAppsumoLTD":"You\u2019ve reached the limit of recreated websites.<br/>To recreate more websites, please {{action}}.","text_demoLabelTooltip":"This is a test website","text_starter_connect_website_popup_title":"Install 10Web Manager Plugin to <br> copy your website to 10Web without <br> impacting your original website","text_starter_connect_website_popup_title_new":"Install our Manager Plugin<br> to Copy Your Existing Website<br> to 10Web Hosting","text_starter_connect_website_popup_desc":"Your website copy will replace your trial website on 10Web hosting.","text_regionDescriptionSignUp":"Choose the Data Center/Location for your website","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessTrial":"Let automation take over your manual work, saving you time to grow your business.","text_sslFailed.title":"Free SSL generation failed","text_sslFailed.desc":"If you are using Cloudflare please follow these instruction","text_enableHttps.title":"Generate free certificate","text_enableHttps.desc":"We provide free SSL certificates, granting you a secure https connection. <br/> To generate a certificate, at least one live domain should be pointed to your 10Web servers.","text_installWebsiteDialogSuccessTrialTitle":"Your Website on 10Web is Created","text_enableHttps.subTitle":"Select the domain(s) for which you want to generate SSL certificate.","text_migrationFlowLowScore":"<b>In some cases an automatic 90+ is not possible.</b><br> Request manual optimization. We will try to reach a 90+ Page Speed score manually.","text_migrationFlowLowScoreInProgress":"<b>Optimization in progress</b><br> Our team is working to optimize your website to reach the highest possible PageSpeed score.","text_migrationFlowLowScoreOptimize":"Optimize My Website","text_migrationFlowLowScoreManualOptimize":"Manual Optimization<br/> Request Submitted","text_migrationFlowLowScoreManualOptimizeDesc":"Please check your inbox. A member of our team will contact you once the optimization has completed.","text_copyWebsitePageTitle":"Your Trial Website PageSpeed Score","text_copyWebsitePageGet90":"Want to Get 90+ PageSpeed Score <br> For Any Other Website?","text_signUpTitle":"Build and host websites<br class=\'db-mobile\' />with 10Web AI Builder","text_signUpTitleBooster":"Access the Benefits<br/> of 10Web Booster","text_signUpTitleAiAssistant":"Access the benefits<br/> of 10Web AI Assistant","text_signUpTitleStartAi":"Your website<br/> is waiting for you!","text_signUpDescStartAi":"Create your account now to access<br/>your newly generated site.","text_signUpTitleImageOptimizer":"Access the benefits of<br/> Image Optimizer","text_signUpListing0":"Build and host a website 10X faster with AI","text_signUpListing1":"Get AI generated content and images","text_signUpListing2":"Customize with Elementor based editor","text_signUpListing3":"Get a 90+ PageSpeed score with Booster","text_signUpListingAi0":"Fix SEO & readability errors","text_signUpListingAi1":"Work directly in Gutenberg & Classic Editor","text_signUpListingAi2":"20+ use case templates","text_signUpListingAiStart0":"Preview your AI Powered website","text_signUpListingAiStart1":"Customize with Elementor based editor","text_signUpListingAiStart2":"Add more pages and complete your website","text_signUpListingAiStart3":"Get a 90+ PageSpeed score with Booster","text_signUpListingAi3":"24/7 customer care","text_signUpBoosterListing0":"90+ PageSpeed score","text_signUpBoosterListing1":"Image optimization","text_signUpBoosterListing2":"Improved Core Web Vitals","text_signUpBoosterListing3":"Full caching","text_upgradePlanHostedSite":"For more websites, <br/>please upgrade to a higher plan","text_aiWebsiteBuilder":"Get a fully functional copy of your website on WordPress using our AI Website Builder","text_copyWebsitePageInstallPlugin":"Install our Manager Plugin to Copy Your<br/>Existing Website to 10Web Hosting","text_migrationFlowHighlightDesc":"Create an optimized copy of your website on<br/>10Web with 1 click and enjoy a 90+ PageSpeed<br/>score.","text_optimizerPluginInstall":"<b>10Web Optimizer plugin is not installed.</b><br/>The 10Web Optimizer Plugin is mandatory for getting a PageSpeed score of 90+","text_optimizationProgress":"<h3>Website Optimization in Progress</h3><p>Your website is being optimized. Depending on its size, </br>this process may take a while.</p>","text_loginWithGoogle":"Login with Google","text_continueWithGoogle":"Continue with Google","text_hostedDomainsExceededTitle":"<span>You exceeded the limit<br/> of websites</span>","text_hostedDomainsExceededDesc":"Upgrade to a higher plan to create, migrate or optimize<br/> more websites.","text_hostedDomainsExceededBuyMoreDesc":"Buy additional sites to create, migrate or optimize<br/> more websites.","text_hostedDomainsExceededMigrateDesc":"To migrate more websites<br> you need to upgrade to a paid plan.","text_hostedDomainsExceededTitleExpired":"<span>Your trial hosting has expired</span>","text_hostedDomainsExceededDescExpired":"Please upgrade to be able to host websites at 10Web.","text_hostedDomainsExceededTest":"If you want to test another website during the trial you can remove <br> your current website hosted on 10Web.","text_hostedDomainsExceededMigrateTest":"If you want to migrate another website during the trial,<br> you can remove your current website hosted on 10Web.","text_yourWebsiteCopyHosted":"Your Website Copy Hosted at 10Web","text_yourCurrentWebsite":"Your Current Website","text_talkToSpecialist":"Talk to a Specialist","text_createCopyWebsite":"Create a Copy of Your Website","text_websiteMigration":"Website Migration","text_fillFieldsToCopy":"To copy your website to 10Web Managed Hosting, please fill out the fields below. We will automatically create a copy of your website on 10Web Managed Hosting.","text_fillAllNecessaryInfo":"Fill all necessary info to start Fill out all the new info necessary for the migration process. We bet migrating birds have to fill out something similar, too.","text_checkManualMigrateType":"Please check manual migrate type","text_noWorries":"No worries, give us your site info and we\u2019ll migrate manually within 24 hours.","text_autoMigrating":"We\u2019ve encountered an issue while automatically migrating your site. <br>Our team will manually migrate your site within 24 hours.","text_automaticCopy":"The Automatic Copy of your website can not be completed","text_manuallyCopyWebsite":"We will manually copy your website for free in 24 hours","text_feelOutTheForm":"Please feel out the form below to proceed","text_dbMatters":"Database matters","text_requiredDb":"We may also need phpMyAdmin credentials to access your database.","text_requiredUrl":"This field is required. Please enter your URL.","text_requiredUsername":"This field is required. Please enter your Username.","text_requiredPassword":"This field is required. Please enter your Password.","text_requiredPort":"This field is required. Please enter your Port.","text_requiredServerAddress":"This field is required. Please enter your Server Address.","text_ftpInfo":"FTP/SFTP/SSH cases need just a tad more info.","text_checkInfo":"Please check that all the information you provided is correct","text_accessForManualMigrate":"We need this access to be able to manually migrate your website.","text_grantAccess":"I agree to grant 10Web temporary access to my dashboard and websites.","text_hostingPanelCredentials":"Please Provide Your Hosting Panel Credentials","text_automaticCopyCantCompleted":"Request Premium Migration for Free","text_automaticFeelOutForm":"Something on your website is blocking the automated migration. Please submit the form<br/> below to get a premium manual migration for free within 24 working hours.","text_requestManualMigration":"Request manual migration","text_homePageUrl":"Homepage URL","text_websiteDetails":"Website details","text_hostingDetails":"Hosting details","text_hostingPanelLoginUrl":"Hosting panel login URL","text_hostingPanelUsername":"Hosting panel username","text_hostingPanelPassword":"Hosting panel password","text_additionalInstruction":"Additional Instruction","text_migrateExistingSite":"To migrate your existing site to 10Web Automated hosting, fill in your website credentials.","text_retry":"Retry","text_renew":"Renew","text_upgradeNowEndContinue":"Upgrade now and continue enjoying super fast automated hosting & more! Your trial expires","text_upgradeNowAndEnjoy":"Upgrade now to enjoy your super fast website on 10Web managed hosting.","text_addAdditionalWebsite":"Add additional website","text_automatedWpHosting":"Automated WordPress Hosting","text_showDefaultPaymentMethod":"Default payment method","text_addMoreWebsitesPersonal":"To add more websites than included in your current plan,<br/> upgrade to one of our higher plans.","text_addMoreWebsitesPremium":"To add more websites and unlock exclusive agency features,<br/> upgrade to our Agency plan. ","text_optimizeMoreWebsitesPersonal":"To optimize more websites than included in your current plan, upgrade to one of our higher plans.","text_optimizeMoreWebsitesPremium":"To optimize more websites and unlock exclusive agency features, upgrade to our Agency plan.","text_optimizeMoreWebsitesAgency":"Buy an additional website to be able to add another website<br/> to your current plan.","text_purchaseAdditionalWebsite":"Buy an additional website to be able to add another website<br/> to your current plan.","text_purchaseAdditionalWebsiteOneLine":"Buy an additional website to add another website to your current plan.","text_getTrialPeriod":"Get {{trialPeriod}} months of free <span>10Web Automated WordPress Hosting</span> on Google Cloud.","text_upgradeANdEnjoyOptimizing":"Upgrade now and enjoy your optimized website for <br/>{{trialPeriod}} month free. Your trial hosting expires&nbsp;","text_rechargePaymentFailedTitle":"Payment Failed","text_rechargePaymentFailedUnavailableGeneral":"<span>Payment Failed:</span> Complete your payment to avoid interruptions<br class=\'show-desktop\'/> and keep your website available.","text_rechargePaymentFailedUnavailable1":"Complete your payment to avoid interruptions and keep your website available.","text_rechargePaymentFailedUnavailable2":"Please make a payment to get plugin updates and premium customer support.","text_rechargePaymentFailedNotEnterprise":"If payment is not made, your website will become unavailable. Please retry.","text_rechargePaymentFailedEnterprise":"If payment is not made, you will not receive premium customer support and plugin updates. Please retry.","text_rechargePaymentFailedHeader":"Please make a payment to get plugin updates and premium customer support.","text_rechargePaymentFailedDesc1":"Please check that your payment information is up to date or use a different payment method,<br/> then retry. If payment is not made, your website will become unavailable.","text_rechargePaymentFailedDesc2":"Please check that your payment information is up to date or use a different payment method,<br/> then retry. If payment is not made, you will no longer receive premium<br/> customer support and plugin updates.","text_buildingWebsiteFor":"I am Building This Website For\u2026","text_describeQuestion1Title":"Welcome to 10Web","text_describeQuestion1Desc":"What role describes you the best?","text_describeQuestion2Desc":"What is the industry of your agency?","text_describeQuestion3Desc":"How many websites do you manage?","text_describeQuestion4Desc":"What is the main reason you are joining 10Web?","text_myself":"Myself","text_myClient":"My Client","text_digitalAgency":"Digital Agency","text_freelanceDeveloper":"Freelance Developer","text_smb":"Small or Medium-Sized Business","text_entrepreneur":"Entrepreneur","text_question2Option1":"Web development agency","text_question2Option2":"Marketing agency","text_question2Option3":"Design agency","text_question2Option4":"Other","text_question3Option1":"Under 10","text_question3Option2":"Under 50","text_question3Option3":"Under 100","text_question3Option4":"100+","text_question4Option1":"To get 90+ PageSpeed score","text_question4Option2":"To get a secure and reliable hosting","text_question4Option3":"To reduce hosting costs","text_question4Option4":"Other","text_starterFeature":"Unlock all of 10Web. Create or migrate 10 websites and explore our premium features for 7 Days.","text_boosterFeature":"Optimize the frontend of your entire website.<br/> Get additional 60% performance boost and unmatched<br/> security with Cloudflare Enterprise integration. ","text_introducingWorkspace":"Introducing Workspace & User Management","text_introducingWorkspaceDesc":"To facilitate website management, we have created Workspace, where you can:<br><br> 1. Invite co-workers or employees to your workspace. Collaborate, manage, and give them different roles and permissions.<br><br> 2. Accept invitations to join other workspaces and easily switch between them.","text_welcomeOwnActivityLog":"Introducing the new Activity Log!","text_welcomeOwnActivityLogDesc":"A whole new experience for monitoring the activities on 10Web. In this section, you can see all the actions that you & your teammates did on the 10Web dashboard.","text_welcomeOwnWorkspaceSwitch":"Switch Between Workspaces","text_welcomeOwnWorkspaceSwitchDesc":"Click on the workspace access drop down to change workspace.","text_welcomeOwnWorkspace":"Welcome to Your Own Workspace","text_welcomeOwnWorkspaceDesc":"1. Invite co-workers or employees to your workspace. Collaborate, manage, and give them different roles and permissions.<br><br> 2. Accept invitations to join other workspaces and easily switch between them.","text_inviteUsersSMBPaid":"Invite your team","text_inviteUsersSMBPaidDesc":"Bring in a developer to 10Web dashboard to build and manage your website.","text_inviteUsersSMBPaidButton":"INVITE YOUR DEVELOPER","text_inviteUsersSMBTrial":"Collaborate with your team","text_inviteUsersSMBTrialDesc":"Bring in your team members to 10Web dashboard to build and manage your website together.","text_inviteUsersSMBTrialButton":"INVITE YOUR TEAM","text_inviteUsersAgencyPaidButton1":"INVITE TEAM MEMBER","text_inviteUsersAgencyPaidButton2":"INVITE A CLIENT","text_inviteUsersAgencyTrialButton":"SEND AN INVITATION","text_inviteUsersAgency":"Invite your team & client to 10Web","text_inviteUsersAgencyDesc":"Bring in your developers and your clients to 10Web dashboard to improve collaboration in building and managing websites.","text_inviteUsersFreelancer":"Invite Your Client to 10Web","text_inviteUsersFreelancerDesc":"Bring in your clients to 10Web dashboard to improve collaboration in building and managing websites.","text_inviteUsersFreelancerButton":"INVITE YOUR CLIENT","text_inviteUsers":"Invite Users","text_emailAddresses":"Email Address(es)","text_usersLimit":"You can add up to 10 email addresses separated by commas.","text_workspaceAdmin":"Admin","text_workspaceAdminDescription":"Access to all workspace features & billing except user management.","text_workspaceDev":"Contributor","text_workspaceContributorDescription":"Access to adding, removing & managing all websites in the workspace. No access to user management, white label & billing. Perfect for lead developers & project managers.","text_workspaceMemberDescription":"Access only to selected websites\u2019 live or staging environments. Perfect for clients, developers, designers or marketers.","text_workspaceDevDescription":"Full access to websites only.<br> No access to user management, billing, white label, & workspace settings.","text_workspaceAccessDescription":"Full access to everything except user management or full access to websites only.<br> No access to billing & workspace settings.","text_siteAccessDescription":"Partial or full access to select websites. (Live/Staging environments)","text_siteFullAccessDescription":"Full access to select websites.<br>(Live/Staging environments)","text_siteStagingAccessDescription":"Access to staging environment only","text_improveYourWebsiteManagementFlow":"Improve Your Website <br>Management Workflow","text_improveTheWebsiteManagementFlow":"Improve The Website <br>Management Workflow","text_inviteTeamAndClientsCollaborate":"Invite your team and clients into a unified workspace to collaborate on websites together.","text_inviteMembersCollaborate":"Invite your team members into a unified workspace to collaborate on your website together.","text_inviteTeamOrMembersCollaborate":"Invite your team members or clients into a unified workspace to collaborate on the website together.","text_workspace":"{{workspaceName}}\u2019s Workspace","text_switchWorkspace":"Switch Workspace","text_workspaceUpdate":"Workspace is currently on 10Web\'s {{type}}.","text_workspaceUpdatePro":"{{type}}","text_workspaceUpdateProCurrentPlan":"Current plan: {{type}}","text_workspaceUpdateBooster":"Get 10Web Booster Pro","text_workspaceUpdateAiAssistant":"Get 10Web Pro","text_workspaceSettings":"Workspaces Settings","text_loadingTitle":"A Blank WordPress Website <br> is Being Installed on 10Web Hosting","text_loadingDesc":"Please wait and don\u2019t reload the page","text_loadingStep1":"Setting up the Hosting","text_loadingStep2":"Installing WordPress","text_loadingStep3":"Finalizing","text_automated-hosting":"Automated hosting on Google Cloud","text_automated-hosting-booster":"<span class=\'with-logo\'>Automated hosting add-on</span> <img src=\'../../../../../assets/images/logos/powered-by-google.png\'/>","text_price-per-website":"Price per website","text_price-per-website-tooltip-body":"Get website security, performance and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise.","text_price-per-website-booster-tooltip-body":"Migrate your website to 10Web\'s automated hosting on Google Cloud to get a 99.9% uptime, optimize your backend performance and get a multitude of website management tools.","text_wordpress-installs":"WordPress installs","text_wordpress-installs-tooltip-body":"Every install also includes a free staging environment for testing plugins, themes, and updates.","text_monthly-visits":"Visits","text_monthly-visits-tooltip-body":"For every 10K extra visitors you\u2019ll be charged an extra $2 at the end of the billing month.\\nVisits are measured by the total monthly traffic (unique IPs) to your site. These visits are distributed across all websites within your plan.","text_ssd-storage":"Storage","text_ssd-storage-tooltip-body":"All servers use the fastest SSD storage on Google Cloud with built-in redundancy to ensure data integrity.","text_real-time-backup-header":"Real-time backup","text_real-time-backup-tooltip-body":"Schedule automatic backups and restore a previous version of your site whenever needed.","text_99plus-uptime":"99.9% uptime","text_99plus-uptime-tooltip-body":"Websites hosted on 10Web are up and running 99.9% of the time without a glitch due to Google Cloud.","text_google-cloud":"Google cloud platform","text_google-cloud-tooltip-body":"Powered by Google Cloud, 10Web hosting is extremely fast and secure.","text_white-label":"White Label","text_white-label-tooltip-body":"White label your WordPress dashboard of websites hosted at 10Web and take your business to the next level.","text_multisite-support":"Multisite support","text_multisite-support-tooltip-body":"Install WordPress multisite and manage all aspects of your WordPress multisite from the 10Web dashboard.","text_client-management":"User & team management","text_client-management-tooltip-title":"User & Team Management","text_client-management-tooltip-body":"Create users and give them different permissions to your account and websites.","text_additional-sites":"Additional hosted sites","text_additional-websites":"Additional websites","text_additional-websites-tooltip-body":"Get more websites<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>${{price}}/mo</b> Per Site","text_additional-websites-tooltip-body6":"Get more websites<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>$6/mo</b> per site","text_additional-websites-tooltip-body8":"Get more websites<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>$8/mo</b> per site","text_additional-sites__enterprise-tooltip":"You can buy additional hosted<br/> websites after the upgrade<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>${{price}}/mo</b> per site<br/><b>+ 20K</b> visits</br><b>+ 5GB</b> SSD storage","text_additional-sites-tooltip-body":"Get more websites<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>${{price}}/mo</b> Per Site<br/><b>+ 20K</b> Visits</br><b>+ 5GB</b> SSD Storage","text_additional-sites-tooltip-body6":"Get more websites<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>$6/mo</b> Per Site<br/><b>+ 20K</b> Visits</br><b>+ 5GB</b> SSD Storage","text_additional-sites-tooltip-body8":"Get more websites<br/><i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-checkmark\\"></i> <b>$8/mo</b> Per Site<br/><b>+ 20K</b> Visits</br><b>+ 5GB</b> SSD Storage","text_whiteLabel-tooltip-body":"White label your WordPress dashboard of websites hosted at 10Web and take your business to the next level.","text_whiteLabelBooster-tooltip-body":"White label 10Web dashboard or 10Web Booster and take your business to the next level.","text_datacenter-locations":"12 datacenter locations","text_datacenter-locations-tooltip-body":"Choose between 12 global data center locations for each WordPress install. Your datacenter should be close to your visitors.","text_staging-area":"Staging area","text_staging-area-tooltip-body":"Stage and test the coming updates on your website\u2019s clone before publishing them.","text_automatic-backups":"Automatic daily backups","text_automatic-backups-tooltip-body":"Automatic daily system level backups are conducted for all sites. You can restore a website with a single-click.","text_php-support":"PHP 8.0 support","text_php-support-tooltip-body":"Use the latest and safest version of PHP on 10Web hosting.","text_premium-dns":"Premium DNS","text_premium-dns-tooltip-body":"Link the IPs to domains with a fast and secure Domain Name Service.","text_free-ssl":"Free SSL and SSH","text_free-ssl-tooltip-body":"10Web provides you with a free one-click SSL using Let\u2019s Encrypt integration and SSH access to automate your workflow.","text_imported-ssl":"Imported SSL certificates","text_imported-ssl-tooltip-body":"You can also install your own SSL certificate.","text_plugin-management":"Third-Party Plugin Management","text_plugin-management-tooltip-body":"Effortlessly manage plugins by all possible sources from the same unified dashboard.","text_wp-core-updates":"WordPress Core Updates","text_wp-core-updates-tooltip-body":"Easily update WordPress core through our intuitive dashboard.","text_db-optimization":"Automatic Database Optimization","text_db-optimization-tooltip-body":"Once a week, the 10Web platform automatically taylors MySQL database settings according to the needs of your website.","text_malware-program":"Malware Removal Program","text_malware-program-tooltip-body":"Infected and hacked sites are restored and cleaned for free while hosted at 10Web.","text_self-healing":"Self-Healing Technology","text_self-healing-tooltip-body":"Automatic restart of PHP if it has gone down.","text_1-click-migration":"<b>Automated Migration</b>","text_1-click-migration-tooltip-body":"Move your website to 10Web from any other hosting with just 1 click.","text_caching":"Caching","text_caching-tooltip-body":"Cache your website with Nginx FastCGI for faster load.","text_IO-service":"Image Optimization Service","text_IO-service-tooltip-body":"Compress your high resolution images for up to 90% without major quality loss.","text_website-builder":"AI Builder","text_ai-builder-regeneration":"Amount of website generations with AI","text_ai-builder-regeneration-tooltip-body":"Answer our brief questionnaire, and our AI-powered content generator will create tailored content and images for your business.","text_ai-builder-recreation-assistant":"AI recreation","text_ai-builder-recreation-assistant-tooltip-body":"Insert the URL of any web page you like to recreate the layout. It will inherit the design elements and header & footer of your homepage.","text_ai-builder-responsive-design":"Responsive design","text_ai-builder-responsive-design-tooltip-body":"Adapt any website you build to mobile, tablet or any other device with ease.","text_cloudflare-enterprise":"Cloudflare Enterprise","text_cloudflare-enterprise-booster":"Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_pro_optimization-booster":"Pro optimization","text_cloudflare-enterprise-hosted":"Cloudflare Enterprise CDN add-on","text_cloudflare-enterprise-tooltip-body":"Get website security, performance and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise included in all paid plans of 10Web.","text_cdn-website":"Websites with CDN","text_cdn-website-tooltip-body":"You can get additional website CDN and 100GB Bandwidth for $4/mo.","text_cdn-website-tooltip-body4":"You can get additional website CDN and 100GB Bandwidth for $4/mo.","text_cdn-website-tooltip-body5":"You can get additional website CDN and 100GB Bandwidth for $5/mo.","text_cdn-bandwidth":"CDN bandwidth","text_cdn-bandwidth-tooltip-body":"For every 50GB of extra bandwidth you\u2019ll be charged an extra $5 at the end of the billing month. 100GB of bandwidth is on average equivalent to 50K website visits.","text_ddos-protection":"DDoS attack protection","text_ddos-protection-tooltip-body":"Protect your website with Cloudflare\u2019s enterprise-grade unmetered mitigation of DDoS attacks.","text_faster-load-times":"Up to 10X faster load times","text_faster-load-times-booster":"2x faster load times","text_faster-load-times-gallery_desc":"Improve the website performance thanks to 10Web Booster Pro & Cloudflare Enterprise integration.","text_faster-load-times-booster-tooltip-body":"Improve the website performance thanks to Cloudflare Enterprise integration.","text_faster-higher-score-booster":"50% higher PageSpeed score","text_faster-higher-score-booster-tooltip-body":"Get an additional boost to your website PageSpeed score","text_faster-cache-locations":"275 caching locations worldwide","text_faster-load-times-tooltip-body":"275 data centers located across the globe provide visitors with location-based access to your website, while removing latency and improving performance.","text_ttfb":"Under 100ms TTFB","text_ttfb-tooltip-body":"Reduce the time it takes for your user\'s browser to receive the first batch of your data to under 100ms.","text_full-page-cache-network":"Full page caching on edge network","text_full-page-cache-network-tooltip-body":"Improve server response time and loading by enabling full page caching for static pages to read entirely from the cache.","text_waf":"Web Application Firewall (WAF)","text_waf-tooltip-body":"Cloudflare\u2019s Web Application Firewall protects your website from DDoS and Bot attacks, Brute force attacks, and other threats.","text_templates":"Theme builder","text_templates-tooltip-body":"Turn any web page into a template with our AI Builder, all without copying a single line of code.","text_drag&drop-editor":"Drag & drop live editor based <br>on Elementor","text_drag&drop-editor-booster":"Drag & drop live editor based on Elementor","text_drag&drop-editor-tooltip-body":"Edit newly built websites using the 10Web Editor based on Elementor. Drag and drop widgets and customize them to your own unique style.","text_premium-widgets":"50+ basic & pro widgets","text_premium-widgets-tooltip-body":"We have enhanced Elementor with our 50+ premium widgets.","text_automated-migration":"Automated 1-click migration","text_automated-migration-tooltip-body":"Move your website to 10Web from any other hosting with just 1 click.","text_malware-removal-program":"Malware removal program","text_malware-removal-program-tooltip-body":"Scheduled automatic scanning for security issues in your current versions of WordPress core, themes, plugins and unwanted changes made to your files.","text_freeSsl":"Free SSL certificate","text_Ssh-access":"SSH access","text_Ssh-access-tooltip-body":"SSH access automates your workflow and eliminates risks of man-in-the-middle attacks, keeping data transmissions private.","text_freeSsl-tooltip-body":"10Web provides you with a free one-click SSL using Let\u2019s Encrypt integration. The SSL certificate will automatically renew once expired, without additional interference.","text_wpPluginsUpdate":"WordPress and plugins update","text_wpPluginsUpdate-tooltip-body":"Easily update WordPress core through our intuitive dashboard","text_user-team-management":"User & Team Management","text_user-team-management-tooltip-body":"Collaborate with your team members and clients from one workspace. Invite your team to your workspace, give them granular access to work on different aspects of the site.","text_automated-real-time-backup":"Real-time Backup","text_cloud-storage":"Cloud storage","text_cloud-storage-tooltip-body":"Backup files are safely stored in AWS S3 Cloud.","text_sync-technology":"Sync technology","text_sync-technology-tooltip-body":"To save your time and space, only the changes that occurred after the last full backup are saved.","text_one-click-backup":"One-Click Backup of The Whole Site","text_one-click-backup-tooltip-body":"Just click once and your website backup is ready.","text_one-click-restore":"One-click restore","text_one-click-restore-tooltip-body":"Restore your website to a previous version with just a click.","text_backup-download":"Backup download","text_backup-download-tooltip-body":"Download your backups for extra security.","text_real-time":"Real Time Scheduling","text_real-time-tooltip-body":"Schedule your active website to automatically backup every single hour.","text_customized-backup":"Customized backup","text_customized-backup-tooltip-body":"No intentions for a full backup? Customize your backup by manually selecting the files you want to backup.","text_security-scanner":"<b>Security Scanner</b>","text_security-scanner-tooltip-body":"Scheduled automatic scanning for security issues in your current versions of WordPress core, themes, plugins and unwanted changes made to your files.","text_seo-plugin":"<b>SEO Plugin</b>","text_seo-plugin-tooltip-body":"Set metas, create knowledge graphs, manage site indexing, monitor redirects, and get recommendations to optimize your website SEO.","text_analytics-reports":"<b>Analytics Reports</b>","text_analytics-reports-tooltip-body":"Get a full analysis of your site visits and storage usage reports.","text_email-assistance":"Email assistance","text_email-assistance-tooltip-body":"Submit tickets with any issues you have and our team will get back to you in the shortest time.","text_chat":"Real-time chatbox assistance 24/7","text_chat-tooltip-body":"Our customer support team is at your service 24/7. Reach out to us anytime.","text_top-rated":"Top rated support: 4.9/5 rating on Trustpilot","text_top-rated-tooltip-body":"Our company\'s support is the gold standard in the industry, consistently earning top ratings from satisfied customers.","text_slack-channel":"Slack channel: direct access to 10Web\u2019s engineers","text_slack-channel-tooltip-body":"Improve your experience with our company by gaining direct access to our team of experts through our Slack channel.","text_compatibility":"Compatibility","text_supportForElementor":"Support for Elementor, DIVI, Beaver,<br/>Gutenberg and more","text_supportForElementor-tooltip-body":"10Web Booster has been tested with many website builders including industry leaders like Elementor, DIVI, Beaver, Gutenberg and more.","text_dynamicCacheWoo":"Dynamic caching for Woo-commerce","text_dynamicCacheWoo-tooltip-body":"Unleash the power of lightning-fast page loading and smooth user experience with our dynamic caching technology for WooCommerce, designed to boost your sales and customer satisfaction.","text_majorHostingProviders":"All major hosting providers:<br/>Siteground, Bluehost, Godaddy and more","text_majorHostingProviders-tooltip-body":"10Web Booster has been tested on many website hostings including industry leaders like Siteground, Bluehost, Godaddy, WPEngine, Kinsta and more.","text_testedOnTop":"Tested on top 200 WP plugins and themes","text_testedOnTop-tooltip-body":"10Web Booster was thoroughly tested with the top 200 WordPress plugins and themes for maximum compatibility and efficiency.","text_vip-support":"VIP support","text_vip-support-tooltip-bosy":"Receive top priority assistance from our superstar support team.","text_userManagement":"User & Team Management","text_userAndTeamManagement":"User & Team Management","text_updateUserRole":"Update user role","text_workspaceInfo":"Workspace info","text_billingDetails":"Billing details","text_invoices":"Invoices","text_addOwnWorkspace":"Add Own Workspace","text_addWorkspace":"Add Workspace","text_vip-support-tooltip-body":"Directly connect with our VIP support team through our dedicated Slack channel to solve any issue.","text_frontendSpeedIncludes":"Frontend speed optimization","text_frontendSpeedBooster":"Booster","text_frontendSpeed0":"90+ PageSpeed score","text_frontendSpeed1":"Improved Core Web Vitals","text_frontendSpeed2":"Image optimization","text_frontendSpeed3":"Caching","text_cdn-boost":"Up to 60% performance boost","text_frontendSpeed5":"Auto optimization of images","text_frontendSpeed6":"Custom optimization rules","text_frontendSpeed0-tooltip-body":"We achieve 90+ PageSpeed through a series of technical actions including: <br>- CSS & HTML Minification & Compression <br>- JS Minification and Compression <br>- Image Lazyload <br>- Font Swap <br>- iFrame and Video Lazyload","text_frontendSpeed1-tooltip-body":"10Web helps you pass Core Web Vitals Assessment by: <br>- Using Critical CSS <br>- Preload images <br>- Optimize font delivery <br>- Use web workers<br>- Delay or remove non-critical third-party","text_frontendSpeed2-tooltip-body":"10Web optimizes website images through a number of activities: <br>- Converting Image Format to WebP <br>- Container-specific Image Resizing <br>- Lossy reduction <br>- Keeping Full-sized images","text_frontendSpeed3-tooltip-body":"10Web\u2019s advanced caching mechanism caches everything and re-optimizes edited pages to continuously decrease load time.","text_cdn-boost-tooltip-body":"Increase your website performance by up to additional 60% by enabling Cloudflare Enterprise CDN on your website.","text_frontendSpeed5-tooltip-body":"Automatically optimize images uploaded to the media library.","text_frontendSpeed6-tooltip-body":"Customize and manage optimization modes of specific pages on your website.","text_backendSpeedIncludesBooster":"Backend speed optimization <span class=\'notice\'>Only on 10Web hosting</span>","text_backendSpeedIncludes":"Backend speed optimization","text_backendSpeed0":"Google Cloud Premium Tier network","text_backendSpeed0-tooltip-body":"Premium Tier delivers GCP traffic over Google\u2019s well-provisioned, low latency, highly reliable global network.","text_backendSpeed1":"TTFB faster than 200ms","text_backendSpeed1-tooltip-body":"TTFB measures how much time it takes from the initial request for a web page until the first byte of data is returned. If TTFB is slower than 200ms, it affects the overall Server response time, user experience and SEO.","text_backendSpeed2":"Server performance acceleration","text_backendSpeed2-tooltip-body":"Total time of execution calculated by running several tests on PHP and MySQL. This metric affects the speed of WordPress admin and dynamic pages.","text_backendSpeed3":"WordPress performance boost","text_backendSpeed3-tooltip-body":"Time it takes to perform 1000 queries \u2014 250 insert, select, update and delete functions through $wpdb.","text_backendSpeed4":"Up-to-date version of MySQL","text_backendSpeed4-tooltip-body":"10Web supports the up-to-date MySQL version for a faster database and faster performance.","text_backendSpeed5":"Up-to-date PHP version","text_backendSpeed5-tooltip-body":"10Web supports the up-to-date PHP version to improve code execution performance and speed.","text_backendSpeed6":"Database optimization","text_backendSpeed6-tooltip-body":"Optimization of a database (MySQL) specifically designed for WordPress websites.","text_backendSpeed7":"Faster WP Admin & dynamic pages","text_backendSpeed7-tooltip-body":"10Web hosting and subsequent features speed up WP Admin & dynamic pages, minimizing wait time and improving overall experience.","text_removeFeedbackHeader":"You Are About to Permanently Remove<br> Your Website. Please Specify The Reason.","text_removeFeedbackThxHeader":"Thank You For Your Feedback","text_MaxCharLimit":"Maximum character limit is {{limit}}.","text_selectSites":"Select Sites","text_userManagement__invite":"Invite users to your workspace for collaboration.<br> Users can have access to the entire workspace or to specific websites.","text_userManagement__upgrade":"Upgrade now to invite users to your workspace to collaborate. <br> Each user can have access to the whole workspace or only specific sites.","text_userManagement__add-user":"You can add new users or change existing permissions. <br> Each user can have access to the whole company or only specific sites.","text_leaveWorkspace":"Leave Workspace","text_leaveWorkspaceQuestion":"Are you sure you want to leave?</span>","text_leaveWorkspaceConsequence":"Access to <span>{{workspaceName}} Workspace</span> will be revoked.","text_leaveWorkspaceTypePassword":"To leave workspace, please enter your password","text_removeUser":"Remove User","text_removeUserQuestion":"Are you sure you want to remove <b>{{user}}?</b>","text_removeUserConsequence":"Access will be revoked from <b>{{workspaceName}} workspace.</b>","text_removeUserTypePassword":"To remove user, please enter your password <span class=\'red_star\'>*</span>","text_removeUserWPAdminNotifier":"Removing {{user}} from your workspace will not remove WordPress Admin Dashboard users associated with this account.","text_removeUserWPAdminCheck":"I understand that I should remove them manually","text_workspaceAccess":"Workspace access","text_switchingWorkspace":"Switching to {{workspaceName}} Workspace","text_doNotRefresh":"Please do not refresh","text_stagingAccessOnly":"Access to staging environment only","text_pushToLiveDecline":"You have no permission to push<br> staging to live. Please, contact<br> with workspace owner.","text_syncWithLiveDecline":"You have no permission to sync<br> staging with live. Please, contact<br> with workspace owner.","text_migrationFailed":"You don\u2019t have permission to create or copy a website<br> In this workspace, you must switch to the appropriate<br> workspace or contact the owner of this workspace.","text_localTimeZone":"Select your local time zone","text_EmailAddressBellow":"Below is your current email address.","text_resetPasswordLinkInfo":"A link to reset your password will be sent to your email.","text_google2fa":"Google two-factor authentication","text_invalidWorkspaceName":"Workspace name should not contain URL.","text_EmailExceededLimit":"Please enter a maximum of 10 emails to proceed.","text_EmailDuplicate":"Please remove duplicate emails to proceed.","text_OwnEmailInviteError":"You\u2019re already here. Please enter a different email.","text_EmailsExist":"Email(s) already exist.","text_upgradeToAiBuilder":"Do You Want to Use AI Builder with Your Hosting?","text_upgradeToAiBuilderPlanIncludes":"Plan includes","text_upgradeToAiBuilderOpt1":"Unlimited Websites","text_upgradeToAiBuilderOpt2":"AI Recreation Assistant","text_upgradeToAiBuilderOpt3":"90+ Basic & Pro Widgets","text_upgradeToAiBuilderOpt4":"Drag & Drop Editor Based on Elementor","text_upgradeToAiBuilderOpt5":"Theme builder","text_upgradeToAiBuilderOpt6":"Responsive design","text_upgradeToAiBuilderDesc":"This plan allows you to create unlimited websites with our AI Builder on any hosting provider. You can also purchase 10Web-hosted websites later without switching plans.","text_installActivatePluginWP":"Install & activate the plugin from the WP admin","text_chooseProceed":"Choose How You Want To Proceed","text_createNewWPWebsite":"Create a Brand New WordPress<br> Website on 10Web Hosting","text_recreateWithAi":"Recreate any website with AI","text_builderBasedElementor":"Try 10Web builder-based on Elementor","text_useThemePlugin":"Build your website using any theme & plugin","text_automatedMigration":"Automated Migration <br> to Get 90+ PageSpeed Score","text_copyWithoutAffectingWebsite":"Get a copy of your website without affecting the live website","text_anyHostedGet90score":"Any Website Hosted on 10Web Automatically Gets 90+ PageSpeed Score","text_migrateAndTestYour":"Migrate<br/> your website","text_migrateClientsWebsite":"Migrate Your<br/> Client\u2019s Website","text_optimizeWebsite":"Optimize your website<br/> on your existing hosting","text_migrateOpportunityClients":"Unlike other hosting companies, 10Web gives you an opportunity to migrate<br/> your client\u2019s websites & fully test their performance without upgrading to a paid plan.","text_migrateWebsiteFully":"Migrate your websites to 10Web & fully test their performance on a new hosting.","text_migrateWebsiteFullySMB":"Migrate your website to 10Web & fully test its performance on a new hosting.","text_optimizeWebsiteSubTitle":"Speed up your website with 10Web booster and instantly get a 90+ PageSpeed score.","text_installationWontAffect":"Installation of the plugin won\u2019t affect your actual website.","text_installationWontAffectOptimize":"Installation of the plugin won\u2019t affect your live website.","text_zendeskHeader":"Verify Your Email","text_zendeskDesc":"We\u2019ve sent an email to <b>{{email}}</b> to verify your account and grant access to 10Web Help Center. Please check your email.","text_upgradeToHigherPlanDesc":"You currently have {{domainCount}} Hosted Websites. Please choose a higher plan to upgrade.","text_helpImprove10Web":"Help Us Improve 10Web","text_helpImprove10WebDesc":"Help us build a better experience for you by answering these questions\u2024<br> Won\'t take more than 5 seconds.","text_helpImprove10WebInfo":"How would you best describe yourself as?","text_helpImprove10WebOption1":"Digital Agency","text_helpImprove10WebOption2":"Freelance Developer or Designer","text_helpImprove10WebOption3":"E-commerce","text_helpImprove10WebOption4":"Blogger","text_helpImprove10WebOption5":"Other Business","text_helpImprove10WebWhoBuild":"Who are you building this website for?","text_helpImprove10WebWhoCreateTitle":"Thank You For<br/> Completing the Survey","text_helpImprove10WebWhoCreateDesc":"This information will be used to improve 10Web and provide<br/> a better website maintenance experience.","text_smbHireDeveloperTitle":"Who is going to build your website?","text_smbHireDeveloperOption1":"I\u2019ll build it myself","text_smbHireDeveloperOption2":"I\u2019ll invite my developer","text_smbHireDeveloperOption3":"I\u2019m planning to hire a developer","text_hireDevSlackTitle":"Get Connected With a 10Web Approved Agency or Freelancer","text_hireDevSlackDesc":"Join a dedicated Slack channel to connect with your personal Account Manager.<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> We have a list of hundreds of partners and will find the perfect one for your project.","text_hireDevSlackSuccessNote":"<span>Note.</span>You will be prompted to create an account on clicking the \u201cJoin Slack\u201d button in the email.","text_hireDevSlackSuccessTitle":"Request Sent","text_hireDevSlackSuccessDesc1":"You will receive a Slack invitation from your personal Account Manager<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> in less than 12 hours. Don\u2019t forget to check your email.","text_hireDevSlackSuccessDesc2":" If you don\u2019t receive an email within 12 hours, please contact customer<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> support via live chat.","text_getVipSupportSlackTitle":"Get VIP Support in Slack","text_getVipSupportSlackDesc":"Please write your email to be in direct communication with our Director of <br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' />Customer<br class=\'db-mobile\' /> Care in a dedicated Slack channel created<br class=\'db-mobile\' /> just for you.","text_getVipSupportSlackSentDesc":"You will receive a Slack invitation from our <br class=\'db-mobile\' />Director of Customer care<br/> in less than 12<br class=\'db-mobile\' /> hours. Don\u2019t forget to check your email.","text_getVipSupportSlackSentDescAdditional":"If you don\u2019t receive an email within 12 hours,<br class=\'db-mobile\' /> please contact customer<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> support via live chat.","text_getVipSupportSlackSentNote":"You will be prompted to create an<br class=\'db-mobile\' /> account on clicking the \u201cJoin Slack\u201d<br class=\'db-mobile\' /> button in the email.","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogTitle":"Unlock all of 10Web for free","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogDesc":"Add your own workspace and<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> explore 10Web for free.","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyTitle":"Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll get:","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyStep1Title":"Create & migrate multiple websites","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyStep1Desc":"Easily create or migrate websites to<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> 10Web\u2019s<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\' /> Google Cloud Partner hosting<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> and automatically<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\' /> get 90+ PageSpeed<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> score.","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyStep3Title":"Become a 10Web expert","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyStep3Desc":"Get discovered by numerous businesses <br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' />hosted on 10Web who need your expertise.<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> Grow your client base without much effort<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> from your side.","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyStep2Title":"Collaborate with your team & clients","text_addOwnWorkspaceDialogBodyStep2Desc":" Invite your team or clients into a unified<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> workspace<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\' /> to improve website<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> management workflow.","text_noCardRequired":"No credit card required","text_availablePlugin":"Also available on WordPress.org","text_disabledAddWebsiteTooltip":"You can\u2019t add a new website while<br/> creation or migration are in progress.","text_migrationInProgressTitle":"The migration of your website<br/> to 10Web is on it\u2019s way","text_migrationInProgressDesc":"It will take some time depending on the size of your website.","text_migrationInProgressEnableNotif":"enabling push notifications","text_migrationInProgressEnableNotifDesc":"Get notified when your website migration is completed by","text_migrationInProgressEnabledNotifDesc":"Push notifications are enabled. We will notify you when the migration is completed.","text_migrationInProgressSlider":"Here\u2019s what you\u2019re gonna get:","text_migrationSuccessMobileSpeed":"Your Mobile PageSpeed score has increased by {{percent}}%","text_migrationSuccessFastestWebsite":"Your website is now in the top 1% fastest websites of the world\u2024","text_setupTitle":"What do you want to do?","text_setupDesc":"Choose how you want to proceed and we\u2019ll help you get started. Simply follow the steps below.","text_setupChangeHostingBlockTitle":"Migrate WordPress <br class=\'hide-mobile\'/>site to 10Web hosting","text_setupChangeHostingBlockDesc":"Host your WordPress website on 10Web","text_setupOptimizeBlockTitle":"Optimize<br/> a WordPress website","text_setupOptimizeBlockDesc":"Get 90+ PageSpeed<br/> score on any hosting","text_setupCreateBlockTitle":"Create a new <br class=\'hide-mobile\'/>website with AI","text_setupCreateBlockDesc":"Our AI tool will generate tailored content & images","text_setupConvertBlockTitle":"Convert a non-WordPress <br class=\'hide-mobile\'/>site<br class=\'show-mobile\'/> to WordPress with AI","text_setupConvertBlockDesc":"Insert a URL to recreate its layout with AI","text_setupCreateWithPluginBlockTitle":"Install a blank<br/> WP website","text_setupCreateWithPluginBlockDesc":"Use your own<br/> theme & plugins","text_setupOtherBlockTitle":"Looking for<br/>Something Else?","text_setupOtherBlockDesc":"Tell us what you need","text_setupInstallBlankBlockTitle":"Install a blank<br/>WP website","text_setupInstallBlankBlockDesc":"Use own theme and plugins","text_setupFooterDesc":"We\'ll guide you through our setup process to match 10Web with your specific needs. Simply follow the steps above.","text_setupFooterSkipDesc":"If you want to explore 10Web yourself, ","text_setupOtherStepTitle":"Looking for Something Else?","text_setupOtherStepDesc":"Please select the category you need help with.","text_setupOtherStepTextareaDesc":"Please let us know how we can help you below","text_setupOtherStepSuccessTitle":"Thank You for Your Contribution","text_setupOtherStepSuccessDesc":"Our team members will evaluate your request and come back with<br/> a solution on how to improve your experience with 10Web in less than 24 hours.<br/> Make sure to check your email.","text_setupOtherStepSuccessDescFooter":"Until then you can explore 10Web dashboard and functionality.","text_setupOtherStepPluginsQuestion":"Plugins Related Question","text_setupOtherStepPluginsQuestionDesc":"Form Maker, Gallery or bundle","text_setupOtherStepOtherQuestion":"I Have Other Questions","text_setupOtherStepOtherQuestionDesc":"Describe how we can help","text_setupMoveHostingTitle":"Move to 10Web","text_setupMoveHostingDesc":"Please select the type of the website you want to migrate.","text_setupMoveHostingMigrate":"Migrate <br class=\'brdesktop\'/>a WordPress <br class=\'brmobile\'/>Website to 10Web","text_setupMoveHostingOneClickMigrate":"1 click automated migration","text_setupMoveHostingConvertFromAnyPlatform":"Convert <br class=\'brdesktop\'/>to WordPress <br class=\'brmobile\'/>from Any Platform","text_setupMoveHostingRecreateWithAi":"Recreate your website with AI","text_submit":"Submit","text_createWebsiteStepTitle":"Create a Website","text_createWebsiteStepDesc":"Choose how you want to build your new website.","text_createWebsiteStepAiTitle":"AI Builder","text_createWebsiteStepAiDesc":"Recreate any website<br/> with AI assistance","text_createWebsiteStepTemplateTitle":"Templates","text_createWebsiteStepTemplateDesc":"Choose one of 10Web\'s<br/> designer-made templates","text_createWebsiteStepPluginTitle":"Your Theme & Plugins","text_createWebsiteStepPluginDesc":"Build a new website<br/> from scratch","text_createWebsiteOptionsStepDesc":"First let\'s create a blank WordPress website\u2024","text_oneMonthFreeDialogTitle":"Try 10Web Pro for free for 7 days","text_oneMonthFreeDialogDesc":"Build, host and optimize multiple websites using<br/>all premium features of 10Web.","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyTitle":"Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll get:","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep1Title":"Advanced Features","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep1Desc":"Unlock and test Staging environment, SFTP, SSH,<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\' /> Real-time automated backups and more.","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep2Title":"Dedicated Slack Channel for VIP support","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep2Desc":"Connect with our engineers and work with them directly to solve any issues as quickly as possible.","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep3Title":"Manage Multiple Websites Simultaneously","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep3Desc":"Save time by managing and maintaining multiple websites from a single intuitive dashboard.","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep4Title":"Cancel Anytime","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep4Desc":"We will send you a reminder email 24 hours before the end of the period.","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep1TitleNew":"Get a reliable Google Cloud Partner hosting","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep2TitleNew":"Use our drag & drop editor based on Elementor","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep3TitleNew":"Get 90+ PageSpeed with 10Web Booster","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep4TitleNew":"Enable real-time automated backups","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep5TitleNew":"Use staging environment","text_oneMonthFreeDialogBodyStep6TitleNew":"Turn on white labeling","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep1TitleNew":"Get a reliable Google Cloud Partner hosting","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep2TitleNew":"Generate content and images with AI builder","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep3TitleNew":"Use 10Web editor based on Elementor","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep4TitleNew":"Get 90+ PageSpeed with 10Web Booster","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep5TitleNew":"Create more pages and websites with AI","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep6TitleNew":"Enable real-time automated backups","text_oneMonthFreeOverviewStep7TitleNew":"Turn on white labeling","text_optimizeWithMigrateGet90PageSpeedScore":"Get a 90+ PageSpeed Score","text_optimizeWithMigrateTitle":"Migrate & optimize your website\u2019s PageSpeed score","text_optimizeWithMigrateDesc":"10Web is the most powerful automated hosting for WordPress. You will get 90+ PageSpeed Score<br/> and boost Core Web Vitals after migrating your website \u2013 all within minutes, all automatically.","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebServiceHosting":"Get the best results with the combination of our optimization service & hosting","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackages":"With 10Web you get the full package of website hosting and optimization","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackage1Title":"Pass Core Web<br/> Vitals Assessment","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackage1Desc":"for every website you host<br/> on 10Web","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackage2Title":"Get 90+ PageSpeed<br/> on Desktop & Mobile","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackage2Desc":"like 98% of all websites hosted<br/> on 10Web","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackage3Title":"Improve Website<br/> Rankings","text_optimizeWithMigrate10WebPackage3Desc":"double the ROAS and<br/> conversions","text_notReadyToChangeHosting":"Not ready to change your hosting yet?","text_boosterPlugin":"10Web Booster Plugin","text_boosterPluginDesc":"Use our plugin to optimize your website\u2019s performance on your own hosting.","text_optimizeWithMigrateFooterTitle":"Do you want to optimize a website on your own hosting?","text_optimizeWithMigrateFooterSpeedOptimizer":"Speed Optimizer Plugin","text_optimizeWithMigrateFooterSpeedOptimizerDesc":"Use our plugin to optimize your website\u2019s performance on your own hosting.","text_buySpeedOptimizerTitle":"Get 10Web Speed Optimizer Plugin","text_automatedBackups":"Automated daily backups","text_automatedBackupsFeature1":"Schedule daily, weekly or monthly automatic backups on Amazon S3 cloud storage.","text_automatedBackupsFeature2":"Perform incremental backups & save space by backing up only the changes made.","text_automatedBackupsFeature3":"Restore the backed up version of your website with a click.","text_informativeBtnText":"Try 10Web Pro for 7 Days","text_informativeBannerStagingTitle":"Staging Environment","text_informativeBannerStagingFeature1":"Easily test all website changes and plugin updates.","text_informativeBannerStagingFeature2":"Push all your changes to live with 1 click.","text_informativeBannerStagingFeature3":"Instantly revert your changes in the staging environment.","text_informativeBannerIoTitle":"World\u2019s Best WordPress <br class=\\"db-show-mobile\\"/>Image Optimizer","text_informativeBannerIoFeature1":"Make your images lighter without quality loss.","text_informativeBannerIoFeature2":"Choose between different modes of compressions.","text_informativeBannerIoFeature3":"Automatically optimize the images uploaded to your WordPress website.","text_informativeBannerIoFeature4":"Convert jpg to png, gif to png, jpg to webP, and back.","text_addTagTitle":"Add a new tag","text_addTagBtn":"Add","text_removeTag":"Remove tag","text_removeTagDesc":"If you delete the <b>{{ tagTitle }}</b> tag , it will be removed from all the websites containing that tag.","text_addTagPlaceholder":"Add a tag","text_activityLog":"Activity Log","text_letsCustomize":"Customize your experience <br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\' /> by telling<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\' /> us about yourself.","text_letsCustomizeBooster":"Start the optimization and customize your experience by telling<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\' /> us about yourself.","text_multisite_network":"Multisite Network","text_site_multisite_network":"Sites in this multisite network","text_demo":"Demo","text_edit_website":"Edit Website","text_live_environment":"Live Environment","text_test_settings_staging_env":"Test all changes before pushing your website to live.","text_php_is_restarting":"PHP is restarting.","text_supports_reg_expresions":"Also supports regular expressions","text_https_enabled":"HTTPS is enabled","text_urls_removed":"The URLs has been removed from the cache.","text_url_removed":"The URL has been removed from the cache.","text_urls_hasnt_removed":"The URLs hasn\'t been removed from the cache. Please try again.","text_url_hasnt-removed":"The URL hasn\'t been removed from the cache. Please try again.","text_page_deleted":"Your page was successfully deleted","text_page_added":"Your page was successfully added","text_page_reoptimized":"Your page was successfully reoptimized","text_site_cache_cleared":"Site cache cleared successfully","text_site_ob_cache_cleared":"Site object cache cleared successfully","text_site_cache_enabled":"Site cache enabled successfully","text_site_ob_cache_enabled":"Site object cache enabled successfully","text_site_cache_disabled":"Site cache disabled successfully","text_site_ob_cache_disabled":"Site object cache disabled successfully","text_php_restarted":"PHP restarted successfully","text_ttl_changes":"Site cache TTL changed successfully","text_generate_free_ssl":"Generate free SSL certificate","text_remove_free_ssl":"Remove SSL certificate","text_add_free_ssl":"Add custom SSL certificate","text_speedOptimizer":"Website Booster","text_speedOptimizerFrontEnd":"Main","text_speedOptimizerPages":"Pages","text_speedOptimizerImageOptimizer":"Image Optimizer","text_speedOptimizerCloudflare":"Cloudflare CDN","text_speedOptimizerSettings":"Settings","text_speedOptimizerBackEnd":"Hosting Performance","text_speedOptimizerPro":"10Web Booster","text_speedOptimizerGeneralTab":"General","text_speedOptimizerIOTab":"Image optimizer","text_speedOptimizerSettingsTab":"Settings","text_speedOptimizerCustomRulesTab":"Custom rules","text_speedOptimizerTitle":"Optimize all images of your website","text_ioOptimizerTitle":"1-click optimization from Media library","text_ioOptimizerDesc":"Improve image loading & website performance by compressing media library images with a single click.","text_ioOptimizerExtremeTooltip":"This mode will significantly reduce image<br/> quality for maximum compression.","text_ioOptimizerTitleTooltip":"The selected mode will be default for future<br/> optimizations unless you select another<br/> mode before optimizing other images.","text_ioOptimizerImagesAllOptimized":"{{count}} images in media library ({{full}} full-sized) are optimized","text_ioOptimizerNoImages":"{{count}} images in media library ({{full}} full-sized)","text_ioOptimizerImagesReady":"The number of optimized images<br/> in your media library.","text_ioOptimizerAllSet":"You are all set","text_ioOptimizerReady":"You are all set","text_ioOptimizerNoImagesToOptimize":"No Images to optimize","text_ioOptimizerReadyToOptimizeDesc":"The number of images in your media library that<br/> need optimization for faster loading.","text_ioOptimizerImagesCount":"{{count}}<span>images</span>","text_ioOptimizerWebPDesc":"Serve images in WebP format.","text_ioOptimizerWebPDescPic":"This will use <picture> tags for images, may break themes in some cases.","text_speedOptimizerTooltip":"WordPress automatically creates several<br/> sizes of each image you upload to the<br/> media library. Therefore the number of<br/> images in your media library is bigger than<br/> the number of full-sized images uploaded.","text_speedOptimizerDesc":"Reduce image size by up to 40% without compromising the quality.","text_speedOptimizerReady":"Ready for Optimization","text_speedOptimizerNoImagesOptimize":"No Images to Optimize","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimization":"Automatic Optimization","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimizationFree":"Automated optimization <i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-diamond\\"></i>","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimizeDesc":"Automatically optimize images uploaded to the media library.","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimizeDescFree":"Automatically optimize new images uploaded to the media library.","text_speedOptimizerWebPFormat":"WebP format","text_speedOptimizerServeImagesWebPFormat":"Serve images in WebP format.<br/> This will use\\n &lt;picture&gt; \\ntags for images, may break themes in some cases.","text_speedOptimizerWebPFormatDesc":"Serve images in WebP format by autoconfiguring the .htaccess file for server side serving.","text_speedOptimizerWebPFormatHostedDesc":"Automatically serve images in WebP format.","text_speedOptimizerNote":"To serve WebP images by server configuration, follow ","text_speedOptimizerNoteAfterCompleting":"After completing the configuration press the refresh button to check the status.","text_speedOptimizerWentWrong":"<b>Something Went Wrong. </b>An Error occurred while optimizing images, please <a href=\\"https://help.10web.io/hc/en-us/requests/new\\" target=\'_blank\' rel=\\"noopener\\">contact us</a>.","text_serverConfiguration":"Server configuration (Recommended)","text_usePictureTags":"Use <picture> tags","text_usePictureTagsDesc1":"Serve WebP images via <picture> tags replacement.","text_usePictureTagsDesc2":"In some cases this option might break your website.","text_speedOptimizerNow":"optimize now","text_speedOptimizerImagesCount":"{{count}}<span>/images</span>","text_speedOptimizerImagesCountFree":"{{count}} <span> images</span>","text_speedOptimizerImagesInLibrary":"{{count}} images in media library ({{full}} full-sized)","text_speedOptimizerImagesInLibraryFree":"Image optimization is performed only on 6 pages included in Free plan","text_speedOptimizerImagesAllOptimized":"{{count}} images in media library ({{full}} full-sized) are optimized","text_speedOptimizerAllSet":"You are All Set","text_speedOptimizerLastOptimization":"Last optimization","text_speedOptimizerTotalReduction":"Total reduction","text_websiteCaching":"Website caching","text_websiteCachingDesc":"Serving static page cache improves the server response time.","text_websiteTestMode":"Test mode","text_websiteTestModeDesc":"Temporarily disable 10Web Booster for website visitors.<br> To preview the version optimized with 10Web Booster append <b>?twbooster=1</b> to your URL. <a>Learn more</a>","text_entirelyClearCache":"Entirely clear your website cache","text_entirelyClearCacheDesc":"A page will be cached again after the first visitor opens the page.","text_defaultOptMode":"Optimization levels","text_settingsWhiteLabel":"White label","text_settingsWhiteLabelDesc":"White label 10Web Booster in this website\u2019s WordPress dashboard.","text_settingsWhiteLabelDesc1":"The white label will be applied on:","text_whiteLabelOffer":"Available with Agency plan","text_whiteLabelAgency":"To manage white label, follow the link ","text_defaultOptModeDesc":"Levels affect all pages except the ones added in the Custom Rules list.<br/> Changing the mode also clears the entire cache.<br/> <p class=\'mt20\'>Switch between different levels to find the best settings for your website.</p>","text_cacheCannotCleared":"Website Cache Cannot be Cleared: ","text_speedSettings":"Settings","text_speedSettingsStandard":"Standard","text_speedSettingsStandardDesc":"Standard techniques","text_speedSettingsBalanced":"Balanced","text_speedSettingsBalancedDesc":"Standard + Critical CSS","text_speedSettingsStrong":"Strong","text_speedSettingsStrongDesc":"Standard +<br/> JS Delay","text_speedSettingsExtreme":"Extreme","text_speedSettingsExtremeDesc":"All the techniques","text_speedSettingsPro":"PRO","text_speedSettingsExtremePro":"All techniques + CDN","text_speedRestore":"Restore original images","text_speedRestoreDesc":"Restore all original images that were optimized.","text_clearCacheDialog":"Clear All Cache","text_clearCacheDescDialog":"Your website cache will be cleared. A page will be cached again after the first visitor opens the page.","text_clearCacheBtnDialog":"Clear","text_restoreOriginalImages":"Restore Original Images","text_restoreOriginalImagesDesc":"All original images will be restored. You can optimize them again via Image Optimizer.","text_restoreOriginalImagesBtn":"Restore","text_customRulesBtn":"Optimize","text_customRulesBtnPaid":"Add to List","text_customRulesFree":"Optimize additional pages","text_customRulesFreeDesc":"Add the URLs of pages you want to optimize and manage","text_customRulesPaid":"Page management","text_customRulesPaidDesc":"To manage optimization settings for individual pages, add them to the list.","text_successfullyUpgradedFromBooster":"Successfully upgraded to<br/> {{subscription}}","text_ecommerceCompleteSetupTitle":"Setup flow","text_ecommerceCompleteSetupTitleNew":"Let\u2019s finalize your website setup","text_successfullyUpgradedFromAi":"Successfully upgraded<br/> to {{subscription}}","text_upgradedFromBoosterPlanInfo":"Plan includes optimization & hosting for {{count}} website{{plural}}:","text_upgradedFromBoosterTrialInfo":"Plan includes optimization & CDN for {{count}} website{{plural}}:","text_upgradedFromBoosterTrialInfoAgency":"Plan includes optimization for unlimited websites:","text_upgradedSuccessFullyDesc":"The plan includes:","text_upgradedPlanInfo":"Plan includes optimization & hosting for {{count}} website{{plural}}:","text_successfullyUpgraded":"Successfully upgraded<br/> to {{subscription}}","text_successfullyUpgradedDemo":"You got 10Web {{subscription}} for","text_successfullyUpgradedDemoHeader":"7 days for free","text_successfullyUpgradedDemoDesc":"We\u2019re adding the final touches for a smooth start.","text_successfullyUpgradedDemoDescSuccess":"Grow your online store with 10Web Pro features.","text_successfullyUpgradedDemoDescSuccessBasic":"Grow your online business with 10Web Pro features.","text_cantUpgrade":"You Can\u2019t Upgrade to This Plan","text_cantUpgradeDesc":"There are already {{count}} websites added to your workspace, please select a higher plan or delete your websites.","text_downgrade":"Your Workspace is Now on Free Plan","text_downgradeDesc":"Since your payment method was declined, we were forced to move your <br/>workspace to an optimizer free plan. Here are the changes that were made:","text_downgradeWebsitesMoved":"{{count}} websites were moved to free version of optimizer plugin","text_downgradeWebsitesDeleted":"{{count}} hosted websites were deleted","text_downgradeWebsitesRecover":"You can recover your features by updating your payment method and contacting our customer care.","text_downgradeWebsitesTooltip":"We were unable to charge the amount of your plan from your payment method.","text_downgradeWebsitesBtn":"UPDATE PAYMENT METHOD","text_optimizationLevel":"Optimization level: <span class=\\"ml5\\">{{level}}</span>","text_optimizationStatus":"Optimization status: <span class=\\"ml5\\">{{level}}</span>","text_optimizationLevelFree":"Optimization status: incomplete","text_optimizationStatusActive":"Pro optimization: <b>Active</b>","text_optimizationStatusPending":"Pro optimization: <b>Not applied</b>","text_optimizationStatusNotEnabled":"CDN is not enabled","text_testMode":"Test mode","text_beforeServerDirective":"Add this block before the server directive","text_insideServerDirective":"Add this block inside the server directive","text_howToServeWebPViaServer":"Serve WebP Via Server","text_howToServeWebPViaServerDesc":"To configure for server side serving, please copy the code bellow to nginx.conf and then reload Nginx.","text_howToServeWebPViaServerApacheDesc":"To configure for server side serving, please copy the code below to .htaccess and then reload Apache2","text_buyNowDialog.header":"This Feature is Part of 10Web Pro","text_buyNowDialog.message":"To access it, upgrade to one of the 3 available plans.","text_buyNowDialog.text":"Choose Plan","text_upgradeCreateMigrateOptimize":"Upgrade to a higher plan to create, migrate or optimize more websites.","text_aiEnableTitle":"Turn any web page into a part of your website","text_aiEnableDesc":"10Web\u2019s AI Builder lets you get the initial layout and style of your website with AI,<br/> edit it with 10Web builder based on Elementor, and add more pages to your websites with minimal effort.","text_aiConvertDesc":"Insert the homepage URL of the website you want<br/>to convert to WordPress, and we will copy the layout,<br/>design elements, and content. You can add the rest<br/>of the pages later on.","text_aiConvertTitle":"Convert non-WordPress<br/>website with AI","text_aiCreateDesc":"Any web page you see on the web can become your<br/> homepage. Insert the URL to recreate its layout and<br/> design elements.","text_aiCreateTitle":"Start creating with AI","text_serverPerformanceBenchmark":"<strong>Measures the speed of:</strong> </br>- 10,000 mathematical functions in PHP </br>- 10,000 string manipulation </br>functions in PHP </br>- 10,000 increments in PHP while </br>and for loops </br>- 10,000 conditional checks in PHP </br>- Establishing a MySQL Connection </br>- Querying MySQL version information </br>- 1,000,000 ENCODE(s) with a random seed","text_phpNeedsToBeUpdated":"10Web will soon upgrade its servers to supercharge your website performance. With the upcoming change, PHP versions older than 7.4 will not be supported.","text_phpNeedsToBeUpdatedTools":"10Web will soon upgrade its servers to supercharge your website performance. With the upcoming change, PHP versions older<br/> than 7.4 will not be supported. Please upgrade your PHP version to the most recent one available.","text_stayConnected":"stay connected","text_removeWebsiteTitle":"Remove Website","text_removeSpeedWebsiteDesc":"Removing a website from 10Web will rollback all optimization<br/> and caching configurations and negatively affect your PageSpeed.","text_aiCreateListDesc":"Find a web page you like? Turn it into a part of your<br/> website. Insert the URL to recreate its layout and design<br/> elements.","text_removeSpeedWebsiteListTitle":"By removing you will revert the following:","text_beforeOptimization":"Before optimization","text_afterOptimization":"After 10Web Booster optimization","text_enableTenWebTheme":"Activate 10Web default theme to get the best experience with the builder.","text_boosterLatestVersionRequired":"<p class=\'text-left\'>Latest version is required</p>","text_boosterLatestVersionRequiredDesc":"<p class=\'text-left\'>Please update the 10Web Booster plugin from<br/> WordPress plugin list.</p>","text_specialOfferHeaderUpgradePlanAnnually":"Additional {{percent}}% <br/>lifetime discount","text_specialOfferHeaderUpgradePlanMonthly":"{{percent}}% lifetime <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />discount","text_earlyBirdDiscount":"Early bird discount!","text_specialOfferHeaderUpgradePlan":"Additional 40% <br/>lifetime discount","text_specialOfferDescUpgradePlan":"Limited time offer on all <br/>10Web Booster Pro plans!","text_percentOfferText":"Special pricing, only this <br class=\'db-hide-mobile\'/><span class=\'bold\'>Black Friday!</span>","text_upgradePlanTitleFor40Sale":"Upgrade to 10Web","text_upgradePlanDescFor40Sale":"Explore all 10Web premium features, create, migrate & optimize up to 10 websites","text_cdnHeader":"Cloudflare Enterprise","text_cdnDesc":"Make your website 50% faster & accelerate your business<br/>by enabling Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_cdnDescSecondSection":"Test the impact of CDN on your website right now","text_cdnDescription":"Enable Cloudflare Enterprise to improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security.","text_cdnDescriptionFree":"Make your website 50% faster by enabling Cloudflare Enterprise CDN.","text_cdnDescriptionPro":"Enable Cloudflare Enterprise CDN to improve your website PageSpeed performance.","text_cdnBenefitsTitle":"Benefits of Cloudflare Enterprise","text_cdnBenefitsTitleFree":"Why Enable Cloudflare Enterprise CDN?","text_cdnContentFree":"As an official Cloudflare Partner we offer our customers Full Page Caching, faster load time,<br/> a more secure firewall and DDoS, HTTP/3 support, free SSLs, and more.","text_cdnContent":"Enterprise is the highest plan of Cloudflare worth $5000/mo. 10Web partnered with Cloudflare to provide you with all of their<br/> benefits within Booster Pro. Read more about how enterprise compares to free and pro <a class=\'db-link-blue\' target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://www.cloudflare.com/plans/#overview\'>Cloudflare pricing plans.</a>","text_cdnUpgradeOffer":"Available with<br/> 10Web Booster Pro","text_enableCloudflareHeader":"Enable Cloudflare integration","text_enableCloudflareSubHeader":"In case it isn\u2019t enter the original server IP of your website.","text_enableCloudflareSubHeaderCDN":"Please provide your original server IP, and disable<br/> Cloudflare proxy for the <b>{{hostname}}</b>.","text_enableCloudflareContent":"We have detected your IP, please double check that it\u2019s your original server before proceeding.","text_enableCloudflareContentCDN":"Your domain is already pointed to Cloudflare.","text_disableCloudflare":"Disable page cache","text_disableCloudflareDesc":"Disabling page cache will significantly slow down your<br/> website and negatively affect its performance.","text_verifyCloudflareHostnameHeader":"Verify and point your domain to Cloudflare","text_addTxtRecords":"Add the TXT records in your DNS management service","text_configDns":"Configure your DNS using the A records below.<br/> Remove already existing A, AAAA, CNAME records with the given Host/Name.","text_dnsNotification":"If your DNS provider accepts only fully qualified domains, then please use <span class=\'bold\'> {example.com}</span>,<br/> instead of using @.","text_clearCloudflareCache":"Entirely clear Cloudflare cache","text_clearCloudflareCacheDesc":"Clear both static and HTML cache. Pages will be<br/> cached again upon first visit.","text_disableCdn":"Disable CDN","text_disableCdnDesc":"Disabling CDN will significantly slow down your website<br/> and negatively affect its performance.","text_disableBtnDialogText":"disable","text_cdnIntegrationInProgress":"Cloudflare integration in progress","text_cdnIntegrationMessage":"We are enabling Cloudflare Enterprise on your website.<br/> This might take a few minutes.","text_updateBoosterPlugin":"10Web Booster V1.123 Released!","text_updateBoosterPluginDesc":"We have just released a new version of the plugin that accelerates all the processes of the plugin to provide you with a better experience. Please update the version to continue.","text_updateBoosterPluginBtnText":"update the plugin","text_boosterFreeFeaturesUpgrade":"Usually all these benefits that are included in Cloudflare enterprise plan cost $5000/mo,<br/> but you get it at the friction of the cost with 10Web Booster Pro plans.","text_cdnSSLIsMissing":"To get the Cloudflare Enterprise end-to-end encryption it is necessary to have a valid SSL certificate on your<br/> website. Please activate an SSL certificate on your domain to continue.","text_cdnSSLIsMissingHosted":"To get the Cloudflare Enterprise end-to-end encryption it is necessary to have a valid SSL certificate on your<br/> website. Please ","text_domainChangedCdn":"Cloudflare Enterprise can only be enabled on your primary domain. If you haven\u2019t pointed a domain or<br/> haven\u2019t made it primary you will need to ","text_enableCloudflareHeaderAlternate":"Enable Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_enableCloudflareDescAlternate":"Improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security further.","text_introducingCloudflareTitle":"Introducing<br/> 10Web Booster x <span class=\'db-with-underline-image\'>Cloudflare Enterprise</span>","text_introducingCloudflareDesc":"10Web Booster has partnered with Cloudflare to deliver<br/> the ultimate WordPress speed solution. <span class=\'mt25\'><b>Supercharge your website with Cloudflare add-on:</b></span>","text_introducingCloudflareTitlePercent":"Introducing 10Web Booster<br/> x Cloudflare Enterprise","text_introducingCloudflareDescPercent":"10Web Booster has partnered with Cloudflare to<br/> deliver the ultimate WordPress speed solution. <span class=\'mt20 db-desc-underline\'><b>Get a 30% lifetime discount on 10Web Booster Pro<br> with Cloudflare:</b></span>","text_buyNowCdnTrial":"Get Cloudflare Enterprise add-on<br/> to improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security.","text_buyNowCdnPlatform":"Get Cloudflare Enterprise add-on for ${{parameterPrice}}/mo<br/> to improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security.","text_verifyDomainStep1Title":"Step 1: Verify domain ownership","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature1":"Go to your DNS provider, which is usually the registrar of your domain","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature2":"Navigate to the DNS management section","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature3":"Add the following TXT records:","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature4":"Save TXT records and verify domain to proceed.","text_verifyDomainStep2Title":"Step 2: Point the domain to Cloudflare","text_verifyDomainStep2Feature1":"Configure your DNS using the A records below.","text_verifyDomainStep2Feature2":"Remove already existing A, AAAA, CNAME records with the given Host/Name.","text_verifyDomainStep2Feature3":"Save A records and proceed to finish Cloudflare setup.","text_verifyDomain":"verify domain","text_cancelProcess":"Cancel process","text_tryForFree":"Try for Free","text_chooseCustomDomain":"Choose Custom Domain","text_tryBoosterForFree":"Try 10Web Booster Pro","text_tryBoosterPro":"Try Booster Pro","text_tryBoosterForFree7Days":"Try 10Web Booster<br/> Pro for 7 days","text_proOptimCdnTile":"Pro optimization with Cloudflare CDN","text_proOptimCdnDesc":"Complete your website optimization","text_proOptimCdnOption1":"<b>30%</b>higher PageSpeed score","text_proOptimCdnOption2":"<b>50%</b>faster load times","text_proOptimCdnOption3":"<b>275</b>caching locations worldwide","text_proOptimCdnOption4":"<b>{{pages}}</b> fully optimized pages of your site","text_proOptimCdnOption4NoWebsite":"Fully optimized pages of your site","text_proOptimCdnOptionLong1":"<b>30%</b> higher PageSpeed score<br/> for your entire website","text_proOptimCdnOptionLong2":"<b>50%</b> reduction in loading times<br/> for all website visitors","text_proOptimCdnOptionLong3":"<b>275</b> caching locations worldwide<br/> for location-based access","text_cdnAgencyLimitation":"CDN is included for 10 websites. <br/>You can get an additional website CDN and 100GB Bandwidth for ${{price}}/mo.","text_cdnAgencyLimitationListing":"For Agency plans CDN is included for 10 websites. Agency plan users can buy additional website CDNs and 100GB of Bandwidth for ${{price}}/mo.","text_cdnAgencyLimitationListing5":"For Agency plans CDN is included for 10 websites. Agency plan users can buy additional website CDNs and 100GB of Bandwidth for $5/mo.","text_cdnAgencyLimitationListing4":"For Agency plans CDN is included for 10 websites. Agency plan users can buy additional website CDNs and 100GB of Bandwidth for $4/mo.","text_createTopic":"create a topic","text_getFreeFastSupportTitle":"Get free and fast support<br/> on WordPress.org","text_image_optimization":"Image optimization","text_unlimited_images":"Unlimited images","text_unlimited_images_desc":"10Web optimizes website images through a number of activities:<br/>- Converting Image Format to WebP<br/>- Container-specific Image Resizing<br/>- Lossy reduction<br/>- Keeping Full-sized images","text_auto-optimization":"Auto-optimization","text_auto-optimization_desc":"Automatically optimize images uploaded to the media library.","text_webp_conversion":"WebP conversion","text_webp_conversion_desc":"Achieve an average of 30% more compression than JPEG and JPEG 2000, without loss of image quality.","text_booster_pro_gallery":"Booster Pro","text_gallery_pagespeed_score":"90+ PageSpeed score","text_gallery_pagespeed_score_desc":"We achieve 90+ PageSpeed through a series of technical actions including:<br/>-CSS & HTML Minification & Compression<br/>- JS Minification and Compression<br/>- Image Lazyload<br/>- Font Swap<br/>- iFrame and Video Lazyload","text_gallery_improved_core_vitals":"Improved Core Web Vitals","text_gallery_improved_core_vitals_desc":"10Web helps you pass Core Web Vitals Assessment by:<br/>- Using Critical CSS<br/>- Preload images<br/>- Optimize font delivery<br/>- Use web workers<br/>- Delay or remove non-critical third-party","text_photo_gallery_pro":"Photo Gallery Pro","text_gallery_album_views":"10 gallery/album views","text_gallery_album_views_desc":"Thumbnails, masonry, mosaic, slideshow, image browser, carousel, blog style, and more.","text_gallery_lightbox_effect":"15 lightbox effects","text_gallery_lightbox_effect_desc":"Enjoy fully customizable lightbox with 15 lightbox transition effects, full width view option and filmstrip.","text_gallery_widgets":"4 gallery widgets","text_gallery_widgets_desc":"Use one of WordPress Standard, Tag Cloud, Dynamic Tags Cloud, Slideshow and Gallery widgets.","text_gallery_role_management":"Role management","text_gallery_role_management_desc":"Choose who can add/edit galleries, images, albums and tags.","text_managed_hosting_back_end_page":"Boost your website performance with<br/> 10Web Managed Hosting","text_getFreeFastSupportSubDesc":"Our support team constantly monitors and resolves topics<br/> within 24 hours to provide users with a smooth<br/> optimization process.","text_getStartWithAiPro":"Get 10Web AI Assistant Pro","text_buyExtraWordsWithAiPro":"Get extra words for AI Assistant","text_getStartWithAiProEarlyBird":"Special early bird offer on AI Assistant","text_getStartWithAiProSubHeader":"Generate more game-changing content in minutes by switching to AI Assistant Pro.","text_getBuyExtraWordsWithAiProSubHeader":"Generate more game-changing content in minutes.","text_getStartWithAiProSubHeaderEarlyBird":"Generate more game-changing content in minutes by switching to AI Assistant Pro.","text_aiAssistantTitle":"AI Assistant","text_aiAssistantWebsites":"Websites","text_aiAssistantWebsitesTooltipInfo":"Connect unlimited websites, use AI Assistant on all of them regardless of the plan you choose.","text_aiAssistantWritingLength":"Writing length","text_aiAssistantWritingLengthTooltipInfo":"The length of text AI Assistant can write based on your input.","text_aiAssistantInputLength":"Input length","text_aiAssistantInputLengthTooltipInfo":"The length of text AI Assistant can take as an input.","text_aiAssistantTwentyTemplates":"18 templates","text_aiAssistantTemplates":"Templates","text_aiAssistantEditor":"Editor","text_aiAssistantAddWebsite":"Add website","text_aiAssistantTwentyTemplatesTooltipInfo":"A selection of prompts for tailored use cases, such as product descriptions, FAQs, outlines, advertising copy, etc.","text_aiAssistantXLanguages":"29+ languages ","text_aiAssistantXLanguagesTooltipInfo":"AI Assistant can help you write and modify texts in different languages. Our AI reads content in 29+ languages.","text_aiAssistantEditorDocuments":"Editor/Documents","text_aiAssistantEditorDocumentsTooltipInfo":"Compose texts in a blank document. Format, edit and improve it the way you want to generate long and short-form content.","text_aiAssistantWPFunctionality":"WP plugin (Gutenberg, Classic Editor)","text_aiAssistantOutlines":"Generate outlines","text_aiAssistantOutlinesTooltipInfo":"Generate blog post or article outlines right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantIntroductions":"Generate introductions","text_aiAssistantIntroductionsTooltipInfo":"Generate introduction paragraphs right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantConclusions":"Generate conclusions","text_aiAssistantConclusionsTooltipInfo":"Generate conclusion paragraphs right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantParaphrase":"Paraphrase a text","text_aiAssistantParaphraseTooltipInfo":"Paraphrase and improve your texts right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantAddOns":"SEO pack (Yoast SEO)","text_aiAssistantKeyphraseFix":"Keyphrase errors fix","text_aiAssistantKeyphraseFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically fix keyphrases errors in text with AI.","text_aiAssistantDescGeneration":"Meta description generation","text_aiAssistantDescGenerationTooltipInfo":"Generate SEO optimized meta descriptions based on your keyphrase with AI.","text_aiAssistantSeoErrorFix":"SEO analysis errors fix","text_aiAssistantSeoErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically fix SEO analysis errors with AI.","text_aiAssistantReadabilityErrorFix":"Readability errors fix","text_aiAssistantReadabilityErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically fix Readability errors with AI.","text_aiAssistantPassiveVoiceErrorFix":"Passive voice errors fix","text_aiAssistantPassiveVoiceErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically rewrite all the passive voice sentences with AI.","text_aiAssistantTextLengthErrorFix":"Paragraph/Sentence length errors fix","text_aiAssistantTextLengthErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically rewrite paragraphs or sentences according to recommended length.","text_aiAssistantSubheadingErrorFix":"Subheading distribution errors fix","text_aiAssistantSubheadingErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically add subheadings in your text  AI.","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekTitle":"Before you go","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekMissingFeatures":"Missing desired features","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekMissingFeaturesDesc":"We\u2019re constantly working on enhancing our features. In fact, many new<br/> functionalities are on our imminent roadmap. If you\u2019re willing to give us another</br> chance, we offer an option to pause your account, keeping all your details intact.","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekSaleTitle":"One more thought","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekDesc":"We\u2019re committed to improving and your feedback is invaluable.<br/> Could you share your primary reason for thinking about cancellation?","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekFeedbackText":"Feel free to leave a comment to let us know how we can improve.","text_hostingIsAvailableTitle":"10Web Hosting now available!","text_hostingIsAvailableDesc":"Get access to the most powerful automated<br/> hosting for WordPress, powered by Google Cloud. <span class=\'mt25\'><b>Migrate your website to 10Web Hosting to get:</b></span>","text_introAiAssistantTitle":"Introducing 10Web AI Assistant","text_introAiAssistantDesc":"Leverage the power of AI to create SEO optimized<br/> content directly in Gutenberg and Classic Editor<br/> & fix SEO and readability issues in Yoast SEO.","text_testCdn":"Test the CDN","text_orUpgradeNow":"Or Upgrade Now","text_upgradeBlockCdn":"Usually all these benefits that are included in Cloudflare enterprise plan cost $5000/mo,<br/>but you get it at the friction of the cost with 10Web Booster Pro plans.","text_cdnTtfbTitle":"How TTFB and extra fast loading will impact your business?","text_cdnTtfbDesc":"TTFB (Time To First Byte) measures a website\u2019s or web server\u2019s responsiveness and performance.<br/>Lower TTFB means the initial response from the server arrives faster, leading to following improvements:","text_testCdnGenerateFail":"There was an issue while creating the copy of your<br/>homepage for the CDN demo. Please try again.","text_buyExtraWords":"BUY EXTRA WORDS","text_templateProDesc":"This template is available only in Pro plans.","text_downloadAiTitle":"Leverage the power of AI directly<br/>in your WordPress environment","text_downloadAiDesc":"Install 10Web AI assistant plugin to connect your website<br/>to our dashboard and use all the features of AI assistant.","text_grandSlamOfferSectionOneHeader":"Grow your business with<br/> 10Web Booster agency plan","text_grandSlamOfferSectionContent":"We\u2019ve talked with thousands of digital agencies<br/> to create a tailored plan, specifically designed<br/> to help agencies and freelancers like you to scale<br/> their business. Grow your business by reselling<br/> our services.","text_grandSlamOfferSectionUpgradeHeader":"Make your game-changing decision, join 10Web Agency plan","text_grandSlamReduceWorkloadDesc":"Spend your time on what\u2019s the most important: scaling your business.<br/> Say goodbye to hours of manual optimization and let our solution handle it for you.","text_reduceWorkloadOptimizationDesc":"Install 10Web Booster on your clients\u2019 websites and<br/> get it optimized in just 2 minutes.","text_reduceWorkloadCompatabilityDesc":"10Web Booster has been tested with all the top<br/> WordPress services to ensure bigger compatibility.","text_reduceWorkloadSupportDesc":"With our top-notch customer care you will<br/> never need to worry about your clients\u2019 websites.","text_increaseRevenueDesc":"Never worry about hosting downtimes and technical maintenance again.<br/> With 99.9% uptime and elastic scaling, your websites will be up and running at all times,<br/> so you can focus on other tasks.","text_grandSlamOfferImproveRetention":"With the help of our solutions, you and your clients can be sure that your websites<br/> are secure and working uninterrupted.","text_grandSlamOfferMonthlyReports":"Through the 10Web dashboard you can constantly<br/> monitor the performance of your client\u2019s websites<br/> and automatically send them monthly reports.<br/> </br>Your clients will be happy to see how smoothly their<br/> websites are working.","text_grandSlamOfferCdn":"As an official Cloudflare Partner we offer our<br/> customers CDN, Full Page Caching, faster load time,<br/> a more secure firewall and DDoS, HTTP/3 support, free<br/> SSLs, and more. Enabling CDN can get your website:","text_grandSlamGoogleCloudPartner":"Get and give your clients a peace of mind by hosting<br/> their websites on the fastest and the most secure<br/> fully automated hosting for WordPress.","text_grandSlamDdosProtection":"By leveraging Cloudflare\u2019s technology we protect<br/> your website from potential attacks even before<br/> they take place.<br/> </br>DDoS attacks cost millions in business revenue<br/> every year, but you and your clients won\u2019t<br/> have to worry about it.","text_grandSlamAccelerationHeader":"10Web\u2019s \u201cAgency Booster acceleration program\u201c","text_grandSlamAccelerationDesc":"Learn how to grow your Agency by selling website optimization services. Join our special program<br/> and start your journey towards hyper growth.<br/> </br>In this course you will get access to exclusive materials and tools that will help you scale your business on 10Web:","text_grandSlamFeedback":"One of the best things that 10Web offers us is the 90-plus page<br/> speed score. 10Web has incredible reviews. It\u2019s just amazing<br/> how many people love the support and the product of this<br/> company.<br/> </br><span class=\'db-name\'>Kori Ashton</span>","text_referralProgram":"Referral Program","text_pendingReferralTooltip":"Your pending credit will be activated once<br/>the user you referred optimizes their first<br/>website with our service.","text_upgradeToEditDemoTitle":"Upgrade to 10Web Pro to edit your<br/> website and unlock all of 10Web.","text_upgradeToEditDemoDesc":"Use all the features of our AI-powered platform to edit<br/> and host a superfast website, your visitors will love.","text_optimizationWithBoosterAndHosting":"A fully optimized website is critical for your business, and you can\'t get one without a fast hosting.<br/>  Upgrade to 10Web Booster and get a 10Web Hosting add-on to optimize your website frontend and backend now.","text_hyperchargeYourGrowthHeader":"Hypercharge your growth with full website optimization","text_hyperchargeYourGrowthDesc":"Upgrade to Booster Pro and get a 10Web Hosting add-on to fully optimize<br/> both your website frontend and backend.","text_activateBooster":"Activate Booster","text_boosterFree":"10Web Booster Free","text_boosterActivationBannerText":"Go a step further and optimize your entire website, not just images.","text_cdnDemoPageIsReadyTooltip":"We have created a copy of your homepage<br/> on our servers and applied CDN to show<br/> the improvements.<br/> </br>It does not affect the original website and<br/> the copy will be deleted in 1 day.","text_testimonialsBoosterText":"Used number of solutions to improve my website\u2019s speed but they were breaking the site. Now I\u2019ve stumbled upon 10Web Booster and it was amazing","text_testimonialsIOText":"Speed is fantastic and website works smoothly. <br/>I can\u2019t thank you enough for bringing this tool to the market and folks THIS IS FREE.","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeTitle":"Your super fast AI-generated website on 10Web is ready","text_successAfterDemoEcommerceUpgradeTitle":"Your AI-generated Ecommerce website is ready","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeSubhead":"It is time to finalize your website and launch it:","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeSubheadEcommerce":"It is time to finalize your store and launch it:","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet1":"Easily edit your pages with drag & drop editor","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet2":"Full WordPress backend","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet3":"Optimize the SEO of your website","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet4":"Connect a custom domain","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce1":"Edit your store with our drag & drop editor","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce2":"Manage your inventory and track your orders","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce3":"Optimize the SEO of your website","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce4":"Add your custom domain and launch your store","text_cancelSubscriptionDialogError":"Please select one of the options above","text_passwordProtectionToolsTitle":"Password protection","text_passwordProtectionToolsDesc":"Enable password protection to prevent both visitors and search engines, giving you peace of mind and freedom to work without unexpected viewers. The website is visible from your IP and you can test the speed with <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://gtmetrix.com/\' class=\'db-link-blue\'><span>GTmetrix<span/><a/> and <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://developers.google.com/speed/pagespeed/insights/\' class=\'db-link-blue\'>PageSpeed Insights.<span/><a/>","text_passwordProtectionDisabled":"Password protection disabled successfully","text_passwordProtectionEnabled":"Password protection enabled successfully","text_passwordProtectedText":"The website is visible from your IP and you can test<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'/> the speed with <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://gtmetrix.com/\' class=\'db-link-blue\'><span>GTmetrix<span/><a/> and <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://developers.google.com/speed/pagespeed/insights/?url={{websiteUrl}}\' class=\'db-link-blue\'>PageSpeed Insights.<span/><a/><br/> </br>With Password Protection, your site stays hidden from<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'/>search engines, giving you peace of mind and freedom<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'/> to work without unexpected viewers.","text_paidFeatureDialogSSH":"For security reasons this feature is only available to paid<br/> users. To access SFTP & SSH please make a payment.","text_paidFeatureDialogCloudflare":"For security reasons Cloudflare Enterprise add-on is only available to paid users. To purchase it please upgrade to one of our paid plans first.","text_paidFeatureDialogPassProtection":"For security reasons, this feature is only available to<br/> paid users. To disable password protection please<br/> make a payment.","text_subscriptionVisitorsTooltip":"This number includes your subscription<br/> plan and add-on limits. For every {{visits}} extra<br/> visitors you\u2019ll be charged an extra ${{price}} at<br/> the end of the billing month.","text_subscriptionSSDStorageTooltip":"This number includes your subscription<br/> plan and add-on limits. You\u2019ll be charged<br/> an extra ${{price}} at the end of the billing month<br/> for each extra {{size}} used.","text_subscriptionAddOnLimitsTooltip":"This number includes your subscription<br/> plan and add-on limits.","text_subscriptionBandwidthTooltip":"This number includes your subscription</br> plan and add-on limits. For every {{size}} of</br> extra bandwidth you\u2019ll be charged an extra</br> ${{price}} at the end of the billing month.","text_subscriptionWebsitesTooltip":"Get more websites for:</br> ${{price}}/mo per site</br> {{visits}} visits</br> {{storage}} SSD storage","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveTitle":"Save changes","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveDesc1":"You have made changes on Delay JS/Critical CSS options,<br/> applying these changes will change your current<br/> optimization level accordingly.","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveDesc2":"Applying the changes to Delay JS/Critical CSS options<br/> will change current optimization level.<br/><br/> With test mode active, add <b>?twbooster=1</b> to the URL<br/> to view changes after applying them.","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveDesc3":"Since you\u2019ve enabled the test mode, make sure<br/> to append <b>?twbooster=1</b> to your URL to preview<br/> the changes after applying them.","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsResetTitle":"Reset to default settings","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsResetDesc":"Resetting all advanced settings will apply the extreme<br/> level of optimization to your website, reverting all options<br/> to their default values.","text_deleteAccountTitle":"Delete your account","text_deleteAccountBtn":"Delete Account","text_deleteAccountDesc":"Permanently remove your account and all associated data.","text_deleteAccountInfo1":"You must first remove all active websites associated with your account before you can proceed with account deletion.","text_deleteAccountInfo2":"You must first remove all active websites associated with your account and invited users before you can proceed with account deletion.","text_deleteAccountDialogTitle":"Confirm account deletion","text_deleteAccountDialogSubtitle":"Are you certain you wish to permanently delete your account?","text_deleteAccountDialogDesc":"By proceeding, your user account and your workspace will be deleted without the possibility of recovery. This includes all data such as billing details, payment methods, previous invoices, etc.","text_deleteAccountDialogInfo":"You can\u2019t undo this action. All associated data will be permanently deleted.","text_deleteAccountDialogInputLabel":"To confirm the deletion of your account, please enter your password.","text_accountDeletedTitle":"Your account has been successfully deleted","text_accountDeletedSubtitle":"Your 10Web account and all data associated with it have been successfully deleted.<br/> We\u2019re sad to see you go.","text_accountDeletedInfo":"If you change your mind in the future, you are always welcome back at 10Web.<br/> Just create a new account with us whenever you\u2019re ready.","text_thenWebBuilder":"10Web AI Builder","text_thenWebBuilderEditor":"Drag and Drop editor based<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> on Elementor","text_thenWebBuilderEditorDesc":"Edit newly built websites using the 10Web Editor based on Elementor. Drag and drop widgets and customize them to your own unique style.","text_ecommerceFunctionality":"Ecommerce functionality","text_ecommerceAIAssistant":"Ecommerce AI assistant","text_ecommerceFunctionalityDesc":"AI-powered ecommerce features to accelerate product creation and management from a single intuitive dashboard.","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumTemplates":"Premium templates and widgets","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumTemplatesDesc":"We have enhanced our AI builder with our 50+ premium widgets and templates.","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumConvertAi":"Convert to WordPress with AI","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumConvertAiDesc":"Turn any web page into a template with our AI Builder, all without copying a single line of code.","text_thenWebBuilderGeneration":"Number of website regenerations","text_thenWebBuilderGenerationDesc":"Answer our brief questionnaire, and our AI-powered content generator will create tailored content and images for your business.","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistant":"Elementor AI assistant","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistantDesc":"Use our AI assistant to generate content directly in Elementor editor.","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistantImages":"AI image generation","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistantImagesDesc":"Generate images for your website using AI in 10Web Builder.","text_thenWebBuilderConvertToAI":"Convert to WordPress with AI","text_thenWebBuilderConvertToAIDesc":"Turn any web page into a template with our AI Builder, all without copying a single line of code.","text_thenWebBuilderCustomDomain":"Free custom domain","text_thenWebBuilderCustomDomainAgency":"1 free custom domain","text_thenWebBuilderCustomDomainDesc":"Get your first custom domain for free. If you choose a more expensive domain, the specified amount will be applied as a discount.","text_thenWebBuilderConnectWP":"Convert a website to WordPress","text_googleCloudHosting":"High performance hosting<br class=\'db-hide-tablet\'/> by Google Cloud","text_googleCloudHostingGuarantee":"99.9% uptime guarantee","text_googleCloudHostingGuaranteeDesc":"Websites hosted on 10Web are up and running 99.9% of the time without a glitch due to Google Cloud.","text_googleCloudHostingVisitors":"Monthly visitors","text_googleCloudHostingVisitorsDesc":"For every 10K extra visitors you\u2019ll be charged an extra $2 at the end of the billing month.<br/> Visits are measured by the total monthly traffic (unique IPs) to your site. These visits are shared across the plan.<br><br>This does not apply to Ultimate plans.","text_googleCloudHostingSSD":"SSD storage","text_googleCloudHostingSSDDesc":"You\u2019ll be charged an extra $2 at the end of the billing month for each extra 5GB used.<br/> All servers use the fastest SSD storage on Google Cloud with built-in redundancy to ensure data integrity.<br><br>This does not apply to Ultimate plans.","text_googleCloudHostingBackups":"Automated daily backups","text_googleCloudHostingBackupsDesc":"Scheduled automatic daily backups\\nenable you to restore a previous\\nversion of your site whenever needed.","text_googleCloudHostingMigration":"Automated 1-click migration","text_googleCloudHostingMigrationDesc":"Move your website to 10Web from any other hosting with just 1 click.","text_googleCloudHostingSSL":"Free SSL certificate","text_googleCloudHostingSSLDesc":"10Web provides you with a free one-click SSL using Let\u2019s Encrypt integration. The SSL certificate will automatically renew once expired, without additional interference.","text_multisiteSupport":"Multisite support","text_multisiteSupportDesc":"Install WordPress multisite and manage all aspects of your WordPress multisite from the 10Web dashboard.","text_googleCloudHostingMalware":"Malware removal program","text_googleCloudHostingMalwareDesc":"Scheduled automatic scanning for security issues in your current versions of WordPress core, themes, plugins and unwanted changes made to your files.","text_googleCloudHostingSSH":"SSH access","text_googleCloudHostingSSHDesc":"SSH access automates your workflow and eliminates risks of man-in-the-middle attacks, keeping data transmissions private.","text_googleCloudHostingPHP":"Up-to-date PHP and MySQL","text_googleCloudHostingPHPDesc":"10Web supports the newest PhP and MySQL versions for a faster database and faster performance.","text_googleCloudHostingData":"Data center locations","text_googleCloudHostingDataDesc":"Choose between our global data center locations for each WordPress install. Your datacenter should be close to your visitors.","text_speedOptimization":"Website speed optimization","text_speedOptimizationFull":"Full website optimization","text_speedOptimizationFullDesc":"Automatically optimize both frontend and backend of your website.","text_speedOptimizationScore":"90+ PageSpeed score","text_speedOptimizationScoreDesc":"We achieve 90+ PageSpeed through a series of technical actions including:<br/>- CSS & HTML Minification & Compression<br/>- JS Minification and Compression<br/>- Image Lazyload<br/>- Font Swap<br/>- iFrame and Video Lazyload","text_speedOptimizationCore":"Improved Core Web Vitals","text_speedOptimizationCoreDesc":"10Web helps you pass Core Web Vitals Assessment by:<br/>- Using Critical CSS<br/>- Preload images<br/>- Optimize font delivery<br/>- Use web workers<br/>- Delay or remove non-critical third-party","text_speedOptimizationTTFB":"Under 100ms TTFB","text_speedOptimizationTTFBDesc":"Reduce the time it takes for your user\'s browser to receive the first batch of your data to under 100ms.","text_speedOptimizationIO":"Image optimization","text_speedOptimizationIODesc":"10Web optimizes website images through a number of activities:<br/>- Converting Image Format to WebP<br/>- Container-specific Image Resizing<br/>- Lossy reduction<br/>- Keeping Full-sized images","text_speedOptimizationSEO":"Search Engine Optimization","text_speedOptimizationSEODesc":"Boost your website\'s SEO rankings with a fast and secure website.","text_speedOptimizationCDN":"Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_speedOptimizationWebsitesWithCDN":"Websites with CDN","text_speedOptimizationCDNDesc":"Get website security, performance, and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise.","text_speedOptimizationFullPageCache":"Full page caching","text_speedOptimizationFullPageCacheDesc":"Get website security, performance, and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise.","text_speedOptimizationLoad":"10x faster load times","text_speedOptimizationLoadDesc":"275 data centers located across the globe provide visitors with location-based access to your website, while removing latency and improving performance.","text_customerSupport":"Customer support","text_customerSupportEmail":"Email assistance","text_customerSupportEmailDesc":"Submit tickets with any issues you have and our team will get back to you in the shortest time.","text_customerSupportCareChatbox":"Real time chatbox assistance","text_customerSupportCareChatboxDesc":"Our customer support team is at your service 24/7. Reach out to us anytime.","text_customerSupportCareVIP":"VIP priority support","text_customerSupportCareVIPDesc":"Directly connect with our VIP support team through our dedicated Slack channel to solve any issue.","text_customerSupportCareAM":"Dedicated account manager","text_customerSupportCareAMDesc":"Have a dedicated account manager who will help you find solutions to all questions.","text_customerSupportCare":"24/7 customer care","text_customerSupportCareDesc":"Our customer support team is at your service 24/7. Reach out to us anytime.","text_collaboration":"Collaboration","text_collaborationTeam":"User & team management","text_collaborationTeamDesc":"Invite users and give them different permissions to your account and websites.","text_collaborationStaging":"Staging area","text_collaborationStagingDesc":"Stage and test the coming updates on your website\u2019s clone before publishing them.","text_collaborationWP":"WordPress and plugin updates","text_collaborationWPDesc":"Easily update WordPress core through our intuitive dashboard.","text_enterpriseFeatures":"Enterprise features","text_enterpriseFeaturesSOC":"SOC 2 Type II security","text_enterpriseFeaturesSOCTooltip":"Benefit from the highest level of data protection with our SOC 2 Type II certified system.","text_enterpriseFeaturesSLA":"99.9% uptime SLA","text_enterpriseFeaturesSLATooltip":"Our SLA ensures a minimum of 99.9% uptime, meaning consistent accessibility for your site.\\n","text_enterpriseFeaturesInstance":"Dedicated instance","text_enterpriseFeaturesInstanceTooltip":"Enjoy enhanced performance with a dedicated instance, meaning all resources are exclusively for you.","text_enterpriseFeaturesScaling":"Vertical scaling","text_enterpriseFeaturesScalingTooltip":"We can add additional resources to your current servers in order to help increase the capacity.","text_enterpriseFeaturesScalability":"Built-in scalability","text_enterpriseFeaturesScalabilityTooltip":"Easily handle increases in demand with our system\'s built-in scalability, ensuring optimal performance at all times.","text_enterpriseFeaturesMigration":"Free manual migration","text_enterpriseFeaturesMigrationTooltip":"If needed our top engineers will manually migrate your website to 10Web hosting.","text_ecommerceFeatures":"Ecommerce management","text_ecommerceFeatures1":"Conversion-optimized checkout","text_ecommerceFeatures1Desc":"Enhance your store with a top-tier checkout system that enables customers to complete their purchases in a single click.","text_ecommerceFeatures2":"Unlimited products","text_ecommerceFeatures2Desc":"Expand your business by selling an unlimited number of products.","text_ecommerceFeatures3":"Unlimited product variations","text_ecommerceFeatures3Desc":"Expand your business by selling an unlimited number of products variations.","text_ecommerceFeatures4":"Order tracking and management","text_ecommerceFeatures4Desc":"A simple interface to track and manage your orders.","text_ecommerceFeatures5":"Advanced product filter","text_ecommerceFeatures5Desc":"Enhance your website with advanced filters to improve the user experience.","text_ecommerceFeatures6":"Ecommerce analytics","text_ecommerceFeatures6Desc":"Gain insights into your store\'s performance with detailed reports, helping you identify opportunities for optimization.","text_ecommerceFeatures7":"10Web Payments","text_ecommerceFeatures7Desc":"Accept payments instantly with 10Web Payments powered by Stripe.","text_ecommerceFeatures8":"Dispute management","text_ecommerceFeatures8Desc":"Disputed payments (also known as chargebacks) on card transactions.","text_ecommerceFeatures9":"2.9% + 30\xa2 per successful charge for domestic cards","text_ecommerceFeatures9Desc":"A non-refundable fee charged by Stripe for each successful transaction with domestic cards. This fee is not returned even if the order is refunded.","text_ecommerceFeatures10":"0.5% per transaction platform fee","text_ecommerceFeatures10Desc":"A fee applied to each transaction for secure payment processing. This fee is refunded to you in full if the order is canceled or refunded.","text_ecommerceFeaturesToggled":"Ecommerce features","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerce":"Automated Woocommerce integration","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceDesc":"Easily get the leading WooCommerce plugin installed on your Ecommerce websites.","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceTemplates":"WooCommerce compatible templates","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceTemplatesDesc":"Use one of our many WooCommerce compatible templates with our AI builder.","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceWidgets":"Premium woocommerce widgets","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceWidgetsDesc":"We have enhanced our AI builder with our 50+ premium widgets and templates.","text_ecommerceFeaturesTemplates":"Premium templates & widgets","text_ecommerceFeaturesTemplatesDesc":"We have enhanced our AI builder with our 50+ premium widgets and templates.","text_ecommerceFeaturesCustomization":"Product page customization with AI","text_ecommerceFeaturesCustomizationDesc":"Simplify your product page customization with the help of AI.","text_ecommerceFeaturesDescription":"Product description generation with AI","text_ecommerceFeaturesDescriptionDesc":"Generate product descriptions with 10Web\'s AI assistant.","text_ecommerceFeaturesCashing":"Full page caching for ecommerce<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> websites","text_ecommerceFeaturesCashingDesc":"Improve server response time and loading by enabling full page caching for static pages to read entirely from the cache.","text_ecommerceFeaturesEasyUse":"Easy to use dashboard for managing<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> products","text_ecommerceFeaturesEasyUseDesc":"Create and manage all your products directly from intuitive 10Web dashboard.","text_ecommerceFeaturesTracking":"Inventory & order tracking","text_ecommerceFeaturesTrackingDesc":"A simple interface to manage and track your inventory.","text_agencyFeatures":"Agency features","text_agencyFeaturesProcessor":"Processor","text_agencyFeaturesRAM":"RAM","text_agencyWebsitesWithPremiumFeatures":"Websites with all premium features","text_agencyWebsitesWithPremiumFeaturesDesc":"Enhance your client\'s online presence with advanced customization, robust security, high-speed performance, and more. Deliver the ultimate digital experience and meet your client\'s unique needs with our premium tools.","text_agencyFeaturesManage":"Manage all your client\'s websites<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\'/> in the same interface","text_agencyFeaturesManageDesc":"Streamline your workflow with our powerful interface. Easily manage all your client\'s websites in one place, handle updates, monitor performance, and make edits seamlessly.","text_agencyFeaturesSeparate":"Separate workspace for each of<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> your clients","text_agencyFeaturesSeparateDesc":"Sort all of your clients\u2019 websites into different workspaces. Separate users, accesses and collaboration tools, while still giving you the ease of access through one intuitive dashboard.","text_agencyFeaturesMigration":"Unlimited 1-click migrations","text_agencyFeaturesMigrationDesc":"Move your website to 10Web from any other hosting with just 1 click.","text_agencyFeaturesWhiteLabel":"White label","text_agencyFeaturesWhiteLabelDesc":"Do you prefer to resell our services without showing it as a third-party solution? Simply turn-on white label functionality through settings.","text_agencyFeaturesMultisite":"Multisite support","text_agencyFeaturesMultisiteDesc":"Install WordPress multisite and manage all aspects of your WordPress multisite from the 10Web dashboard.","text_agencyFeaturesTeam":"User and team management","text_agencyFeaturesTeamDesc":"Invite users and give them different permissions to your account and websites.","text_agencyFeaturesCare":"Customer care","text_agencyFeaturesCareDesc":"Directly connect with our VIP support team through our dedicated Slack channel to solve any issue.","text_agencyFeaturesAutomatedWP":"Automated WordPress and plugin updates","text_agencyFeaturesAutomatedWPDesc":"Automated WordPress and plugin updates","text_agencyBuyAdditional":"Buy additional websites","text_agencyBuyAdditionalTooltipBody":"Get more websites<br/><b>+ 20K</b> Visits</br><b>+ 5GB</b> SSD Storage<br/><b>3</b> website generations","text_agencyBuyAdditionalCDN":"Buy additional CDN Add-on","text_agencyBuyAdditionalCDNTooltipBody":"Get website security, performance,<br/> and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise. Get a 100GB CDN bandwidth for each additional purchase.","text_enterpriseUltimateTextDesktop":"Get in touch with our<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> team of<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> experts for<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> a dedicated plan<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> tailored<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> for your needs","text_dedicatedHostingTextDesktop":"Get in touch with our<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> team of<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> experts for<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> a dedicated hosting<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> plan tailored for your needs","text_agencyUltimateTextMobile":"Customized<br/> based on<br/> requirements","text_ecommerceEnterpriseFeatures":"Enterprise features","text_ecommerceSecurity":"Enterprise level security","text_ecommerceSecurityDesc":"Get top-notch security measures for your website, including continuous monitoring and stringent firewalls, to ward off cyber threats.","text_ecommerceInstance":"Dedicated instance","text_ecommerceInstanceDesc":"Get your own server instance for faster load times and optimal reliability. Benefit from enhanced performance and customization.","text_ecommerceScaling":"Vertical scaling","text_ecommerceScalingDesc":"We can add additional resources to your current servers in order to help increase the capacity.","text_ecommerceMigration":"Free manual migration","text_ecommerceMigrationDesc":"If needed our top engineers will manually migrate your website to 10Web hosting.","text_ecommerceAdditionalRAM":"Additional PHP workers and RAM","text_ecommerceAdditionalRAMDesc":"Improve your site\'s speed and handling of concurrent requests with extra PHP workers. Extra RAM ensures top performance even for demanding applications.","text_dedicatedHostingPlanTooltip":"Best for high-traffic websites, e-commerce platforms, and resource-heavy sites","text_ecommerceRegenerationTooltipText":"You can increase the plan limits by talking<br/> to your dedicated account manager.","text_ecommerce.title":"Ecommerce","text_ecommerce.orders":"Orders","text_ecommerce.products":"Products","text_ecommerce.customers":"Customers","text_ecommerce.paymentMethods":"Payment methods","text_ecommerce.settings":"Settings","text_ecommerce.analytics":"Analytics","text_ecommerce.marketing":"Marketing","text_ecommerce.payment":"Payment","text_ecommerce.shipping":"Shipping","text_ecommerce.tax":"Tax","text_ecommerce.navigation":"Navigation","text_ecommerce.overview":"Overview","text_ecommerce.payments":"Payments methods","text_ecommerce.transactions":"Transactions","text_ecommerce.payouts":"Payouts","text_ecommerce.emails":"Emails","text_professionalTitle":"Request a developer","text_ecommerce.enableTitle":"The complete toolkit to manage an ecommerce website","text_ecommerce.enableDesc":"Harness the power of 10Web\u2019s AI to create your products, monitor analytics, and manage their entire<br/> lifecycle - from the initial add-to-cart phase through to delivery - all within a single, user-friendly interface.","text_ecommercePremiumWidgets":"Top-tier, customizable widgets and templates specifically<br/> designed to enhance your ecommerce website experience.","text_ecommerceProductPages":"Leverage our AI assistant to create engaging product titles and<br/> descriptions, all aimed at increasing your ecommerce website\u2019s sales.","text_ecommerceDashboard":"An intuitive dashboard for efficient handling and management of your<br/> ecommerce products, providing total control in a few simple clicks.","text_enableEcommerceFeaturesDesc":"Ecommerce features are exclusively available for our<br/> Ecommerce plan users. Upgrade now to make the most<br/> of your online business with our enhanced features.","text_enableEcommerceFeaturesNotAvailableDesc":"Ecommerce features are not available in your plan.<br/> Notify your workspace owner to upgrade<br/> the account to get access.","text_productsAddProductBtn":"Add New Product","text_productsDiscardBtn":"Discard","text_addProductShortDesc":"The short description will</br> appear next to your product.","text_addProductLongDesc":"The long description will</br> appear below your product.","text_addProductAttributesDesc":"Does your product come in different options, </br>like size, color or material? Add them here.\\n","text_addProductTemplateDesc":"A product page template is a pre-designed layout that ensures each product page has a consistent look and feel, matching your store\'s overall design.\\n","text_productsNoMatch":"Does not match any results","text_productsNoProduct":"You don\u2019t have any products.","text_customersNoCustomer":"You don\u2019t have any customers.","text_ordersNoOrder":"You don\u2019t have any orders.","text_customerNoOrder":"Customer does not have any orders.","text_productsStockAmount":"You can add and change the stock amount manually or add quantity to track it </br>automatically.","text_productsPromoteSingle":"Choose a product to promote on the single</br> product page.","text_productsPromoteCart":"Choose a product to promote in the cart.","text_addProductsEditVariants":"Edit variations","text_addProductsViewVariantsDesc":" Edit your variants\u2019 availability, updates the price, or hide the options you don\u2019t want to show.","text_create":"Create","text_professionalPlanUpgradeDesc":"This feature is available exclusively to 10Web Professional plan users.<br/> Upgrade now to get access to 10Web\u2019s developers.","text_professionalPlanPayNowDesc":"This feature is available exclusively to our paid users.<br/> Upgrade now to get access to 10Web\u2019s developers.","text_professionalPlanLockedFeatureDesc":"This feature is only available to paid plans.<br/>To get access to 10Web\u2019s developers please make a payment.","text_professionalPlanRequestSuccessText":"Our team will review your requirements and be in touch<br class=\'small-size\'/> via email to provide further assistance. We look forward<br/> to working with you to achieve your website goals.","text_switchToAnnualSuccessDesc":"Starting from {{date}} you will be charged by annual payments of ${{price}}.","text_welcomeBackDesc":"To get you started, we\u2019re offering 7 more days for free! Your next payment is scheduled for {{date}}. Dive in and make the most of it!","text_disabledPaypalTooltip":"Unfortunately this promo code is only<br/> available with a Credit Card payment.","text_invalidPaypalCouponCodeError":"Unfortunately this promo code is not available with a Paypal payment, please change to Credit Card","text_manualMigrationDialogTitle":"Migrate to 10Web hosting with","text_manualMigrationDialogTitleAccent":"Migration Assistant","text_manualMigrationDialogSubtitle":"Migrate your website from a backup zip file.","text_manualMigrationDialogWarning":"Please follow these steps to receive an optimized copy of your website within a few hours.","text_cdnStatus":"Cloudflare Enterprise can only be </br>enabled on your primary domain.","text_enableEcommerceFeatures":"Enable Ecommerce Features","text_pauseMyAccount":"Pause My Account","text_proceedToCancel":"Proceed to Cancel","text_enableEcommerceFeatures\'":"Enable Ecommerce Features","text_ecommerceSettingsTitle":"Store settings","text_ecommerceWeightUnit":"Weight unit","text_ecommerceDimensionsUnit":"Dimensions unit","text_ecommerceBusinessRegion":"Business region","text_ecommerceCurrency":"Currency","text_requestDeveloperHeader":"Let <span class=\'db-gradient\'>10Web\u2019s professionals</span> build your ideal website, affordably","text_requestDeveloperOneFee":"One fee for a professional website","text_requestDeveloperOneFeeDesc":"Pay a one time fee to get your amazing<br/> website. Get a 10Web hosting for one<br/> year for free.","text_requestDeveloperExcellence":"Excellence and expertise","text_requestDeveloperExcellenceDesc":"Our expert team delivers custom websites<br/> optimized for desktop and mobile, making<br/> your business standout on every device.","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksTitle":"Submit your list of requirements and share your ideas","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksDesc":"Crafting your ideal website begins with understanding your vision. Submit your list of requirements and share<br/> your ideas with us. This ensures that every design element aligns with your goals, creating a digital platform<br/> that truly represents your brand.","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksTitle1":"Expert web development","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksDesc1":"Once we\u2019ve captured the essence of your vision, our skilled developers embark on the journey of bringing<br/> it to life. Using cutting-edge tools and techniques, we transform your ideas into a functional, user-friendly,<br/> and visually stunning website.","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksTitle2":"Continuous maintenance and support","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksDesc2":"The journey doesn\u2019t end once your site goes live. We\u2019re committed to ensuring its smooth operation and relevance.<br/> Get our dedicated maintenance services to guarantee that it continues to meet your evolving business needs.","text_blkOfferFreePlanTitle":"Get <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% off</span><br/> on the 10Web Platform!","text_blkOfferFreePlanDesc":"Try 10Web Pro for free and get all the<br/> premium features at half the price for<br/> the first payment.","text_blkOffer1wfExpiredTitle":"Renew your subscription<br/> with a <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% discount!</span>","text_blkOffer1wfPaidExpiredDesc":"Build, host, and optimize websites with AI<br/> at half the price for the first payment.","text_blkOfferPaidTitle":"Upgrade to a higher plan<br/> with a <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% discount!</span>","text_blkOfferPricingEmptyColumnTitle":"Exclusive<br class=\'ds-hide-tablet\'/> <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% discount,</span><br class=\'ds-hide-tablet ds-show-mobile\'/> only this<br class=\'ds-hide-tablet\'/> Black Friday","text_blkOfferPricingHeaderTitle":"Black Friday Exclusive: <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% off the 10Web Platform</span>","text_blkOfferPricingHeaderDesc":"Try 10Web Pro for free and get all the premium features at half the price<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\'/> for the first payment.","text_blkOfferPricingEmptyColumnTitleForPaid":"Upgrade to a higher plan with a 50% discount: <span class=\'with-gradient\'>Exclusive Black Friday Deal</span>","text_blkOfferPricingEmptyColumnDescForPaid":"Build, host, and optimize websites with AI at half the price for the first payment.","text_menusNoMenus":"You don\u2019t have any menu yet.","text_menusAddMenu":"Add new menu","menu_exists":"This menu name already exists. Please input a different name.","text_submitAndCancel":"Submit & Cancel","text_continueToCancel":"Continue to Cancel","text_addDomainToWebsiteTitle":"Add domain to your website","text_addDomainToWebsiteDesc":"Select a domain, you want to point to your website.","text_addDomainToWebsiteDescEmpty":"You don\u2019t have a registered domain yet","text_addDomainToWebsiteGetDomain":"Get a new domain","text_pointedDomainsTitle":"Pointed domains","text_pointedDomainsDesc":"Point your other domains to 10Web hosting and ensure that the DNS records<br/> for these domains are configured accurately.","text_primaryDomainTooltip":"The primary domain is the main address for your site, the one you want visitors to use to access your website.","text_successfullyCanceledDomainTitle":"Your subscription was successfully cancelled","text_successfullyCanceledDomainDesc":"Thank you for your feedback and using 10Web\u2019s services.","text_successfullyCanceledDomainNotice":"Your domain subscriptions are still active.","text_gotIt":"Got it","text_getNewDomain":"Get a new domain","text_domainsPortfolio":"Domains portfolio","text_findDomain":"Secure your online presence!","text_registeringDomain":"Find a perfect domain for your website","text_registeringDomainFree":"Find and claim your perfect domain up to $30 for Free","text_findDesiredDomain":"Enter domain name or keywords","text_getIt":"Get It","text_forFirstYear":"For the first year","text_forFirstYearMultiYear":"For the first year","text_domainIsAlreadyTaken":"This domain is unavailable","text_domainTotallyFree":"Totally free with your plan for the first year","text_domainTotallyFreeNotLoggedIn":"With all 10Web platform plans for the first year","text_yearlyPrice":"Yearly price","text_yearlyPriceTooltip":"During the next years you will be charged at the corresponding renewal rate, which is currently at {{price}}/year.","text_forFirstYearTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year.","text_forFirstYearMultiYearTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year. <br><br> Minimum {{period}} year registration","text_domainTotallyFreeNotLoggedInTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year.","text_domainTotallyFreeTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year.","text_subDomainDomainsTooltip":"Your site is accessible at this address by default.","text_manageDnsTooltip":"Domain currently uses custom nameservers. In order for the DNS records to have an impact on your website, it is important to ensure that the domain is using 10Web nameservers.","text_toggleAutoRenewTitle":"{{status}} auto-renewal","text_disableAutoRenewDesc":"Turning off auto-renewal poses a risk of losing your domain if you fail to renew it<br> by the expiration date.","text_enableAutoRenewDesc":"Turning on auto-renewal you agree to be automatically charged each year<br> for the price of your domain.","text_extendRenewTitle":"{{method}} domain","text_extendDesc":"This action will extend the billing date for the domain by the chosen renewal length.","text_renewDesc":"This action will extend the billing date for the domain by the chosen renewal length.","text_domainAddedToYourSiteHeader":"Domain added to your site","text_domainAddedToYourSiteDesc":"To manage your DNS records, click the manage DNS from the domains list.","text_domainAddedToYourSiteNotifDesc":"The DNS configuration is set up. It may take up to 24 hours for it to be resolved and</br> activated. Please wait and check the status again later.","text_customDomainAddedToYourSiteDesc":"Replace the default nameservers at your domain registrar with 10Web nameservers to point domain. It can take up to 24 hours to be resolved and activated.","text_customDomainAddDNSRecordsDesc":"Add DNS records to your domain registrar using the IPv4 address provided below.","text_domainDetailsTenWebNSHeader":"Domain currently uses 10Web nameservers","text_domainDetailsTenWebNSDesc":"To manage your DNS records, click the manage DNS from the domains list.","text_domainDetailsCustomNSHeader":"Domain currently uses custom nameservers","text_domainDetailsCustomNSDesc":"To manage your DNS records, navigate to the dashboard of your DNS provider.","text_domainDetailsCustomNSNotice":"You have the option to switch custom nameservers to 10Web nameservers<br/> within the manage nameservers section.","text_domainDetailsCustomNSNCustomDomainNotice":"To point your domain with 10Web nameservers, replace the default nameservers<br/> at your domain registrar with 10Web nameservers.","text_domainNotPointedIsTenWebDomain":"Point domain","text_domainNotPointedIsTenWebDomainDesc":"The domain currently uses 10Web nameservers.<br/> To manage your DNS records, click the manage DNS from the domains list.","text_domainNotPointedIsTenWebDomainAndNotNS":"Your domain currently uses custom nameservers.","text_domainNotPointedIsNotTenWebDomainAndNS":"Your domain currently uses 10Web nameservers, but the DNS records is not pointing to 10Web hosting.","text_domainNotPointedDNSNotice":"DNS records can take up to 24 hours to be resolved. Please ensure there are no mistakes in the DNS configuration and check again later.","text_domainNotPointedTenWebNS":"To point the domain, update the DNS records through the manage DNS with the following:","text_domainNotPointedCustomNS":"To point the domain, switch the custom nameservers to 10Web nameservers from the manage nameservers. Alternatively, you can add the following records to your DNS provider:","text_domainNotPointedZoneIssues":"Add DNS records to your domain registrar using the IPv4 address provided below.","text_domainNotPointedNotTenWebDomainDesc":"Replace the default nameservers at your domain registrar with 10Web nameservers.","text_domainNotPointedNotTenWebDomainNotice":"<b>Domain isn\u2019t pointed yet.</b> DNS records can take up to 24 hours to be resolved. Please ensure there are no mistakes in the DNS configuration and check again later.","text_domainNotPointedNotTenWebDomainInfo":"Alternatively, you can add DNS records to your registrar using an IPv4 address provided below:","text_renewNow":"Renew Now","text_renewCost":"Renewal cost","text_renewsOn":"Renews on","text_expiresOn":"Expires on","text_linkedWebsite":"Linked website","text_noLinkedWebsite":"There is no 10Web website linked to this domain","text_domainPrivacy":"Domain Privacy is","text_address":"Address","text_contactInfo":"Contact info","text_contactInfoDesc":"This info is used for all contact types:<br> registrant, administrative, technical.","text_editContactInfo":"Edit contact information","text_useForAll":"Use for all contact types","text_toggleRenew":"Turn {{value}} auto-renewal","text_domainPrivacyBlocked":"The domain privacy option is not available for this domain.","text_domainPrivacyCanNotSwitch":"Domain privacy cannot be switched off for this domain.","text_domainPrivacyDisable":"If you disable Domain Privacy, your contact information<br> will be visible in the public WHOIS directory.","text_domainPrivacyEnable":"If you enable Domain Privacy, your contact<br> information will be kept private and won\u2019t<br> be visible in the public WHOIS directory.","text_approvalNeeded":"Approval needed","text_approvalMessage":"Approval is required to update contact information. Please review and confirm the changes from the email sent to {{email}}.","text_approvalSubMessage":"The contact info will be updated upon your approval.","text_approvalEmailMessage":"To change the email, approval is needed from both the current and new owners. Kindly review and confirm the changes through the emails sent to both the current and new email addresses. The domain transfer will only proceed upon receiving approval from both emails.","text_approvalWarn":"Email verification might be necessary if the new owner\u2019s email hasn\u2019t been verified.<br> In this case they will receive an additional email for the verification process.","text_removeZoneWarn":"Your site will no longer be accessible through <strong>{{domainName}}</strong>.<br> It will still be accessible through your other domains.","text_emailVerification":"Email verification is required","text_emailVerificationMessage":"To activate your domain, verify the email sent from donotreply@secureserver.net <br> to your account email.","text_domainPurchasedMessage":"Domain is successfully registered and will be automatically pointed to your website.","text_domainPurchasedMessageNeedVerification":"<strong>Email verification is required!</strong> To activate your purchased domain, you should verify the email sent from donotreply@secureserver.net","text_domainPurchasedHeader":"Congratulations, the {{domainName}} is now yours!","text_domainPurchasedNotificationMessage":"After completing the verification, the domain will be pointed to your website.","text_extend":"Extend now","text_domainInProgress":"Domain registration is in progress","text_domainInProgressMess":"Domain activation may take up to 10 minutes. Please wait and check the status again later.<br> If it\u2019s taking too long, please contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\' class=\'ds-link unset-size\'>Customer care team</a> for help","text_myDomainPortfolio":"My domains portfolio","text_NSTooltipText":"Nameservers link a domain to IP addresses in a user-friendly manner for directing internet traffic. This configuration determines where you edit your DNS.","text_noPermissionTitle":"No permission","text_noPermissionDescription":"This action is not available for your role. Please contact<br/>the workspace owner or administrator for assistance.","text_convertAISignUpPopUpDesc":"Sign up and insert a URL to recreate a website on 10Web.","text_businessNameGeneratorSignUpPopUpDesc":"Create your account to access your AI-generated website and start customizing:","text_migrateAISignUpPopUpDesc":"Create your account to migrate your website to 10Web","text_convertAISignUpPopUpTitle":"Convert a non-WordPress site to WordPress with AI","text_businessNameGeneratorSignUpPopUpTitle":"Your brand is ready to launch!","text_builder2SignUpPopUpDesc":"Create your account to generate a fully customized<br/>website with tailored content and images.","text_builder2SignUpPopUpTitle":"Create a new<br/>website with AI","text_showBothTLSText1":"Get an exclusive deal for over 20 websites or<br/> high traffic/resource-heavy websites.","text_dedicatedTLSText1":"Get a special offer for high traffic or<br/> resource-heavy e-commerce websites","text_agencyTLSText1":"Get an exclusive deal for over 20 websites","text_dedicatedTLSText2":"Get personalized, continuous support for<br/> unmatched reliability and performance of<br/> your e-commerce website","text_showBothTLSText2":"Get personalized, continuous support from our customer success team","text_upgradeWithDomain":"Get 7 days of 10Web Pro plans","text_freeDomainTitle":"Get your ideal <span class=\'with-gradient\'>domain for Free</span>","text_freeDomainDesc":"Now you can choose and get a free custom domain for up to $30 with all 10Web Pro Plans.","text_freeDomainDescPaid":"Choose and get a free custom domain for up to $30 with your 10Web subscription.","text_chooseYourDomain":"Choose Your Domain","text_getFreeCustomDomain":"Get Free Custom Domain","text_domainOfferTitle":"Get your custom<br/>domain for Free","text_domainOfferProDesc":"Choose and get a free domain for<br/>up to $30 with your 10Web subscription.","text_domainOfferFreeDesc":"Choose and get a free domain<br/>for up to $30 with all 10Web Pro Plans.","text_select":"Select","text_agencyOfferTitle":"<span>Exclusive Deal:</span> Get an exclusive deal for 20+ websites or high traffic/resource-heavy websites","text_websiteCustomizerNotification":"This is not the final website, but a mockup to preview its look and feel.","text_agencyTLSText2":"Get personalized, continuous support for<br/> easy scaling and management of your sites","text_payengineOnboardingSubmittedTitle":"Successfully submitted","text_payengineOnboardingSubmittedDescription":"Your payment is currently pending and may take up to 24 hours to process.<br/>You will be notified via email once the process is complete.","text_payengineTaxCalculationActivatedTitle":"Successfully activated tax calculation","text_payengineTaxCalculationActivatedDescription":"You can start charging tax on your products by either adding rates manually<br/>or setting up an automated tax.","text_payengineTestModeEnabledTitle":"Successfully activated test mode","text_payengineTestModeEnabledDescription":"You start processing test orders and go through the checkout experience.<br/>For more info on how to make test payments, check the knowledgebase.","text_payengineEnablePaymentsTitle":"{{mode}} 10Web Payments","text_payengineEnablePaymentsDescription":"This will {{mode}} 10Web Payments from your website checkout page.","text_payengineSwitchModeTitle":"Switching to {{mode}}","text_payengineSwitchModeLiveDescription":"You are about to switch to live 10Web Payments.<br/> Real financial transactions will occur.","text_payengineSwitchModeTestDescription":"You are about to switch to test mode. This means no real<br/> financial transactions will take place.","text_outlineGenerationFinalizeBottomDesc":"More than <span class=\'db-blue\'>1 million</span> successfully<br/> generated websites","text_questionTourStartTitle":"Take our quick tour to learn how to customize<br/> and generate your future website.","text_questionTourStepOneTitle":"Customize your website sections","text_questionTourStepOneDesc":"A section description acts as a prompt for the AI to<br/> build the corresponding section.<br/> </br>  - Modify any section by editing the prompt </br>- Describe if you want images, buttons or other info </br>- Ensure titles reflect descriptions </br>- Add, reorder, or remove sections easily","text_questionTourStepTwoTitle":"Style your future website","text_questionTourStepTwoDesc":"Play with fonts, colors, and styles to craft the<br/> look of your future website.<br/> </br>Instantly preview it on a demo example.","text_questionTourStepThreeTitle":"Generate your fully customized website","text_questionTourStepThreeDesc":"Generate your personalized website with tailored<br/> content and images, ready for editing with our drag<br/> & drop editor.","text_backup_schedule_dialog_title":"Backup scheduling","text_backup_schedule_dialog_desc":"Set the frequency and start time for automatic backups.","text_backup_zip_download_notice_old":"Preparing the ZIP file may take some time. We will email you the download link once it is ready.","text_backup_zip_download_notice":"Please note that the link will be available for 12 hours.","text_backup_zip_download_desc":"Preparing the ZIP file may take some time. We will email you the download link once it\'s ready.<br/> You can also find the link on the dashboard.","text_backup_restore_desc":"Restoration time may vary depending on the size of the backup. You will be notified via email<br/> when the restoration is complete.","text_backup_restore_notice":"Avoid working on website during restoration!","text_backupHeaderSubtitle":"We store incremental backups created in the past 30 days, including files and database.","text_backupHeaderAction":"Create Backup","text_limitAddSection":"Maximum of {{count}} sections allowed.<br/> To add a new section, delete<br/> an existing one.","text_limitAddPage":"Maximum of {{count}} pages allowed.<br/> To add a new page, delete<br/> an existing one.","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText":"\u201cMediaGo is a startup that provides a mobile app for instant<br/> access to news and entertainment. The app is designed to be<br/> easy to navigate and streamlined for quick use.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText1":"\u201cOur cozy family restaurant serves delicious home-style Italian meals, accompanied by warm hospitality, creating the perfect<br/> atmosphere for enjoying quality time with loved ones.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText2":"\u201cOur tech blog covering the latest trends, innovations, and gadgets,<br/> offering expert insights and analysis to keep readers informed<br/> on the evolving tech landscape.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText3":"\u201cAs a full stack developer with over 5 years of experience in web<br/> development, I specialize in creating responsive, user-friendly<br/> websites and stay passionate about exploring new web technologies.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText4":"\u201cAn online music school providing an extensive selection of courses,<br/> live interactive lessons, and personalized instruction from expert<br/> musicians, designed to cater to learners of all skill levels and musical interests.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText1":"\u201cWe sell handmade items, from artisan jewelry to unique home decor, each crafted with care and creativity.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText2":"\u201cWe provide products for pets, including comfortable beds, nutritious food, and engaging toys to support pet wellness.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText3":"\u201cWe offer tech essentials like laptops, smart devices, and accessories, all designed for everyday functionality and innovation.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText4":"\u201cWe sell wellness products, including skincare and aromatherapy items, to promote relaxation and self-care.\u201d","text_onboardingFirstStep":"Answer a few questions and our AI will generate a personalized website<br/>with tailored content and images.\u201d","text_emailCampaignTitle":"Starting Fresh<br/>with AI Builder 2.0","text_emailCampaignDesc":"<div class=\'mb20\'>To experience the new AI Builder 2.0, we\u2019ll need to erase your<br/> current generated website and start the flow from scratch.</div>Ready to build your website with our enhanced,<br/> fully customizable AI-Powered 